hem. (If a permanent with a stun counter would become untapped, remove one from it instead.)', 'Tap target creature an opponent controls and put three stun counters on it. Scry 2. (If a permanent with a stun counter would become untapped, remove one from it instead.)', 'Tap up to one target creature. Scry 1, then draw a card.', 'Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn. Scry 1.', 'Target creature gets +1/+3 and gains reach until end of turn. Untap it.', 'Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn. Create a Monster Role token attached to it. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has trample.)', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn. That creature gets an additional -3/-3 until end of turn if you controlled a Faerie as you cast this spell.', 'Target creature you control gains hexproof until end of turn. Create a Royal Role token attached to that creature. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has ward {1}.)', "Target creature's owner puts it on the top or bottom of their library.", 'Target opponent discards two cards. Create a Wicked Role token attached to up to one target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1. When this Aura is put into a graveyard, each opponent loses 1 life.)', "Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it. That player discards that card. If you don't control a Faerie, exile a card from your hand.", 'The second spell you cast each turn costs {1} less to cast.\\nCelebration — At the beginning of combat on your turn, if two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control this turn, target creature you control gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature that attacked this turn.\\nDraw three cards.', 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature that attacked this turn.\\nWitchstalker Frenzy deals 5 damage to target creature.', "This spell costs {2} less to cast if your life total is 5 or less.\\nExile target creature or planeswalker. Search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for any number of cards with the same name as that permanent and exile them. That player shuffles, then draws a card for each card exiled from their hand this way.", 'This spell costs {X} less to cast, where X is the number of cards in your graveyard that are instant cards, sorcery cards, and/or have an Adventure.', 'Trample', 'Trample\\nPermanent spells you cast that have an Adventure cost {1} less to cast.', "Trample\\nWhen Gruff Triplets enters the battlefield, if it isn't a token, create two tokens that are copies of it.\\nWhen Gruff Triplets dies, put a number of +1/+1 counters equal to its power on each creature you control named Gruff Triplets.", 'Trample\\nWhen Mosswood Dreadknight dies, you may cast it from your graveyard as an Adventure until the end of your next turn.', 'Trample\\nWhenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {2}. If you do, return Redtooth Vanguard from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Trample\\nWhenever you cast a spell with mana value 5 or greater, put a +1/+1 counter on Tempest Hart.', 'Until end of turn, target creature you control gains "When this creature dies, return it to the battlefield tapped under its owner\'s control, then create a Wicked Role token attached to it." (Enchanted creature gets +1/+1. When this Aura is put into a graveyard, each opponent loses 1 life.)', "Until end of turn, target creature you control has base power and toughness 4/4 and gains flying and hexproof. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'Up to one target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn. You create a 1/1 black Rat creature token with "This creature can\'t block."', 'Vigilance\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, you may pay {1}. When you do, create a Sorcerer Role token attached to target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature attacks, scry 1.")', 'Vigilance\\nHowling Galefang has haste as long as you own a card in exile that has an Adventure.', 'Vigilance\\nWhenever Icewrought Sentry attacks, you may pay {1}{U}. When you do, tap target creature an opponent controls.\\nWhenever you tap an untapped creature an opponent controls, Icewrought Sentry gets +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Vigilance\\nWhenever an enchantment you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on Savior of the Sleeping.', 'Vigilance\\n{T}: Spells you cast this turn that are white and/or blue cost {X} less to cast, where X is the amount of life you gained this turn. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'Ward {2} (Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it unless that player pays {2}.)\\n{3}{G}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Toadstool Admirer.', 'When Candy Trail enters the battlefield, scry 2.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Candy Trail: You gain 3 life and draw a card.', 'When Crystal Grotto enters the battlefield, scry 1.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', "When Eriette's Tempting Apple enters the battlefield, gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Eriette's Tempting Apple: You gain 3 life.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Eriette's Tempting Apple: Target opponent loses 3 life.", 'When Experimental Confectioner enters the battlefield, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")\\nWhenever you sacrifice a Food, create a 1/1 black Rat creature token with "This creature can\'t block."', 'When Extraordinary Journey enters the battlefield, exile up to X target creatures. For each of those cards, its owner may play it for as long as it remains exiled.\\nWhenever one or more nontoken creatures enter the battlefield, if one or more of them entered from exile or was cast from exile, you draw a card. This ability triggers only once each turn.', "When Faunsbane Troll enters the battlefield, create a Monster Role token attached to it. (Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has trample.)\\n{1}, Sacrifice an Aura attached to Faunsbane Troll: Faunsbane Troll fights target creature you don't control. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead. Activate only as a sorcery.", "When Fell Horseman dies, put it on the bottom of its owner's library.", 'When Food Coma enters the battlefield, exile target creature an opponent controls until Food Coma leaves the battlefield. Create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")', 'When Gingerbread Hunter enters the battlefield, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")', 'When Glass Casket enters the battlefield, exile target creature an opponent controls with mana value 3 or less until Glass Casket leaves the battlefield.', 'When Greta, Sweettooth Scourge enters the battlefield, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")\\n{G}, Sacrifice a Food: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. Activate only as a sorcery.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifice a Food: You draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'When Hopeful Vigil enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 white Knight creature token with vigilance.\\nWhen Hopeful Vigil is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, scry 2.\\n{2}{W}: Sacrifice Hopeful Vigil.', 'When Hopeless Nightmare enters the battlefield, each opponent discards a card and loses 2 life.\\nWhen Hopeless Nightmare is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, scry 2.\\n{2}{B}: Sacrifice Hopeless Nightmare.', "When Imodane's Recruiter enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain haste until end of turn.", "When Lord Skitter's Blessing enters the battlefield, create a Wicked Role token attached to target creature you control. (Enchanted creature gets +1/+1. When this Aura is put into a graveyard, each opponent loses 1 life.)\\nAt the beginning of your draw step, if you control an enchanted creature, you lose 1 life and you draw an additional card.", 'When Lord Skitter\'s Butcher enters the battlefield, choose one —\\n• Create a 1/1 black Rat creature token with "This creature can\'t block."\\n• You may sacrifice another creature. If you do, scry 2, then draw a card.\\n• Creatures you control gain menace until end of turn.', 'When Merry Bards enters the battlefield, you may pay {1}. When you do, create a Young Hero Role token attached to target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature has "Whenever this creature attacks, if its toughness is 3 or less, put a +1/+1 counter on it.")', 'When Mintstrosity dies, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")', 'When Night of the Sweets\' Revenge enters the battlefield, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")\\nFoods you control have "{T}: Add {G}."\\n{5}{G}{G}, Sacrifice Night of the Sweets\' Revenge: Creatures you control get +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of Foods you control. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'When Prophetic Prism enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'When Protective Parents dies, create a Young Hero Role token attached to up to one target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature has "Whenever this creature attacks, if its toughness is 3 or less, put a +1/+1 counter on it.")', 'When Provisions Merchant enters the battlefield, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")\\nWhenever Provisions Merchant attacks, you may sacrifice a Food. If you do, attacking creatures get +1/+1 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'When Redcap Thief enters the battlefield, create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', 'When Redtooth Genealogist enters the battlefield, create a Royal Role token attached to another target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has ward {1}.)', "When Sentinel of Lost Lore enters the battlefield, choose one or more —\\n• Return target card you own in exile that has an Adventure to your hand.\\n• Put target card you don't own in exile that has an Adventure on the bottom of its owner's library.\\n• Exile target player's graveyard.", 'When Sharae of Numbing Depths enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls and put a stun counter on it. (If a permanent with a stun counter would become untapped, remove one from it instead.)\\nWhenever you tap one or more untapped creatures your opponents control, draw a card. This ability triggers only once each turn.', 'When Shrouded Shepherd enters the battlefield, target creature you control gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'When Solitary Sanctuary enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls and put a stun counter on it. (If a permanent with a stun counter would become untapped, remove one from it instead.)\\nWhenever you tap an untapped creature an opponent controls, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.', "When Soul-Guide Lantern enters the battlefield, exile target card from a graveyard.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Soul-Guide Lantern: Exile each opponent's graveyard.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Soul-Guide Lantern: Draw a card.", 'When Spiteful Hexmage enters the battlefield, create a Cursed Role token attached to target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature is 1/1.)', "When Stockpiling Celebrant enters the battlefield, you may return another target nonland permanent you control to its owner's hand. If you do, scry 2.", 'When Sweettooth Witch enters the battlefield, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")\\n{2}, Sacrifice a Food: Target player loses 2 life.', 'When Syr Armont, the Redeemer enters the battlefield, create a Monster Role token attached to another target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has trample.)\\nEnchanted creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'When Tough Cookie enters the battlefield, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")\\n{2}{G}: Target noncreature artifact you control becomes a 4/4 artifact creature until end of turn.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Tough Cookie: You gain 3 life.', 'When Twisted Sewer-Witch enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 black Rat creature token with "This creature can\'t block." Then for each Rat you control, create a Wicked Role token attached to that Rat. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1. When this Aura is put into a graveyard, each opponent loses 1 life.)', 'When Unassuming Sage enters the battlefield, you may pay {2}. If you do, create a Sorcerer Role token attached to it. (Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature attacks, scry 1.")', 'When Up the Beanstalk enters the battlefield and whenever you cast a spell with mana value 5 or greater, draw a card.', 'When Voracious Vermin enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 black Rat creature token with "This creature can\'t block."\\nWhenever another creature you control dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Voracious Vermin.', 'When Woodland Acolyte enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'Whenever Blossoming Tortoise enters the battlefield or attacks, mill three cards, then return a land card from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.\\nActivated abilities of lands you control cost {1} less to activate.\\nLand creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Whenever Charging Hooligan attacks, it gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each attacking creature. If a Rat is attacking, Charging Hooligan gains trample until end of turn.', 'Whenever Intrepid Trufflesnout attacks alone, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")', 'Whenever Picnic Ruiner attacks while you control a creature with power 4 or greater, Picnic Ruiner gains double strike until end of turn.', 'Whenever Totentanz, Swarm Piper or another nontoken creature you control dies, create a 1/1 black Rat creature token with "This creature can\'t block."\\n{1}{B}: Target attacking Rat you control gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Whenever a Rat you control becomes blocked, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a source you control deals noncombat damage to an opponent, you may exile that many cards from the top of your library. You may play those cards this turn.', "Whenever a token enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Wildwood Mentor.\\nWhenever Wildwood Mentor attacks, another target attacking creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is Wildwood Mentor's power.", 'Whenever an Aura enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.', 'Whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, scry 1.\\n{2}{W}: Slumbering Keepguard gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each enchantment you control.', 'Whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, tap target creature an opponent controls.', 'Whenever an enchantment you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, create a 1/1 black Rat creature token with "This creature can\'t block."\\n{1}{B}: Warehouse Tabby gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Whenever an enchantment you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Bird creature token with flying.', 'Whenever an enchantment you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', 'Whenever an enchantment you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, each opponent loses 1 life.', 'Whenever an instant or sorcery spell you control that targets only a single creature deals damage to that creature, Imodane deals that much damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell with mana value 3 or less, Scalding Viper deals 1 damage to that player.', 'Whenever another Rat enters the battlefield under your control, exile up to one target card from an opponent\'s graveyard.\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, create a 1/1 black Rat creature token with "This creature can\'t block."', 'Whenever one or more artifacts enter the battlefield under your control, put two +1/+1 counters on Elvish Archivist. This ability triggers only once each turn.\\nWhenever one or more enchantments enter the battlefield under your control, draw a card. This ability triggers only once each turn.', "Whenever you cast a spell that's white, blue, black, or red, put a +1/+1 counter on Questing Druid.", 'Whenever you cast a spell with mana value 5 or greater, put two +1/+1 counters on Stormkeld Prowler.', 'Whenever you cast a spell with mana value 5 or greater, tap target creature an opponent controls and put a stun counter on it.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a Sorcerer Role token attached to up to one other target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature attacks, scry 1.")', 'Whenever you cast your first instant or sorcery spell each turn, Aquatic Alchemist gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever you tap an untapped creature an opponent controls, you may pay {1}. When you do, choose one —\\n• Create a 4/4 white and blue Elemental creature token.\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.\\n• Scry 2, then draw a card.', 'You may cast Asinine Antics as though it had flash if you pay {2} more to cast it.\\nFor each creature your opponents control, create a Cursed Role token attached to that creature. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature is 1/1.)', 'You may discard a card. If you do, draw two cards.\\nCreate a Wicked Role token attached to up to one target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1. When this Aura is put into a graveyard, each opponent loses 1 life.)', 'You may look at the top card of your library any time.\\nOnce each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library. (You still pay its costs. Timing rules still apply.)', "You may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to activate abilities of creatures you control.\\nCreatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them have all activated abilities of all creature cards exiled with Agatha's Soul Cauldron.\\n{T}: Exile target card from a graveyard. When a creature card is exiled this way, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.", '{1}, Sacrifice Embereth Veteran: Create a Young Hero Role token attached to another target creature. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature has "Whenever this creature attacks, if its toughness is 3 or less, put a +1/+1 counter on it.")', '{1}, Sacrifice Living Lectern: Draw a card. Create a Sorcerer Role token attached to up to one other target creature you control. Activate only as a sorcery. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature attacks, scry 1.")', '{1}, Sacrifice a Food: Hollow Scavenger gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', "{1}, {T}: Tap target creature. This ability costs {1} less to activate during your turn.\\n{3}, Sacrifice Hylda's Crown of Winter: Draw a card for each tapped creature your opponents control.", '{1}: Merfolk Coralsmith gets +1/-1 until end of turn.\\nWhen Merfolk Coralsmith dies, scry 2.', "{1}{G}: Verdant Outrider can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less this turn.", "{2}, {T}: Choose one that hasn't been chosen —\\n• Three Bowls of Porridge deals 2 damage to target creature.\\n• Tap target creature.\\n• Sacrifice Three Bowls of Porridge. You gain 3 life.", "{2}, {T}: Choose target enchantment you control that doesn't have the same name as another permanent you control. Create a token that's a copy of it, except it isn't legendary. If the token is an Aura, untap Yenna, Redtooth Regent, then scry 2. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{2}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card. Create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', '{2}{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\nWhenever a legendary creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may have The Irencrag become a legendary Equipment artifact named Everflame, Heroes\' Legacy. If you do, it gains equip {3} and "Equipped creature gets +3/+3" and loses all other abilities.', '{T}: Add {G}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', "{T}: Add {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, Discard a card: Return Bramble Familiar to its owner's hand.", '{T}: Add {G}{U}. Spend this mana only to cast spells with mana value 5 or greater or spells with {X} in their mana costs.\\n{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.']
flavor: ['"...so the knight stabbed the troll, the troll threw the knight off the bridge, and they both forgot about the sword."', '"An intact volume of *Tales of the Fae*? The king will be pleased."', '"And what makes you think Lady Grandsquall wants to see *you*, little one?"', '"Busy as a bumblesheep"\\n—Faerie expression meaning "asleep"', '"Cold iron\'s all you need to hold a faerie. The charms are mostly decorative."\\n—Eulyn, Edgewall peddler', '"Don\'t you mean \'poisonous\'? There\'s no such thing as a venomous—AGGHHH!"', '"Fascinating. It says here that dragons cannot read."', '"From here, hit the antique gong, ricochet off the suit of armor, and get Gunrudd on the nose? Is that all?"', '"Get back here, vile rodent! I was almost done cursing that ring!"', '"Get up and dance! Let your feet thunder like forgehammers!"', '"Hold this for me."\\n—Totentanz, swarm piper', '"Human feet aren\'t inferior to hooves for climbing. It\'s their plodding, mistrustful personalities that hold them back."', '"Hush now. I need your beauty sleep."', '"I have to hand it to you, Yorvo. Since your pet showed up, not a single smallfolk has even made it to the door of my vault."\\n—Beluna Grandsquall', '"I point, you club!"', '"I smell frosting. Ready your weapons!"\\n—Greta, Scourge of Sweettooth', '"I\'m getting the sense we shouldn\'t expect a warm welcome."\\n—Kellan', '"I\'m just as deadly during the day."', '"I\'ve never known cold like it. It burned like fire and bit like an adder\'s fangs. Call me a coward if you wish, but I won\'t go back there."\\n—Syr Lydel, knight of Vantress', '"It\'s easy to cry \'For glory!\' and charge those who disagree with you. But it takes finesse to turn enemies into allies rather than corpses."', '"It\'s entirely peaceful, as long as you don\'t try to pet it, pen it, take its food, take its hide, sit on its grass, or dress it up in colorful garb for human holidays."\\n—Sturwynn, Boundary Lands ranger', '"It\'s not so bad. All you have to do is keep from looking down."\\n—Troyan, to Kellan and Ruby', '"Just ... stay in there ... for one ... second!"', '"Look at me, everyone! I\'m a High Fae! Watch me do important High Fae things!"', '"Look! Another one! Who cares what Mother said? We\'ll be home before she gets back."\\n—Daniela, Edgewall youth', '"Looks like you need a bigger net, mister fae-catcher."', '"Most dreams reveal but fragments of what you could be. Only nightmares can show you who you truly are."\\n—Ashiok', '"My orders were to capture you alive. They didn\'t specify in what form."', '"My people are both bloom and thorn."', '"My, what big paws y—"\\n—Thomas the woodsman, last words', '"No more days withering at a negotiating table with my brother. I will rebuild Eldraine myself—the old way, with power."', '"Not bad. If only you had branches."', '"Okay. First I\'ll calm the elementals. Then I\'ll put out the fire. Then I\'ll unflood the basement. Then I\'ll do the chores *myself*."', '"Shiny is best. Then sharp. Sharp is good. Anything else is basically trash."', '"Soon the rats are gonna run this town, so I\'m gonna run with them!"', '"Stay your blades, peasants."', '"Stolen treasures can be reclaimed, but stolen knowledge is yours forever."\\n—Alela', '"The Kindly Lord does not issue invitations to their court lightly. I suggest you accept."', '"The archmage Valya? Why yes, I do believe I\'ve heard of her."', '"The difference between mischief and malice? Numbers."', '"The fire of Embereth will never be doused!"', '"The realm needs a ruler, not a boy playing king."', '"The streets of Ravnica were stifling. Eldraine is an endless adventure paved in gold."', '"The trolls have your scent, traveler. Hurry on, and let me take care of them."', '"The wilds are unpredictable. Rivers change course, trees shuffle and bend, rocks split and scurry. But mark my words, traveler—the main thing that\'ll change out there is *you*."\\n—Sturwynn, Boundary Lands ranger', '"There is a fierce joy in losing yourself to savagery, and a bitter pain in regaining your senses afterward. You could never understand."', '"Time for your just desserts, redcap scum!"', '"Try some pie! Your brother helped make it, and he really poured his heart into it."', '"Was there a fearsome witch around here? Or was it a cruel dragon? The tales were confu—oh no."\\n—Osval, adventurer', '"We spin and spin to keep us busy, but somehow you\'re the one who\'s dizzy."', '"Weary traveler, follow me. The night is a cage, and my light is the key."', '"What\'s that, Snappers? Yes, you\'re right! It *was* very rude of the innkeeper to throw us out!"', '"What? I\'m saving it for later."', '"Where do they keep coming from?!"', '"Who\'ll never amount to anything now, Father?"', '"Why\'re you vermin so daft? This is a warehouse full of bricks. BRICKS! You can\'t eat bricks."', '"Wooden swords rot. Steel axes rust. But coral only grows."', '"You are but learning to walk in a world where I fly, mortal."', '"You are no monster to me, my love."', '"You only find out who was hunting who when one of you is dead."', '"You\'re doing a splendid job, my noble stitched friend. Not a single bird has attacked us!"\\n—Troyan', '"You\'ve wasted your life. Let\'s see if I can do any better with it."', 'A winged dawn dispels the terrors of night.', "After the royal nanny had finished his dull, droning recital of the prince and princess's bedtime story, their secret friend emerged and the real story began.", 'Agatha befriended the beasts of the wilds, and under her influence they grew bolder ... and more savage. Some herbivores developed a taste for flesh.', 'Amalgamations of many childhood nightmares stalked the realm of dreams, feeding on the collective terror of all those trapped in the Wicked Slumber.', 'Among the rats, he found the acceptance the human world never gave him.', 'An autonomous, self-loading catapult had seemed like such a good idea.', "As Hylda watched Ruby drag Kellan's unconscious form through the cold, Hylda felt something she hadn't felt in a long time: compassion.", 'At first, Johann was annoyed that the library had decided to reorganize itself. But he had to admit that storing the cookbooks in the cauldron made a certain kind of sense.', "Attracted by the quiet of Hylda's realm, reindeer herds moved in and made themselves at home near the palace of ice.", 'Beluna makes a habit of "liberating" valuables from the world below, from priceless artifacts to historic buildings.', 'Clawing for scraps and driven mad by hunger, the individual rats became a writhing mass.', "Cloud eaters, heaven tillers, beanstalk wurms—he favors prey worthy of a giant's appetite.", 'Dreams of a realm united gave him strength even in sleep.', 'Dying in your sleep is never peaceful when Ashiok is involved.', 'Each night, the elves of Redtooth Keep transform into feral, monstrous beasts.', "Even in the grip of Hylda's unnatural cold, something in Kellan felt bright as spring, something that poured into the empty hilts he'd been given by Talion and formed thorn-sharp blades of light.", 'Even in the grip of the Wicked Slumber, the High Fae princess Obyra is a blademaster of unrivaled skill.', 'Even lost in slumber, the citizens of Ardenvale dream of a tireless protector standing guard over their homes.', 'For every rat she kills, ten more take its place.', 'Giggles of delight may be the last thing you hear.', "Hardened by the Phyrexian invasion, Will's knights starved the nightmares of the thing they craved most: fear.", 'He left knighthood behind to heal the scars of the invasion.', 'He rides like thunder and strikes like lightning.', 'Heavy is the head that wears the vase.', "High King Kenrith's armies followed him into the afterlife, ready to charge at his command.", 'Hylda built an ice statuary from all those who couldn\'t understand "go away."', "If the sugary abominations of Sweettooth Village were ever under someone's control, that time is long past.", 'In retrospect, using storm magic against a storm giant was not the wisest strategy.', 'In their rotting minds, they still quest for virtue and glory.', "It takes a lot to pull a master blacksmith from their work, but Maurice couldn't pass up an invitation to a lavish Delverhaugh feast.", 'It was the first and last time anyone attempted to levy a tax on the witches of Dunbarrow.', "Johann's conjecture about draconic fire dispelling rainwater elementals proved to be correct. Now he just needed a way to dispel draconic fire.", "Kellan heard Agatha howl when he slammed into her, heard her scream as she fell into the cauldron, but couldn't afford to think about the implications just yet.", 'Kellan stepped from his village into a strange world where trees bore jeweled fruit. A regal, inhuman voice rang in his ears: "Tell me, brave hero, are you true of heart?"', 'Kellan struck out on pure instinct, and his conjured blades cleaved through the icy guardians as though they were nothing but air.', 'Lord Skitter promised the starving rats of Edgewall that they would never go hungry again.', 'Luckily for the plummeting Johann, the hydroloft spell was one he had actually mastered.', 'Mines that once rang with the strikes of pickaxes now echo with shouts of reckless glee.', 'Neither the sharpest thorns nor the foulest beasts would stop her from finding her brother.', "Neva's dreams were haunted by memories of the invasion—oil-black tendrils grasping at her through the mist. Or . . . was this something new?", 'Obyra sleepwalks through the wilds, hunting for worthy opponents.', "Obyra's devoted servants shrieked as their sleeping mistress slashed at them, unseeing.", "One way or another, dwarven meals end up in someone's stomach.", "Ranks of sleeping Ardenvale knights filled Eriette's throne room, ready to defend their witch-queen with unthinking devotion.", 'She can drive off any threat, from owl to hunter to Phyrexian monster.', "She stayed by her master's side, leaving only to hunt. She would guard him until he woke, however long it took.", "She wasn't much for self-reflection.", "So many birds, yet the air was still and empty of song. Part of Syr Damon knew something wasn't right, but it was a far-off worry, unimportant and soon forgotten.", 'Some family trees are thornier than others.', 'Some knights who survived the invasion have forsaken what remains of their courts. The newly formed Verdant Order has sworn to defend the last untouched parts of the wilds.', 'Sometimes, "as fast as you can" isn\'t quite fast enough.', "The Wicked Slumber saved Eldraine from Phyrexia's grasp, but instead of fading when the invasion ended, it continued to spread.", "The assembled partygoers fell silent and stared. As the helmet came to a clattering stop, the only sound was Ash's distant footsteps.", 'The curse of Redtooth Keep could only be broken by a mystical rose that blooms in moonlight.', "The farmer was amazed to see the penny vanish into thin air, but the goose knew he'd just slipped it to the faerie.", 'The fauns of the Tanglespan are adept at using the precarious environment against larger opponents.', 'The louder they scream, the harder he laughs.', 'The mayor sent hounds to root out Lord Skitter, but their loyalty was easily bought with a handful of bones.', 'The sentry watched impassively, its spear unmoving. One by one, the would-be adventurers stumbled and fell, frostbitten, to the ground.', 'The witchstalkers circled the armored figure, drawn to the corrupting stink of dark magic. Kellan and Ruby fled to the sound of savage howls and snapping jaws.', 'They dash—then dine.', 'They help ensure that the forges of the dwarves are always squeaky clean.', "To the giant spiders of Dunbarrow, there's little difference between fly and faerie.", 'To the giants, it was one little gem among thousands. But to Kylene, it was a haul that would feed her family for years.', 'Too much sugar is bad for your health.', 'Totentanz\'s song had no lyrics, but the rats understood it nonetheless. "You own this land," it said. "You deserve to feast."', 'Townsfolk tapped their feet and hummed along, unwittingly amplifying the tune that would summon their doom.', 'What little light filters down through frost and fathoms is refracted into a million rainbow shards.', "When Beluna's pets escape Stormkeld, villages fall and new Everstalks rise.", "When Hylda froze Loch Larent to create her palace, some merfolk dove deep enough underwater to escape the chill. Others weren't so lucky.", 'When a redcap raid threatened the Grand Ball at Delverhaugh, Goddric had no choice but to reveal his true identity and douse the invaders in dragonfire.', 'Where an ouphe makes its home, the land blooms with color and joy.', "While Neva's mind wandered the realm of dreams, her body lay protected as mages worked frantically to find a cure for the Wicked Slumber.", 'Witchstalkers have extremely powerful legs—all the better to reach you with.', 'With each day she wore the crown, her icy kingdom spread, and her heart grew ever colder.', "With every retelling of Agatha's demise, Kellan got taller and Ruby got stronger. But the core story stayed the same, and people remembered what happens to those who prey on the weak.", 'With no time to gather weapons, the dwarves fought the redcaps with anything within reach.', "Yarvis was almost certain he'd seen the same tree an hour ago, but then again, didn't all trees look alike? He shelved his doubts and followed the friendly, twinkling motes deeper into the forest.", "You can't cage mischief.", "You can't give an ogre the runaround."]
