rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "If you don\'t reveal a creature card, put all the cards on the bottom of your library in any order."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If there is only one card in your library, you put it into your hand.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If there is only one card in your library, you put it into your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Activating Gingerbrute\'s middle ability after it has become blocked by a creature without haste won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Glass Casket leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target creature won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for X when determining the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "A face-down spell has mana value 0 and can\'t be targeted by Disdainful Stroke."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "A creature attacks alone if it\'s the only creature declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step. For example, Intrepid Trufflesnout\'s ability won\'t trigger if you attack with multiple creatures and all but one of them are removed from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\\\'s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can\\\'t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker\\\'s triggered ability ("return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand").\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Tough Cookie to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.") and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Activating Verdant Outrider\'s ability after it has become blocked by a creature with power 2 or less won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Adventurer cards aren\'t instant or sorcery cards while they\'re in your graveyard. You can\'t use Bubble Up to put an adventurer card from your graveyard on top of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Adventurer cards aren\'t instant or sorcery cards while they\'re in your graveyard. You can\'t use Free the Fae to put an adventurer card milled with it into your hand unless that card is a Faerie."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Adventurer cards aren\'t instant or sorcery cards while they\'re in your graveyard. You can\'t use Tenacious Tomeseeker\'s ability to return an adventurer card from your graveyard to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Bargain means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Bargain represents an optional additional cost. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is “bargained.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you copy a bargained spell, the copy is also bargained. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that’s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn’t bargained, even if the original was.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some instant and sorcery spells require additional targets if they’re bargained. You ignore those targeting requirements if those spells aren’t bargained, and you can’t bargain those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can bargain a permanent spell even if you won’t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You may sacrifice only one artifact, enchantment, or token to pay a spell’s bargain cost.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "An Adventure spell means an instant or sorcery spell with the Adventure spell type. Permanent spells that you cast which have an Adventure won\'t cause this ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Chancellor of Tales can copy any Adventure spell, not just one with targets.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Chancellor of Tales\'s ability and the copy it creates both resolve before the Adventure spell. They resolve even if the Adventure spell is countered before the copy is created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'The copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "An Adventure spell means an instant or sorcery spell with the Adventure spell type. Permanent spells that you cast which have an Adventure won\'t cause this ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "An artifact creature or enchantment creature sacrificed to Lich-Knights\' Conquest may be one of the cards chosen to be returned."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If any abilities trigger as you sacrifice permanents, those abilities won\'t be put onto the stack until after you\'ve returned creature cards from your graveyard to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You can choose to sacrifice zero permanents.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You sacrifice the artifacts, enchantments, and/or tokens as part of the resolution of Lich-Knights\' Conquest. It isn\'t an additional cost. If Lich-Knights\' Conquest is countered, you won\'t sacrifice anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Any choices made when the spell resolves won\'t have been made yet when it\'s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the spell has damage divided as it was put onto the stack, the division can\'t be changed for the copy, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you don\'t choose a target for the first chapter ability, the Cursed Role token won\'t be created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The copy created by the third chapter ability will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. The new targets must be legal. If, for any target, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'The copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Creating the copy won\\\'t cause abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for a copied spell. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though the same costs were paid for the copy too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Archon of the Wild Rose\'s ability overwrites all previous effects that set the affected creatures\' power and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set these characteristics to specific values that start to apply after Archon of the Wild Rose enters the battlefield will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness without setting it will apply to the affected creatures no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change a creature\'s power and/or toughness."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "As Malevolent Witchkite\'s triggered ability resolves, you may choose to sacrifice zero permanents."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If any abilities trigger when you sacrifice permanents, those abilities won\'t be put onto the stack until after you\'ve drawn cards. Those abilities won\'t trigger if you choose to sacrifice zero permanents."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "As Tough Cookie\'s second ability resolves, the target permanent keeps any other types and subtypes it had before it became an artifact creature."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it’s never a creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Tough Cookie to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Food tokens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Whatever you do, don’t eat the delicious cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You can’t sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Ashiok\'s first ability doesn\'t allow you to attempt to pay an amount of life greater than your current life total."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Ashiok, Wicked Nightmare\'s first ability isn\'t optional. You can\'t choose to pay life instead of exiling cards from the top of your library while you control Ashiok, and you can\'t split the payment between life and cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you would pay life while you control Ashiok and your library does not have at least that many cards in it, you\'ll just pay life as normal."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "At the beginning of combat on your turn, Boundary Lands Ranger\'s ability will check to see if you control a creature with power 4 or greater. If you don\'t, the ability won\'t trigger at all. If the ability does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you no longer control a creature with power 4 or greater (usually because your applicable creature is no longer on the battlefield), the ability won\'t do anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If Werefox Bodyguard leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target creature won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "By default, the controller of a Role token is the player who created it, even if that Role token is attached to a creature they don\'t control."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Count the number of Auras you control as the ability resolves to determine the value of X.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting Feral Encounter doesn\'t require any targets. As you put the delayed triggered ability on the stack at the beginning of the next combat phase this turn, you choose the target creature you control and up to one target creature you don\'t control."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you cast Feral Encounter and no combat phases occur later in that turn, the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Celebration abilities only care if two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control in a turn. They won\'t get more powerful if more than two permanents entered the battlefield under your control in a turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Each celebration ability has a different effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Goddric\'s activated ability affects only Dragons you control at the time it resolves. Any Dragons that come under your control later in the turn won\'t be affected."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect causes Goddric to lose all abilities during a turn in which it has already become a Dragon, he\'s still a Dragon creature with base power and toughness 4/4."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Others are static abilities that give creatures abilities or power and toughness increases as long as two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some celebration abilities trigger at specific parts of the turn and check whether two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control already in that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The permanents that entered the battlefield don\'t need to remain on the battlefield or under your control. Celebration abilities are checking for past events, not the current game state."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Celebration abilities only care if two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control in a turn. They won\'t get more powerful if more than two permanents entered the battlefield under your control in a turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Each celebration ability has a different effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Others are static abilities that give creatures abilities or power and toughness increases as long as two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Raging Battle Mouse can\'t reduce its own cost, even if it\'s the second spell you cast in a turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Raging Battle Mouse\'s cost-reduction ability can\'t reduce the amount of colored mana you pay for a spell. It reduces only the generic mana component of that cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Raging Battle Mouse\'s cost-reduction ability doesn\'t change the mana cost or mana value of any spell. It changes only the total cost you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some celebration abilities trigger at specific parts of the turn and check whether two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control already in that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Spells that were cast before Raging Battle Mouse entered the battlefield count. If Raging Battle Mouse was the first spell you cast this turn, the next spell you cast this turn is your second spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The permanents that entered the battlefield don\'t need to remain on the battlefield or under your control. Celebration abilities are checking for past events, not the current game state."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Celebration abilities only care if two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control in a turn. They won\'t get more powerful if more than two permanents entered the battlefield under your control in a turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Each celebration ability has a different effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Others are static abilities that give creatures abilities or power and toughness increases as long as two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some celebration abilities trigger at specific parts of the turn and check whether two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control already in that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The permanents that entered the battlefield don\'t need to remain on the battlefield or under your control. Celebration abilities are checking for past events, not the current game state."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Count the number of attacking creatures when Charging Hooligan\'s ability resolves, including Charging Hooligan itself, to determine the increase to its power."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Counters on Restless Bivouac remain on it when it stops being a creature. If it becomes a creature later, they\'ll apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If this becomes a creature because of an effect other than its own ability, its last ability will still trigger whenever it attacks.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If this becomes a creature but you haven\'t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won\'t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Effects that increase or reduce the cost to cast a spell don\'t affect that spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine if the spell\'s mana value is the chosen number. For example, if the chosen number is 4, a spell with mana cost {X}{R}{R} cast with X equal to 2 would cause Talion\'s last ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'The numbers you may choose include 1 and 10.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Enchantment tokens (such as Roles) that are sacrificed, destroyed, or would otherwise go to the graveyard are put into their owner\'s graveyard before ceasing to exist. If you controlled the token, Ashiok\'s Reaper\'s ability will trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Enchantment tokens (such as Roles) that are sacrificed, destroyed, or would otherwise go to the graveyard are put into their owner\'s graveyard before ceasing to exist. If you controlled the token, Knight of Doves\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If Knight of Doves leaves the battlefield while it has an Aura you control attached to it or at the same time as another creature with an Aura you control attached to it, its ability won\'t trigger for those enchantments unless they were destroyed by the same effect that caused Knight of Doves to leave the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Enchantment tokens (such as Roles) that are sacrificed, destroyed, or would otherwise go to the graveyard are put into their owner\'s graveyard before ceasing to exist. If you controlled the token, Neva\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If Neva leaves the battlefield while it has an Aura you control attached to it or at the same time as another creature with an Aura you control attached to it, its ability won\'t trigger for those enchantments unless they were destroyed by the same effect that caused Neva to leave the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Enchantment tokens (such as Roles) that are sacrificed, destroyed, or would otherwise go to the graveyard are put into their owner\'s graveyard before ceasing to exist. If you controlled the token, Savior of the Sleeping\'s ability will trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Enchantment tokens (such as Roles) that are sacrificed, destroyed, or would otherwise go to the graveyard are put into their owner\'s graveyard before ceasing to exist. If you controlled the token, Warehouse Tabby\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If Warehouse Tabby leaves the battlefield while it has an Aura you control attached to it or at the same time as another creature with an Aura you control attached to it, its ability won\'t trigger for those enchantments unless they were destroyed by the same effect that caused Warehouse Tabby to leave the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Enchantment tokens (such as Roles) that are sacrificed, destroyed, or would otherwise go to the graveyard are put into their owner\'s graveyard before ceasing to exist. If you controlled the token, Wicked Visitor\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If Wicked Visitor leaves the battlefield while it has an Aura you control attached to it or at the same time as another creature with an Aura you control attached to it, its ability won\'t trigger for those enchantments unless they were destroyed by the same effect that caused Wicked Visitor to leave the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Extraordinary Journey\'s second ability applies to all creatures that enter the battlefield from exile or were cast from exile, not just creatures cast with Extraordinary Journey\'s first ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Players must pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for spells cast with Extraordinary Journey\'s first ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Tough Cookie to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Old Flitterfang\'s triggered ability will check as the end step starts to see if a creature died this turn. If none did, the ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Tough Cookie to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Tough Cookie to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If this becomes a creature because of an effect other than its own ability, its last ability will still trigger whenever it attacks.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If this becomes a creature but you haven\'t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won\'t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "For Syr Ginger\'s last ability, use its power from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained. If that power was 0 or less, you gain no life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Frantic Firebolt isn\'t put into your graveyard until after it finishes resolving, so it doesn\'t count itself for its own effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Hopeless Nightmare\'s first ability causes each opponent to lose 2 life even if some or all of those players were unable to discard a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Howling Galefang will have haste as long as any card you own in exile has an Adventure. It doesn\'t matter if that card was cast as an Adventure or not."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Hylda of the Icy Crown\'s ability will trigger only when an effect instructs you to tap an opponent\'s creature. It won\'t trigger if a spell or ability you control instructs an opponent to tap a creature they control. For example, if you control Tangle Wire and an opponent taps an untapped creature they control as part of the resolution of Tangle Wire\'s triggered ability, Hylda\'s ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Icewrought Sentry\'s last ability will trigger only when an effect instructs you to tap an opponent\'s creature. It won\'t trigger if a spell or ability you control instructs an opponent to tap a creature they control. For example, if you control Tangle Wire and an opponent taps an untapped creature they control as part of the resolution of Tangle Wire\'s triggered ability, Icewrought Sentry\'s ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If Redcap Gutter-Dweller leaves the battlefield after its last ability has triggered, you can still sacrifice a creature and exile the top card of your library, even though you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on Redcap Gutter-Dweller."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played from exile with Redcap Gutter-Dweller. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If The Princess Takes Flight\'s first chapter ability exiled more than one creature (usually because the ability was copied), its third chapter ability will return all of the exiled cards to the battlefield under their owners\' control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If Totentanz, Swarm Piper dies at the same time as one or more other nontoken creatures you control, Totentanz\'s ability triggers for each of them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If one of the target creatures you control is an illegal target as Graceful Takedown resolves (perhaps because it\'s no longer enchanted or is no longer on the battlefield), the remaining legal target creatures you control will still deal damage equal to their power."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If the last target creature is an illegal target as Graceful Takedown resolves, or if all of the target creatures you control are illegal targets, no creature deals or is dealt damage.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the creature Bitter Chill would enchant is an illegal target by the time the Aura spell resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. It\'s put into the graveyard from the stack, not the battlefield, so its last ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the permanent is an illegal target as Johann\'s Stopgap tries to resolve, Johann\'s Stopgap is removed from the stack and you won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The cost-reduction ability of Johann\'s Stopgap doesn\'t change its mana cost or mana value, only the total cost you pay. Specifically, the mana value of Johann\'s Stopgap is always 4."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the permanent that\'s exiled was the back face of a double-faced card, you will not be able to exile any additional cards, because those cards have only their front-face characteristics (including name) in the graveyard, hand, and library."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The cost-reduction ability of The End doesn\'t change its mana cost or mana value, only the total cost you pay. Specifically, the mana value of The End is always 4."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the target Treasure is an illegal target as Discerning Financier\'s last ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the target is already tapped at the time Plunge into Winter resolves, you\'ll still scry 1 and draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can cast Plunge into Winter without a target just to scry 1 and draw a card. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time Plunge into Winter tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry, and you won\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the target is not legal as Flick a Coin tries to resolve, Flick a Coin is removed from the stack. You won\'t create a Treasure token, and you won\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the target is not legal as Freeze in Place tries to resolve, Freeze in Place will be removed from the stack. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You may target a creature that is already tapped with Freeze in Place. If the target creature is already tapped as Freeze in Place resolves, you will still put three stun counters on it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Stroke of Midnight tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. No player creates a Human token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create a Human token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you controlled a Faerie as you finished casting Faerie Fencing, it doesn\'t matter whether you still control one as the spell resolves. The target creature will still get an additional -3/-3."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you controlled a creature with power 4 or greater when you declared Ruby as an attacker, it doesn\'t matter whether you still control one as her triggered ability resolves. Ruby will still get +2/+2 until end of turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you don\'t choose a target creature, the Wicked Role token won\'t be created."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you don\'t choose a target for Witch\'s Mark, the Wicked Role token won\'t be created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can cast Witch\'s Mark without a target just to discard a card and draw two cards. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time Witch\'s Mark tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t discard, draw, or create a Wicked Role token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter\'s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get +1/+0 or gain haste."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Unruly Catapult\'s activated ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Players can cast spells and activate abilities (such as Unruly Catapult\'s own activated ability) after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Unruly Catapult\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Mocking Sprite\'s last ability can\'t reduce the amount of colored mana you pay for a spell. It reduces only the generic mana component of that cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Mocking Sprite\'s last ability doesn\'t change the mana cost or mana value of any spell. It changes only the total cost you pay."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Moment of Valor\'s first mode can target an untapped creature. It still gets +1/+0 and gains indestructible until end of turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Moonshaker Cavalry\'s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t be affected."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Moonshaker Cavalry\'s triggered ability resolves, potentially including Moonshaker Cavalry itself. It won\'t change later in the turn if the number of creatures you control changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Night of the Sweets\' Revenge\'s last ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t be affected."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Night of the Sweets\' Revenge\'s last ability resolves. It won\'t change later in the turn if the number of Foods you control changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Only creatures you control at the time Song of Totentanz resolves, including the Rat tokens it creates, will gain haste. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t be affected."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Only creatures you control when Gnawing Crescendo resolves will get +2/+0. However, if a nontoken creature enters the battlefield after Gnawing Crescendo resolves and then dies while under your control later that turn, you\'ll create a Rat token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Rowan\'s activated ability can\'t reduce the amount of colored mana you pay for a spell. It reduces only the generic mana component of that cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Rowan\'s activated ability counts the total amount of life you lost without taking into account any life you gained during that turn. For example, if you gained 3 life and lost 3 life earlier in the turn, the cost of black and/or red spells you cast this turn will be reduced by {3}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Rowan\'s activated ability doesn\'t change the mana cost or mana value of any spell. It changes only the total cost you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only once, at the time Rowan, Scion of War\'s activated ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Sharae of Numbing Depths\'s last ability will trigger only when an effect instructs you to tap one or more creatures your opponents control. It won\'t trigger if a spell or ability you control instructs an opponent to tap a creature they control. For example, if you control Tangle Wire and an opponent taps an untapped creature they control as part of the resolution of Tangle Wire\'s triggered ability, Sharae\'s ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You may target a creature that is already tapped with Sharae\'s first ability. If the target creature is already tapped as it resolves, you will still put a stun counter on it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Solitary Sanctuary\'s last ability will trigger only when an effect instructs you to tap an opponent\'s creature. It won\'t trigger if a spell or ability you control instructs an opponent to tap a creature they control. For example, if you control Tangle Wire and an opponent taps an untapped creature they control as part of the resolution of Tangle Wire\'s triggered ability, Solitary Sanctuary\'s ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You may target a creature that is already tapped with Solitary Sanctuary\'s first ability. If the target creature is already tapped as it resolves, you will still put a stun counter on it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The Irencrag\'s last ability lasts indefinitely."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Regal Bunnicorn\'s power and toughness functions in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The creature\'s owner chooses whether to put it on the top or bottom of their library. If multiple cards are put into the library this way (such as when the spell targets a melded permanent), that creature\'s owner puts all the cards on top or all the cards on the bottom. They put them in whatever order they wish, and do not need to reveal the order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The first and second modes of Sentinel of Lost Lore\'s ability can target any face-up exiled card that has an Adventure as long as it\'s owned by an appropriate player. It doesn\'t matter whether the card was cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must choose at least one mode if you can. If there are no legal targets available for the first two modes, you must choose the last mode. Notably, the last mode can target any player, even one who has no cards in their graveyard. In the unusual case there are no appropriate cards in exile to target and no player may legally be chosen as a target, the ability is removed from the stack with no effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The triggered ability triggers once for each creature blocking or blocked by Skewer Slinger. The ability resolves and deals damage to that creature before combat damage is dealt. If that damage destroys all creatures blocking Skewer Slinger, it doesn\'t become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only once, at the time Will, Scion of Peace\'s activated ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Will\'s activated ability can\'t reduce the amount of colored mana you pay for a spell. It reduces only the generic mana component of that cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Will\'s activated ability counts the total amount of life you gained without taking into account any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you gained 3 life and lost 3 life earlier in the turn, the cost of white and/or blue spells you cast this turn will be reduced by {3}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Will\'s activated ability doesn\'t change the mana cost or mana value of any spell. It changes only the total cost you pay."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Water Wings overwrites any previous effects that set the creature\'s power and/or toughness to specific values. Effects that otherwise modify its power and toughness will still apply no matter when they took effect. The same is true for +1/+1 counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Witchstalker Frenzy\'s first ability can\'t reduce its cost to less than {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Witchstalker Frenzy\'s first ability doesn\'t change its mana cost or mana value, only the total cost you pay. Specifically, the mana value of Witchstalker Frenzy is always 4."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can cast Rat Out without a target just to create a Rat token. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time Rat Out tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t create a Rat token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can spend mana generated by Troyan on any part of the cost of a spell that contains {X} in its mana cost. You\'re not limited to spending it only on the {X} part."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to spend the two mana on the same spell."}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You may target a creature that is already tapped with Croaking Curse. If the target creature is already tapped as it resolves, you will still create a Cursed Role token attached to it.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Bargain means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token.”'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Bargain represents an optional additional cost. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is “bargained.”'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If you copy a bargained spell, the copy is also bargained. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that’s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn’t bargained, even if the original was.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some instant and sorcery spells require additional targets if they’re bargained. You ignore those targeting requirements if those spells aren’t bargained, and you can’t bargain those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can bargain a permanent spell even if you won’t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice only one artifact, enchantment, or token to pay a spell’s bargain cost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the "Virtue and Valor" Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Hexproof and shroud won\'t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn\'t target it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If Faunsbane Troll is no longer on the battlefield or no longer a creature when its activated ability resolves, it doesn\'t fight the target creature, but the effect that causes the target creature to be exiled any time it would die that turn still applies."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If Faunsbane Troll\'s activated ability resolves, its effect causes the creature to be exiled any time it would die that turn, not just if it would die as a result of damage dealt by Faunsbane Troll."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner\'s graveyard. This is a state-based action."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners\' graveyards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can\'t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn\'t created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Role token won\'t be created."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the "Virtue and Valor" Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Hexproof and shroud won\'t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn\'t target it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner\'s graveyard. This is a state-based action."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners\' graveyards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can\'t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn\'t created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Role token won\'t be created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Spellbook Vendor\\\'s ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you pay {1} this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the "Virtue and Valor" Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Hexproof and shroud won\'t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn\'t target it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner\'s graveyard. This is a state-based action."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners\' graveyards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can\'t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn\'t created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Role token won\'t be created."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the creature you control already has a Role that you control attached to it, that Role will be put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action after the Monster Role is attached to it but before the reflexive triggered ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you can\'t attach a Monster Role token to the target creature you control when Curse of the Werefox resolves, the reflexive trigger that causes the fight won\'t happen."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for the creature to fight at the time you cast this spell. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you create a Monster Role token attached to the creature that was targeted by the spell. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If multiple creatures return to the battlefield (possibly because Not Dead After All targeted a melded permanent), a Wicked Role token will be created attached to each of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t return to the battlefield or returns as a noncreature permanent, the Wicked Role token won\'t be created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you don\'t choose a second target for Cut In, the Young Hero Role token won\'t be created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you don\'t choose a second target for Shatter the Oath or that target is illegal as the spell resolves, the Wicked Role token won\'t be created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you don\'t choose a second target for Twisted Fealty or that target is illegal as the spell resolves, the Wicked Role token won\'t be created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you don\'t choose a target creature, the Sorcerer Role token won\'t be created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can activate Living Lectern\'s ability without a target just to draw a card. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you don\'t choose a target for Protective Parents\'s ability, the Young Hero Role token won\'t be created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you don\'t choose a target for Splashy Spellcaster\'s ability, the Sorcerer Role token won\'t be created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Merry Bards\\\'s ability at the time its enters-the-battlefield ability triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you pay {1} this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'A permanent can have multiple Roles attached to it if each one is controlled by a different player.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Cards in the Wilds of Eldraine main set create six different Role tokens: Cursed, Monster, Royal, Sorcerer, Wicked, and Young Hero. A seventh Role token, Virtuous, is created by Ellivere of the Wild Court, the commander of the “Virtue and Valor” Commander Deck.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Hexproof and shroud won’t prevent a Role from becoming attached to a permanent if the ability creating that Role attached to that permanent doesn’t target it.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a permanent has more than one Role attached to it controlled by the same player, each of those Roles except the one with the most recent timestamp is put into its owner’s graveyard. This is a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If two or more Roles controlled by the same player become attached to a permanent at the same time (perhaps due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), that player chooses which one to keep and which are put into their owners’ graveyards.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'In rare cases, a spell or ability might attempt to create a Role token enchanting a permanent that it can’t legally enchant (because of an ability like protection from enchantments). In such cases, the Role token isn’t created.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Roles are colorless enchantment tokens. Each one has the Aura and Role subtypes and the enchant creature ability.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that create Role tokens require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. The Role token won’t be created.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Abilities that apply "as [this permanent] enters the battlefield," such as choosing a number with Talion, the Kindly Lord, are also unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Any choices made when the ability resolves won\'t have been made yet when it\'s copied by Vantress Visions. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves. If a triggered ability asks you to pay a cost, you pay that cost for the copy separately."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent entering the battlefield at the same time as Virtue of Knowledge (including Virtue of Knowledge itself) causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a triggered ability is linked to a second ability, additional instances of that triggered ability are also linked to that second ability. If the second ability refers to "the exiled card," it refers to all cards exiled by instances of the triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an ability is linked to a second ability, copies of that ability are also linked to that second ability. If the second ability refers to "the exiled card," it refers to all cards exiled by the ability and the copy. For example, if Tidehollow Sculler\\\'s enters-the-battlefield ability is copied and two cards are exiled, they both return when Tidehollow Sculler leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the ability copied by Vantress Visions divides damage or distributes counters among a number of targets, the division and number of targets can\'t be changed. If you choose new targets, you must choose the same number of targets."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If the ability copied by Vantress Visions is modal (that is, if it says, "Choose one —" or similar), the mode is copied and can\\\'t be changed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the activated ability\'s cost contains a choice, such as a creature to sacrifice or a number of counters to remove, the copy created by Vantress Visions uses that same information. You can\'t pay the cost again, even if you want to."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you control two copies of Virtue of Knowledge, a permanent entering the battlefield causes abilities to trigger three times, not four. A third Virtue of Knowledge causes abilities to trigger four times, a fourth causes abilities to trigger five times, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Virtue of Knowledge does not affect triggered abilities of permanents your teammate controls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'In some cases involving linked abilities, an ability requires information about "the exiled card." When this happens, the ability gets multiple answers. If these answers are being used to determine the value of a variable, the sum is used. For example, if Elite Arcanist\\\'s enters-the-battlefield ability triggers twice, two cards are exiled. The value of X in the activation cost of Elite Arcanist\\\'s other ability is the sum of the two cards\\\' mana values. As the ability resolves, you create copies of both cards and can cast none, one, or both of the copies in any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Replacement effects are unaffected by Virtue of Knowledge\'s ability. For example, a creature that enters the battlefield under your control with one +1/+1 counter on it won\'t receive an additional +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'The source of the copy created by Vantress Visions is the same as the source of the original ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Triggered abilities use the word "when," "whenever," or "at." They\\\'re often written as "[Trigger condition], [effect]." Some keyword abilities are triggered abilities and will have "when," "whenever," or "at the beginning of" in their reminder text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Virtue of Knowledge\\\'s ability affects a permanent\\\'s own enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities as well as other triggered abilities that trigger when that permanent enters the battlefield. Such triggered abilities start with "when" or "whenever." Some keyword abilities also include a triggered ability that happens when a permanent enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Virtue of Knowledge\'s ability doesn\'t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger an additional time. Any choices made as you put the ability onto the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution, such as whether to put counters on a permanent, are also made individually."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with "when," "whenever," or "at") are unaffected by the cost reduction ability of Agatha of the Vile Cauldron.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Agatha of the Vile Cauldron\'s first ability affects only abilities of creatures you control on the battlefield. The costs of activated abilities of creature cards that work in other zones (such as cycling) won\'t be reduced."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with "when," "whenever," or "at") are unaffected by the cost reduction ability of Blossoming Tortoise.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Blossoming Tortoise\'s second ability affects only abilities of lands you control on the battlefield. The costs of activated abilities of land cards that work in other zones (such as cycling) won\'t be reduced."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Agatha\'s Soul Cauldron grants only activated abilities. It doesn\'t grant keyword abilities (unless those keyword abilities are activated), triggered abilities, or static abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'The granted abilities effectively use "this permanent" rather than "[that card\\\'s name]," so you treat the abilities as though they were printed on the creature that gained the ability. For example, say you exiled the card Argothian Sprite with Agatha\\\'s Soul Cauldron. Argothian Sprite has the ability "{7}: Put two +1/+1 counters on Argothian Sprite." If you controlled a Callous Sell-Sword with a +1/+1 counter on it, you\\\'d treat it as though it had the ability "{7}: Put two +1/+1 counters on Callous Sell-Sword."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\\\'s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can\\\'t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker\\\'s triggered ability ("return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand").\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Gumdrop Poisoner\'s enters-the-battlefield ability counts the total amount of life you gained without taking into account any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you lost 3 life and gained 3 life earlier in the turn, the target creature will get -3/-3."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Tough Cookie to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.") and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\\\'s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can\\\'t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker\\\'s triggered ability ("return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand").\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell you control with lifelink deals damage to you, you gain and lose that much life simultaneously. In this case, your life total doesn\'t change. (Your life total may increase if the spell also deals damage to other permanents and/or players, however.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.") and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some instant and sorcery spells instruct other things to deal damage rather than deal damage themselves. In these cases, you won\'t gain life for that damage (unless the other things also have lifelink). Notably, a spell that instructs a creature you control to fight won\'t cause you to gain life."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\\\'s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can\\\'t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker\\\'s triggered ability ("return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand").\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.") and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Cruel Somnophage\'s power and toughness functions in all zones, not just the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\\\'s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can\\\'t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker\\\'s triggered ability ("return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand").\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.") and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The creature\'s owner chooses whether to put it on the top or bottom of their library. If multiple cards are put into the library this way (such as when the spell targets a melded permanent), that creature\'s owner puts all the cards on top or all the cards on the bottom. They put them in whatever order they wish, and do not need to reveal the order."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\\\'s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can\\\'t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker\\\'s triggered ability ("return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand").\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.") and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only once, as Hare Raising resolves. If the number of creatures you control changes after that time, it won\'t change the bonus granted."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\\\'s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can\\\'t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker\\\'s triggered ability ("return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand").\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.") and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for Dread Whispers when casting it with the permission of Mosswood Dreadknight\'s triggered ability. You must pay its mana cost (or, if another effect allows, an alternative cost)."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\\\'s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can\\\'t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker\\\'s triggered ability ("return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand").\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.") and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\\\'s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can\\\'t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker\\\'s triggered ability ("return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand").\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for X to determine the mana value of that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.") and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\\\'s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can\\\'t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker\\\'s triggered ability ("return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand").\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that "has an Adventure." This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\\\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\\\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An object with the land card type and a basic land type has the intrinsic ability "{T}: Add [mana symbol]," even if the text box doesn\\\'t actually contain that text or the object has no text box. For example, a basic Forest will have the intrinsic ability "{T}: Add {G}."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a permanent later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an ability triggers "whenever you tap" a basic land for mana and produces mana, that triggered mana ability won\\\'t be affected by Virtue of Strength.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\\\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer ("Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.") and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "The effects of multiple copies of Virtue of Strength are cumulative. For example, if you have two Virtue of Strengths on the battlefield, you\'ll get nine times the original amount and type of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Virtue of Strength doesn\'t produce any mana itself. Rather, it causes basic lands you tap for mana to produce more mana."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You\\\'re "tapping a basic land for mana" only if you\\\'re activating a mana ability of a basic land that includes the {T} symbol in its cost. A mana ability produces mana as part of its effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Combat damage is the damage that\'s dealt automatically by attacking and blocking creatures. Any other damage is noncombat damage, even if it\'s dealt during a combat phase by an attacking or blocking creature."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for a card played this way. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Fell Horseman will be put on the bottom of its owner\'s library only if it\'s still in the graveyard when its ability resolves. If it leaves the graveyard before that point, it will stay in whatever zone it\'s in, even if it\'s returned to the graveyard before the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a copy of a spell is returned to its owner\'s hand, it\'s moved there, then it will cease to exist as a state-based action. It can\'t be recast."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If a spell is returned to its owner\'s hand, it\'s removed from the stack and thus will not resolve. The spell isn\'t countered; it just no longer exists. This works even against a spell that can\'t be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it’s never a creature type.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Tough Cookie to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Food tokens.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Whatever you do, don’t eat the delicious cards.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for that X to determine the mana value of that spell.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If some of the creatures are illegal targets as Grove\'s Bounty tries to resolve, the original distribution of counters still applies and the counters that would have been put on illegal targets are lost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You choose how the counters will be distributed as you cast Grove\'s Bounty. Each target must receive at least one +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You compare Elusive Otter\'s power to the power of any creature trying to block it only as blockers are assigned. Once Elusive Otter has been legally blocked by a creature, changing the power of either creature won\'t change or undo the block."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If two targets are chosen for Beat a Path and one of them becomes an illegal target but not the other, the legal target will be unable to block and Beat a Path will be exiled. If both targets are illegal, Beat a Path will be put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell that\'s more than one of the listed colors, Questing Druid\'s ability still triggers only once."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played from exile with Seek the Beast. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If some of the creatures are illegal targets as Stolen Goodies tries to resolve, the original distribution of counters still applies and the counters that would have been put on illegal targets are lost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you controlled a creature with power 4 or greater when you declared Picnic Ruiner as an attacker, it doesn\'t matter whether you still control one as its ability resolves. Picnic Ruiner will still gain double strike until end of turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can cast Stolen Goodies with no targets. If you do, you won\'t distribute any counters, but you\'ll still exile it as it resolves, and you\'ll still be able to cast Picnic Ruiner later."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You choose how the counters will be distributed as you cast Stolen Goodies. Each target must receive at least one +1/+1 counter.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If the first target of Burn Together is an illegal target as the spell resolves but the last target is still legal, Burn Together will resolve, but no damage will be dealt and nothing will be sacrificed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the last target of Burn Together is an illegal target as the spell resolves but the first target is still legal, Burn Together will still resolve and you\'ll still sacrifice the first target."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Increasing a creature\'s power after it has blocked a creature affected by Squeak By will not remove that blocking creature from combat or make the affected creature unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Once Stormkeld Vanguard has become blocked, reducing the power of a creature blocking it to 2 or less won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Only you get to look at the cards exiled with Expensive Taste. Their owner doesn\'t get to know what they are while they\'re in exile until you play them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You may play the cards exiled with Expensive Taste even if they are land cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow all normal timing rules to play cards exiled with Expensive Taste.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'The effect that allows you to play an additional land that turn is cumulative with other effects that do so.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You may choose a creature that\'s already tapped as the target of Galvanic Giant\'s ability. If the target creature is already tapped as it resolves, you will still put a stun counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An adventurer card is a permanent card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it’s in your graveyard, Questing Druid is a green creature card whose mana value is 2. It can’t be the target of Tenacious Tomeseeker’s triggered ability (“return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand”).'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card’s set of alternative characteristics, even if they’re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Casting a card as an Adventure isn’t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner’s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a permanent spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won’t be exiled and the spell’s controller won’t be able to cast it as a permanent later.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won’t give you permission to cast it as a permanent spell.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it’s not possible to cast the copy as a permanent.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an Adventure, it won’t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that’s been cast as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it’s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it’s a nontoken permanent), and so you won’t be able to cast it as an Adventure.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it’s legal to cast that spell. For example, if you control Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer (“Once each turn, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library.”) and Questing Druid is on top of your library, you can cast Seek the Beast, but not Questing Druid.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card’s normal characteristics. The spell’s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the permanent spell you cast from exile. Normally, you’ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Any effects that applied to Likeness Looter before it becomes a copy of another card will continue to apply after it becomes a copy. The same is true of any counters that are on Likeness Looter.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Because Likeness Looter isn\\\'t entering the battlefield when it becomes a copy of a card, any "When [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[This creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the copied card won\\\'t apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If the copied card has an ability that can be activated only once each turn, copying that card a second time will allow you to activate the new instance of that ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Likeness Looter copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics it specifically modifies. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Except for the listed exceptions, the token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that permanent is itself copying something else; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If something becomes a copy of the token, the copy is also a Reflection in addition to its other types, has haste, and isn\'t legendary."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied, with the stated exceptions.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied enchantment will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "as [this enchantment] enters the battlefield" or "[this enchantment] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Except for the listed exceptions, the token copies exactly what was printed on the original enchantment and nothing else (unless that enchantment is itself copying something else; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If something becomes a copy of the token, the copy also isn\'t legendary."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If the copied enchantment has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If the copied enchantment is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied, with the stated exceptions.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'As the first mode is performed, first the player whose turn it is chooses two cards in hand without revealing them, then each other player in turn order does the same. Then the chosen cards are discarded at the same time.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'As the third mode is performed, first the player whose turn it is chooses two creatures they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You can choose a mode even if some or all players will be entirely or partially unaffected.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Bargain means "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Bargain represents an optional additional cost. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is "bargained."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you copy a bargained spell, the copy is also bargained. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that\'s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn\'t bargained, even if the original was."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some instant and sorcery spells require additional targets if they\'re bargained. You ignore those targeting requirements if those spells aren\'t bargained, and you can\'t bargain those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can bargain a permanent spell even if you won\'t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Torch the Tower\'s last replacement effect will exile the target permanent if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage or having 0 loyalty."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one artifact, enchantment, or token to pay a spell\'s bargain cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Bargain means "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Bargain represents an optional additional cost. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is "bargained."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you copy a bargained spell, the copy is also bargained. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that\'s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn\'t bargained, even if the original was."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some instant and sorcery spells require additional targets if they\'re bargained. You ignore those targeting requirements if those spells aren\'t bargained, and you can\'t bargain those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can bargain a permanent spell even if you won\'t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one artifact, enchantment, or token to pay a spell\'s bargain cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You still put only two of the cards into your hand if you bargain this spell.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Bargain means "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Bargain represents an optional additional cost. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is "bargained."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you copy a bargained spell, the copy is also bargained. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that\'s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn\'t bargained, even if the original was."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Some instant and sorcery spells require additional targets if they\'re bargained. You ignore those targeting requirements if those spells aren\'t bargained, and you can\'t bargain those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can bargain a permanent spell even if you won\'t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one artifact, enchantment, or token to pay a spell\'s bargain cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Bargain means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Bargain represents an optional additional cost. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is “bargained.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you bargained Brave the Wilds and the target land is an illegal target by the time it tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t search for a basic land card, and you won\'t shuffle."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If you copy a bargained spell, the copy is also bargained. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that’s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn’t bargained, even if the original was.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some instant and sorcery spells require additional targets if they’re bargained. You ignore those targeting requirements if those spells aren’t bargained, and you can’t bargain those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can bargain a permanent spell even if you won’t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You may sacrifice only one artifact, enchantment, or token to pay a spell’s bargain cost.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Bargain means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token.”'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Bargain represents an optional additional cost. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is “bargained.”'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If you bargain this spell, you can still choose not to put one of the cards onto the battlefield, even if at least one is eligible.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If you copy a bargained spell, the copy is also bargained. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that’s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn’t bargained, even if the original was.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some instant and sorcery spells require additional targets if they’re bargained. You ignore those targeting requirements if those spells aren’t bargained, and you can’t bargain those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can bargain a permanent spell even if you won’t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice only one artifact, enchantment, or token to pay a spell’s bargain cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Bargain means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token.”'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Bargain represents an optional additional cost. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is “bargained.”'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If you copy a bargained spell, the copy is also bargained. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that’s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn’t bargained, even if the original was.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some instant and sorcery spells require additional targets if they’re bargained. You ignore those targeting requirements if those spells aren’t bargained, and you can’t bargain those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can bargain a permanent spell even if you won’t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice only one artifact, enchantment, or token to pay a spell’s bargain cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Celebration abilities only care if two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control in a turn. They won’t get more powerful if more than two permanents entered the battlefield under your control in a turn.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Each celebration ability has a different effect.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Others are static abilities that give creatures abilities or power and toughness increases as long as two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control that turn.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some celebration abilities trigger at specific parts of the turn and check whether two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control already in that turn.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'The permanents that entered the battlefield don’t need to remain on the battlefield or under your control. Celebration abilities are checking for past events, not the current game state.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it’s never a creature type.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for that X to determine the mana value of that spell.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Tough Cookie to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Food tokens.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Whatever you do, don’t eat the delicious cards.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it’s never a creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Tough Cookie to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Food tokens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'Whatever you do, don’t eat the delicious cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can cast Spider Food without a target just to create a Food token. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time Spider Food tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t create a Food token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You can’t sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it’s never a creature type.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Tough Cookie to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t create any Food tokens.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Whatever you do, don’t eat the delicious cards.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can’t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Sweettooth Witch.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If Johann leaves the battlefield and returns to the battlefield in the same turn, or if Johann leaves and another Johann appears, the casting permission granted by the old one is different than the casting permission granted by the new one. On the turn in which the new Johann enters the battlefield, you may use its casting permission once, even if you used the old Johann\\\'s casting permission to cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library in that same turn. Note that if you control multiple Johanns you won\\\'t have the opportunity to cast an instant or sorcery spell from the top of your library before the "legend rule" gets you down to one Johann.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast a spell from the top of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If the top card of your library has an Adventure, you can cast the Adventure spell this way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "You can look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction; see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You must pay all costs and follow all timing rules for spells cast from the top of your library this way.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you controlled or a token is destroyed with Break the Spell but is put into a zone other than a graveyard as a result, you will draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If the enchantment has indestructible, it won\'t be destroyed. You won\'t draw a card."}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for that X to determine the mana value of that spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If the copied token is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that token copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Only creatures you control at the time the fourth chapter ability resolves will get +1/+1 and gain vigilance. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t be affected."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'The token copies the original characteristics of the target token as stated by the effect that created the token.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'If this becomes a creature because of an effect other than its own ability, its last ability will still trigger whenever it attacks.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If this becomes a creature but you haven\'t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won\'t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it that turn."}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Only the controller of Cooped Up may activate its ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'The numbers you may choose include 0 and 10.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You choose whether to sacrifice Rotisserie Elemental as its triggered ability resolves. No player may respond between the time you sacrifice it and the time you exile cards from the top of your library.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played from exile this way. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Snaremaster Sprite\\\'s ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you pay {2} this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You may target a creature that is already tapped with the reflexive triggered ability. If the target creature is already tapped as the ability resolves, you will still put a stun counter on it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Talion\\\'s Messenger\\\'s ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you discard a card this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You may target creatures that are already tapped with Succumb to the Cold. If a target creature is already tapped as it resolves, you will still put a stun counter on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for a card played this way. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper // Zutritt verwehrt", \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Und warum glaubst du, dass Fürstin Prachtböe *dich* empfangen wollen würde, du Knirps?"\', \'faceName\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629805&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2b683ca-d364-487a-a29e-d6b049846f25\', \'multiverseId\': 629805}, \'multiverseid\': 629805}, {\'name\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper // Prohibir la entrada", \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Y qué te hace pensar que la señora Granborrasca quiere verte a ti, pequeñajo?".**\', \'faceName\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a7bfe44-6d30-4f6e-8ae2-d5abfaa5c577\', \'multiverseId\': 630066}, \'multiverseid\': 630066}, {\'name\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper // Entrée refusée", \'type\': \'Créature — géant et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Et qu\'est-ce qui te fait penser que Dame Grande-bourrasque désire *te voir*, petit ? »", \'faceName\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630327&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf6c6190-d002-47f9-aa2e-d9ff106ed74f\', \'multiverseId\': 630327}, \'multiverseid\': 630327}, {\'name\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper // Vietato l\'Ingresso", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"E cosa ti fa pensare che la Signora Granburrasca voglia vedere proprio *te*, piccoletto?"\', \'faceName\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8999692-a3e9-41ad-b286-4f0225870090\', \'multiverseId\': 630588}, \'multiverseid\': 630588}, {\'name\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper // 立（た）ち入（い）り禁（きん）止（し）", \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「グランドスコール様が*おまえ*ごときに会うとでも思っているのか、小さき者よ？」\', \'faceName\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40263ca1-c149-464a-a4a4-4f396fc9fd5b\', \'multiverseId\': 630849}, \'multiverseid\': 630849}, {\'name\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper // Entrada Negada", \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"E o que faz você achar que a Senhora Granborrasca quer receber *você*, criaturinha?"\', \'faceName\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'123fbb30-b522-48a1-aca4-8ae8a5a583d5\', \'multiverseId\': 631110}, \'multiverseid\': 631110}, {\'name\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper // 禁止入内", \'type\': \'生物 — 巨人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「小家伙，你又为什么会觉得巨风女王想要接见*你*呢？」\', \'faceName\': "Beluna\'s Gatekeeper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f13a44a-0065-4195-9008-a3e968222bf0\', \'multiverseId\': 631371}, \'multiverseid\': 631371}]', '[{\'name\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter // Truppenausbildung", \'text\': \'Wenn Imodanes Anwerber ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+0 und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629991&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ae859e4-f9e1-40a2-b074-8d35dc55e3f8\', \'multiverseId\': 629991}, \'multiverseid\': 629991}, {\'name\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter // Entrenar a las tropas", \'text\': \'Cuando el Reclutador de Imodane entre al campo de batalla, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0 y ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db4be60d-412f-4ef1-bcb9-7ed9d0e3413d\', \'multiverseId\': 630252}, \'multiverseid\': 630252}, {\'name\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter // Entraîner des troupes", \'text\': "Quand le Recruteur d\'Imodane arrive sur le champ de bataille, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 et acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630513&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8280ba2e-6c34-4488-abec-4ff295df87f3\', \'multiverseId\': 630513}, \'multiverseid\': 630513}, {\'name\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter // Addestrare le Truppe", \'text\': \'Quando il Reclutatore di Imodane entra nel campo di battaglia, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+0 e hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b906d19-97d1-4873-ae09-056fb10bceb6\', \'multiverseId\': 630774}, \'multiverseid\': 630774}, {\'name\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter // 兵（へい）団（だん）の訓（くん）練（れん）", \'text\': \'イモデーンの徴募兵が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d40ee4ac-afb0-49ee-9632-2d27e42d8411\', \'multiverseId\': 631035}, \'multiverseid\': 631035}, {\'name\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter // Treinar Tropas", \'text\': \'Quando Recrutador de Imodane entra no campo de batalha, as criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+0 e ganham ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': "Imodane\'s Recruiter", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c36f5820-0a71-4da9-8a49-b72d5a7d3b77\', \'multiverseId\': 631296}, \'multiverseid\': 631296}, {\'name\': \'依莫丹的征兵员 // 训练部队\', \'text\': \'当依莫丹的征兵员进战场时，直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+0且获得敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'依莫丹的征兵员\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9ef259a-b9ea-4aa7-8402-77171827808e\', \'multiverseId\': 631557}, \'multiverseid\': 631557}]', '[{\'name\': "Obyra\'s Attendants // Verzweifelte Parade", \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Obyras ergebene Diener kreischten, als ihre schlafende Herrin blind nach ihnen schlug.\', \'faceName\': "Obyra\'s Attendants", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629825&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'163b4311-2886-4895-9abd-f7052b1c0095\', \'multiverseId\': 629825}, \'multiverseid\': 629825}, {\'name\': "Obyra\'s Attendants // Bloqueo desesperado", \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero hada\', \'flavor\': \'Los devotos sirvientes de Obyra chillaron cuando su señora dormida empezó a lanzar espadazos sin verlos.\', \'faceName\': "Obyra\'s Attendants", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'439d6697-be3f-4ab6-9eff-833968efaaef\', \'multiverseId\': 630086}, \'multiverseid\': 630086}, {\'name\': "Obyra\'s Attendants // Parade désespérée", \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Les serviteurs dévoués d\'Obyra poussèrent des cris tandis que leur maîtresse endormie les frappait sans les voir.", \'faceName\': "Obyra\'s Attendants", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630347&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a90201d-0543-49ee-b487-35803a49628c\', \'multiverseId\': 630347}, \'multiverseid\': 630347}, {\'name\': "Obyra\'s Attendants // Parata Disperata", \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'I devoti servitori di Obyra lanciarono un urlo quando la loro padrona dormiente agitò la spada contro di loro, priva di vista.\', \'faceName\': "Obyra\'s Attendants", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b74dbc5-3502-4efe-a69f-3c67f34bcbbb\', \'multiverseId\': 630608}, \'multiverseid\': 630608}, {\'name\': "Obyra\'s Attendants // 捨（す）て身（み）の受（う）け流（なが）し", \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'オビラの甲斐甲斐しい召使いたちは、眠れる主に斬られて絶叫した。\', \'faceName\': "Obyra\'s Attendants", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd828758-3cd3-4b61-92b0-37639cceaac7\', \'multiverseId\': 630869}, \'multiverseid\': 630869}, {\'name\': "Obyra\'s Attendants // Aparada Desesperada", \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Os devotos servos de Obyra gritaram quando sua senhora adormecida os golpeou com sua espada, sem ver.\', \'faceName\': "Obyra\'s Attendants", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'680e9a39-31dd-436c-bc29-de863f4aa017\', \'multiverseId\': 631130}, \'multiverseid\': 631130}, {\'name\': "Obyra\'s Attendants // 奋绝格挡", \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物 — 仙灵／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'眼见他们的主人在沉睡中闭眼挥剑砍来，欧拜拉手下的忠心仆从纷纷大声尖叫。\', \'faceName\': "Obyra\'s Attendants", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e1aab40-ca83-4142-9284-c5582aec4062\', \'multiverseId\': 631391}, \'multiverseid\': 631391}]', '[{\'name\': "Totentanz\' Lied", \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 1/1 schwarze Ratte-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken." Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Stadtbewohner wippten mit den Füßen und summten mit, ohne zu ahnen, dass sie so die Melodie verstärkten, die ihren Untergang bedeuten sollte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629912&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'967a7349-3acc-4cee-9b2c-589736fa3df2\', \'multiverseId\': 629912}, \'multiverseid\': 629912}, {\'name\': \'Canción de Totentanz\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura Rata negras 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear". Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los lugareños repiqueteaban con los pies y tarareaban, amplificando, sin saberlo, la melodía que invocaría su perdición.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84611ac1-c558-490e-9a9c-591ed3b2b537\', \'multiverseId\': 630173}, \'multiverseid\': 630173}, {\'name\': \'Chanson de Totentanz\', \'text\': "Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. » Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les villageois tapaient du pied et chantonnaient en rythme, amplifiant sans s\'en rendre compte l\'air qui annonçait leur mort.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630434&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60bcb7f1-2dbf-4f17-93c8-a9b01895b081\', \'multiverseId\': 630434}, \'multiverseid\': 630434}, {\'name\': \'Canto di Totentanz\', \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura Ratto 1/1 nere con "Questa creatura non può bloccare". Le creature che controlli hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La gente batteva i piedi a ritmo e canticchiava, ignara di amplificare la melodia che avrebbe evocato la loro fine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'247dd78f-6f78-4ab3-902e-b74a196ee91e\', \'multiverseId\': 630695}, \'multiverseid\': 630695}, {\'name\': \'トーテンタンズの歌\', \'text\': \'「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'町の民は歌に合わせて足踏みしたり鼻歌を歌った。破滅を呼び込む音色を増幅させる行為とも知らずに。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d715abd6-86fc-46c3-b537-0ee73be86286\', \'multiverseId\': 630956}, \'multiverseid\': 630956}, {\'name\': \'Canção de Totentanz\', \'text\': \'Crie X fichas de criatura Rato preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear". As criaturas que você controla ganham ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O povo da cidade sapateou e cantarolou junto, amplificando sem saber a música que invocaria sua ruína.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d43325-b299-4369-b524-696604f399ea\', \'multiverseId\': 631217}, \'multiverseid\': 631217}, {\'name\': \'托腾坦之歌\', \'text\': \'派出X个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」由你操控的生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'镇民随着节奏舞动节拍、齐声跟唱，殊不知这样会为旋律增效，令自己的末日更快到来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31057d30-d5be-49df-90e0-ec007608625d\', \'multiverseId\': 631478}, \'multiverseid\': 631478}]', '[{\'name\': "Totentanz\' Lied", \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 1/1 schwarze Ratte-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken." Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631886&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68a764e7-716b-44d1-bbcc-c480dbe31b0a\', \'multiverseId\': 631886}, \'multiverseid\': 631886}, {\'name\': \'Chanson de Totentanz\', \'text\': "Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. » Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631933&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b50df4a0-dde4-4951-8912-c7981daba498\', \'multiverseId\': 631933}, \'multiverseid\': 631933}, {\'name\': \'トーテンタンズの歌\', \'text\': \'「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da186a91-916d-4d50-9840-bce359f7cd37\', \'multiverseId\': 631980}, \'multiverseid\': 631980}, {\'name\': \'托腾坦之歌\', \'text\': \'派出X个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」由你操控的生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f416ad8-dc67-46c1-9e46-5317f7b8f69b\', \'multiverseId\': 632027}, \'multiverseid\': 632027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abbild-Aneigner\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\n{X}: Der Abbild-Aneigner wird zu einer Kopie einer Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof mit Manabetrag X, außer dass er Flugfähigkeit und diese Fähigkeit hat. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4064b5ac-7bd5-4869-a0ab-4fbf79df6161\', \'multiverseId\': 629970}, \'multiverseid\': 629970}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón de apariencias\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\\n{X}: El Ladrón de apariencias se convierte en una copia de la carta de criatura objetivo en tu cementerio con valor de maná de X, excepto que tiene la habilidad de volar y esta habilidad. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab2d5cda-b395-457a-bf0a-54372005dd28\', \'multiverseId\': 630231}, \'multiverseid\': 630231}, {\'name\': "Détrousseur d\'apparence", \'text\': "Vol\\n{T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\n{X} : Le Détrousseur d\'apparence devient une copie d\'une carte de créature ciblée dans votre cimetière avec une valeur de mana de X, excepté qu\'il a le vol et cette capacité. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée et changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630492&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17ade945-9d70-4eb8-af43-9d5c581b2ac2\', \'multiverseId\': 630492}, \'multiverseid\': 630492}, {\'name\': \'Saccheggiatore di Sembianze\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\\n{X}: Il Saccheggiatore di Sembianze diventa una copia di una carta creatura bersaglio nel tuo cimitero con valore di mana X, tranne che ha volare e questa abilità. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo Spiritello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c8982b9-65a9-49a3-b9e8-36b621fa6e8b\', \'multiverseId\': 630753}, \'multiverseid\': 630753}, {\'name\': \'似姿の物あさり\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{T}：カード１枚を引く。その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\\n{X}：あなたの墓地にありマナ総量がＸであるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。似姿の物あさりは、飛行とこの能力を持つことを除き、それのコピーになる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa656109-515a-43e5-944b-9afc8e491f28\', \'multiverseId\': 631014}, \'multiverseid\': 631014}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador de Semblantes\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{T}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\\n{X}: Saqueador de Semblantes torna-se uma cópia do card de criatura alvo em seu cemitério com valor de mana X, exceto por ter voar e ter esta habilidade. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce1dbe2-bffb-4e23-8d51-6035fa6ae506\', \'multiverseId\': 631275}, \'multiverseid\': 631275}, {\'name\': \'形踪掠夺灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\n{X}：选择目标在你坟墓场中且法术力值为X的生物牌。形踪掠夺灵成为该牌的复制品，但它具有飞行与此异能。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 仙灵／变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3f8b398-53c7-482c-8a6a-4273623569d1\', \'multiverseId\': 631536}, \'multiverseid\': 631536}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abbild-Aneigner\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\n{X}: Der Abbild-Aneigner wird zu einer Kopie einer Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof mit Manabetrag X, außer dass er Flugfähigkeit und diese Fähigkeit hat. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ec08fc0-9c85-45a2-b662-28b58fb3a7e4\', \'multiverseId\': 631897}, \'multiverseid\': 631897}, {\'name\': "Détrousseur d\'apparence", \'text\': "Vol\\n{T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\n{X} : Le Détrousseur d\'apparence devient une copie d\'une carte de créature ciblée dans votre cimetière avec une valeur de mana de X, excepté qu\'il a le vol et cette capacité. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée et changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631944&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'172e8bca-5c79-4428-b915-4d673f051cc0\', \'multiverseId\': 631944}, \'multiverseid\': 631944}, {\'name\': \'似姿の物あさり\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{T}：カード１枚を引く。その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\\n{X}：あなたの墓地にありマナ総量がＸであるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。似姿の物あさりは、飛行とこの能力を持つことを除き、それのコピーになる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f27ac7a-e973-406e-bf90-e6a6033f912b\', \'multiverseId\': 631991}, \'multiverseid\': 631991}, {\'name\': \'形踪掠夺灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\n{X}：选择目标在你坟墓场中且法术力值为X的生物牌。形踪掠夺灵成为该牌的复制品，但它具有飞行与此异能。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 仙灵／变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acd33c90-973f-4a9e-8663-5e6216c0aa99\', \'multiverseId\': 632038}, \'multiverseid\': 632038}]', '[{\'name\': \'Agatha vom Schändlichen Kessel\', \'text\': \'Aktivierte Fähigkeiten von Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, kosten beim Aktivieren {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Stärke von Agatha vom Schändlichen Kessel ist. Dieser Effekt kann die Menge Mana in jenen Kosten nicht unter ein Mana reduzieren.\\n{4}{R}{G}: Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und Eile und verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fd51841-89b5-4de7-90b6-267d6a676b54\', \'multiverseId\': 629961}, \'multiverseid\': 629961}, {\'name\': \'Agatha del caldero vil\', \'text\': \'Cuesta {X} menos activar las habilidades activadas de las criaturas que controlas, donde X es la fuerza de Agatha del caldero vil. Este efecto no puede reducir esos costes a menos de un maná.\\n{4}{R}{G}: Las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y ganan las habilidades de arrollar y prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d20bc68-72a8-428b-b2e0-12b75fd84700\', \'multiverseId\': 630222}, \'multiverseid\': 630222}, {\'name\': \'Agatha du vil chaudron\', \'text\': "Les capacités activées des créatures que vous contrôlez coûtent {X} de moins à activer, X étant la force d\'Agatha du vil chaudron. Cet effet ne peut pas réduire le mana de ce coût à moins d\'un mana.\\n{4}{R}{G} : Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent le piétinement et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630483&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90eeda02-fb4e-4b0f-83b9-0846a3f77130\', \'multiverseId\': 630483}, \'multiverseid\': 630483}, {\'name\': \'Agata del Calderone Ripugnante\', \'text\': \'Le abilità attivate delle creature che controlli costano {X} in meno per essere attivate, dove X è la forza di Agata del Calderone Ripugnante. Questo effetto non può ridurre il mana in quel costo a meno di un mana.\\n{4}{R}{G}: Le altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno travolgere e rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf2550d6-5eb3-4d2c-9a54-9869cee5b587\', \'multiverseId\': 630744}, \'multiverseid\': 630744}, {\'name\': \'穢れの大釜、アガサ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの起動型能力を起動するためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘは穢れの大釜、アガサのパワーに等しい。この効果は、そのコストに含まれるマナの点数を１点未満に減らせない。\\n{4}{R}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けトランプルと速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31c3b546-a40a-4589-9dfa-304375d69985\', \'multiverseId\': 631005}, \'multiverseid\': 631005}, {\'name\': \'Agatha do Caldeirão Vil\', \'text\': \'As habilidades ativadas de criaturas que você controla custam {X} a menos para serem ativadas, sendo X o poder de Agatha do Caldeirão Vil. Este efeito não pode reduzir o mana daquele custo a menos de um mana.\\n{4}{R}{G}: As outras criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 e ganham atropelar e ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c2b6fbf-31bc-4f64-8994-20333f0f2201\', \'multiverseId\': 631266}, \'multiverseid\': 631266}, {\'name\': \'巫鼎镬阿加莎\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物之起动式异能减少{X}来起动，X为巫鼎镬阿加莎的力量。此效应无法将该费用中的法术力减少到少于一点法术力。\\n{4}{R}{G}：直到回合结束，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1且获得践踏与敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c4f558c-e664-43d7-92ec-705a2a0e73ee\', \'multiverseId\': 631527}, \'multiverseid\': 631527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Agatha vom Schändlichen Kessel\', \'text\': \'Aktivierte Fähigkeiten von Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, kosten beim Aktivieren {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Stärke von Agatha vom Schändlichen Kessel ist. Dieser Effekt kann die Menge Mana in jenen Kosten nicht unter ein Mana reduzieren.\\n{4}{R}{G}: Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und Eile und verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631893&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39b4d881-a316-4985-9697-ca1613862137\', \'multiverseId\': 631893}, \'multiverseid\': 631893}, {\'name\': \'Agatha du vil chaudron\', \'text\': "Les capacités activées des créatures que vous contrôlez coûtent {X} de moins à activer, X étant la force d\'Agatha du vil chaudron. Cet effet ne peut pas réduire le mana de ce coût à moins d\'un mana.\\n{4}{R}{G} : Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent le piétinement et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631940&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de19570-33cd-413e-940d-0edff5cd5aed\', \'multiverseId\': 631940}, \'multiverseid\': 631940}, {\'name\': \'穢れの大釜、アガサ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの起動型能力を起動するためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘは穢れの大釜、アガサのパワーに等しい。この効果は、そのコストに含まれるマナの点数を１点未満に減らせない。\\n{4}{R}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けトランプルと速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb2a0a46-5ad2-4147-b96f-b9144a267506\', \'multiverseId\': 631987}, \'multiverseid\': 631987}, {\'name\': \'巫鼎镬阿加莎\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物之起动式异能减少{X}来起动，X为巫鼎镬阿加莎的力量。此效应无法将该费用中的法术力减少到少于一点法术力。\\n{4}{R}{G}：直到回合结束，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1且获得践踏与敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad5952f2-da5b-495e-9470-31a79e214995\', \'multiverseId\': 632034}, \'multiverseid\': 632034}]', '[{\'name\': \'Agathas Champion\', \'text\': \'Feilschen (Du kannst ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder einen Spielstein opfern, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn Agathas Champion ins Spiel kommt und falls um ihn gefeilscht wurde, kämpft er gegen bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629922&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08f50183-b9c6-4748-83ef-4c930e354635\', \'multiverseId\': 629922}, \'multiverseid\': 629922}, {\'name\': \'Campeón de Agatha\', \'text\': \'Negociar. (Puedes sacrificar un artefacto, encantamiento o ficha al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nArrolla.\\nCuando el Campeón de Agatha entre al campo de batalla, si fue negociado, lucha contra hasta una criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de11510-4076-427e-8156-44e741b6d67a\', \'multiverseId\': 630183}, \'multiverseid\': 630183}, {\'name\': "Champion d\'Agatha", \'text\': "Négociation (Vous pouvez sacrifier un artefact, un enchantement ou un jeton au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nPiétinement\\nQuand le Champion d\'Agatha arrive sur le champ de bataille, s\'il a été négocié, il se bat contre jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630444&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3bcec59-ddd6-40f8-bbac-506dc54faca2\', \'multiverseId\': 630444}, \'multiverseid\': 630444}, {\'name\': \'Campione di Agata\', \'text\': "Negoziare (Puoi sacrificare un artefatto, un incantesimo o una pedina mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nTravolgere\\nQuando il Campione di Agata entra nel campo di battaglia, se è stato negoziato, lotta con fino a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a08be63f-f755-4d00-80cc-bca805914ddc\', \'multiverseId\': 630705}, \'multiverseid\': 630705}, {\'name\': \'アガサの勇者\', \'text\': \'協約（この呪文を唱えるに際し、アーティファクトやエンチャントやトークンのうち１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。）\\nトランプル\\nアガサの勇者が戦場に出たとき、これが協約されていた場合、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。これはそれと格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7676b2fa-8a4f-4cae-98c5-f53abd2283be\', \'multiverseId\': 630966}, \'multiverseid\': 630966}, {\'name\': \'Campeão de Agatha\', \'text\': \'Negociar (Você pode sacrificar um artefato, um encantamento ou uma ficha conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nAtropelar\\nQuando Campeão de Agatha entra no campo de batalha, se ele foi negociado, ele luta contra até uma criatura alvo que você não controla. (Cada uma causa dano igual ao seu poder à outra.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b300fc24-c46a-486d-8c85-93f3b3f7e054\', \'multiverseId\': 631227}, \'multiverseid\': 631227}, {\'name\': \'阿加莎的斗士\', \'text\': \'加码（你施放此咒语时可以牺牲一个神器，结界或衍生物。）\\n践踏\\n当阿加莎的斗士进战场时，若它已加码，则它与至多一个目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'722afe63-beac-4d5f-9d80-577f4dd72eb7\', \'multiverseId\': 631488}, \'multiverseid\': 631488}]', '[{\'name\': \'Agathas Seelenkessel\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, um Fähigkeiten von Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zu aktivieren.\\nKreaturen mit +1/+1-Marke, die du kontrollierst, haben alle aktivierten Fähigkeiten von Kreaturenkarten, die von Agathas Seelenkessel ins Exil geschickt wurden.\\n{T}: Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Wenn auf diese Weise eine Kreaturenkarte ins Exil geschickt wird, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630004&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a292741-4757-4489-8ec6-afa1cb22c64d\', \'multiverseId\': 630004}, \'multiverseid\': 630004}, {\'name\': \'Caldero de almas de Agatha\', \'text\': \'Puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para activar habilidades de las criaturas que controlas.\\nLas criaturas que controlas con contadores +1/+1 sobre ellas tienen todas las habilidades activadas de todas las cartas de criatura exiliadas con el Caldero de almas de Agatha.\\n{T}: Exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio. Cuando se exilie una carta de criatura de esta manera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3161d497-df88-4cab-97c4-fa76def346d1\', \'multiverseId\': 630265}, \'multiverseid\': 630265}, {\'name\': "Chaudron d\'âme d\'Agatha", \'text\': "Vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme si c\'était du mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour activer les capacités des créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez avec des marqueurs +1/+1 sur elles ont toutes les capacités activées de toutes les cartes de créature exilées par le Chaudron d\'âme d\'Agatha.\\n{T} : Exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière. Quand une carte de créature est exilée de cette manière, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630526&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a12d6efc-15a0-482f-8860-0e8e2f99d74a\', \'multiverseId\': 630526}, \'multiverseid\': 630526}, {\'name\': "Calderone dell\'Anima di Agata", \'text\': "Puoi spendere il mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per attivare le abilità delle creature che controlli.\\nLe creature che controlli con segnalini +1/+1 hanno tutte le abilità attivate di tutte le carte creatura esiliate con il Calderone dell\'Anima di Agata.\\n{T}: Esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero. Quando una carta creatura viene esiliata in questo modo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46bfcbd7-0bc0-4702-a898-c14c5e30b459\', \'multiverseId\': 630787}, \'multiverseid\': 630787}, {\'name\': \'アガサの魂の大釜\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの能力を起動するためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているすべてのクリーチャーは、アガサの魂の大釜によって追放されているすべてのクリーチャー・カードのすべての起動型能力を持つ。\\n{T}：墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。これによりクリーチャー・カード１枚が追放されたとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd2bdea1-8941-46b4-8c38-992c6eec5676\', \'multiverseId\': 631048}, \'multiverseid\': 631048}, {\'name\': \'Caldeirão de Almas de Agatha\', \'text\': \'Você pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para ativar as habilidades de criaturas que você controla.\\nAs criaturas que você controla com marcadores +1/+1 têm todas as habilidades ativadas de todos os cards de criatura exilados com Caldeirão de Almas de Agatha.\\n{T}: Exile o card alvo de um cemitério. Quando um card de criatura for exilado dessa forma, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7836c4e8-9090-40ff-900b-3dd1c125532c\', \'multiverseId\': 631309}, \'multiverseid\': 631309}, {\'name\': \'阿加莎的灵魂鼎镬\', \'text\': \'你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来起动由你操控的生物之异能。\\n对由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物而言，它们具有所有以阿加莎的灵魂鼎镬放逐之生物牌的所有起动式异能。\\n{T}：将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。当以此法放逐一张生物牌时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aa8f702-46e4-4892-918d-8c69dcf95ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 631570}, \'multiverseid\': 631570}]', '[{\'name\': \'Agathas Seelenkessel\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, um Fähigkeiten von Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zu aktivieren.\\nKreaturen mit +1/+1-Marke, die du kontrollierst, haben alle aktivierten Fähigkeiten von Kreaturenkarten, die von Agathas Seelenkessel ins Exil geschickt wurden.\\n{T}: Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Wenn auf diese Weise eine Kreaturenkarte ins Exil geschickt wird, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631899&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24ae7a23-b3dc-4ec0-af66-a9a149dddcec\', \'multiverseId\': 631899}, \'multiverseid\': 631899}, {\'name\': "Chaudron d\'âme d\'Agatha", \'text\': "Vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme si c\'était du mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour activer les capacités des créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez avec des marqueurs +1/+1 sur elles ont toutes les capacités activées de toutes les cartes de créature exilées par le Chaudron d\'âme d\'Agatha.\\n{T} : Exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière. Quand une carte de créature est exilée de cette manière, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38284874-fa34-4b47-8596-e831e7bc6847\', \'multiverseId\': 631946}, \'multiverseid\': 631946}, {\'name\': \'アガサの魂の大釜\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの能力を起動するためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているすべてのクリーチャーは、アガサの魂の大釜によって追放されているすべてのクリーチャー・カードのすべての起動型能力を持つ。\\n{T}：墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。これによりクリーチャー・カード１枚が追放されたとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb6cb995-d0d8-4d4b-bc1f-ac0276ddce23\', \'multiverseId\': 631993}, \'multiverseid\': 631993}, {\'name\': \'阿加莎的灵魂鼎镬\', \'text\': \'你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来起动由你操控的生物之异能。\\n对由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物而言，它们具有所有以阿加莎的灵魂鼎镬放逐之生物牌的所有起动式异能。\\n{T}：将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。当以此法放逐一张生物牌时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c027d59-3a30-43f2-b997-09b798fd61b9\', \'multiverseId\': 632040}, \'multiverseid\': 632040}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anmutiger Kuchenträger\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nFeier — Der Anmutige Kuchenträger hat Doppelschlag, solange in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr bleibende Karten, die keine Länder sind, unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen sind.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Zeit für den Nachtisch, ihr abscheulichen Blutkappen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629777&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b88dd5c-ab20-4185-b3fd-151e8cd701b0\', \'multiverseId\': 629777}, \'multiverseid\': 629777}, {\'name\': \'Portatartas cortés\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nCelebración — El Portatartas cortés tiene la habilidad de dañar dos veces mientras dos o más permanentes que no sean tierra entraran al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero enano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Hora de los postres que mereces, asqueroso gorro rojo!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7333481-c1ea-4f67-b79d-20a4bae19f46\', \'multiverseId\': 630038}, \'multiverseid\': 630038}, {\'name\': \'Porteur de tourtes vaillant\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nCélébration — Le Porteur de tourtes vaillant a la double initiative tant qu\'au moins deux permanents non-terrain sont arrivés sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature — nain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': \'« Voilà tartes que tu mérites, vaurien de bonnet-rouge ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630299&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d38e2f8a-513b-430f-ad29-1374ce16eaec\', \'multiverseId\': 630299}, \'multiverseid\': 630299}, {\'name\': \'Reggitorte Coraggioso\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nCelebrazione — Il Reggitorte Coraggioso ha doppio attacco se due o più permanenti non terra sono entrati nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Spero abbiate ancora spazio per il dolce, maledetti berretti rossi!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab70165a-0128-4ba5-92e5-5d62b1a884a2\', \'multiverseId\': 630560}, \'multiverseid\': 630560}, {\'name\': \'勇敢なパイ使い\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n祝祭 — このターンに土地でない２つ以上のパーマネントがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たことがあるなら、勇敢なパイ使いは二段攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「デザートの時間だ、レッドキャップのクズ共め！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ca88e6f-2783-4cbc-b2a3-a619a66de42f\', \'multiverseId\': 630821}, \'multiverseid\': 630821}, {\'name\': \'Torteiro Galante\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nCelebração — Torteiro Galante tem golpe duplo contanto que duas ou mais permanentes não de terreno tenham entrado no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hora da sobremesa que vocês merecem, seus barretes vermelhos desgraçados!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed97ff6e-afb6-4559-9bdf-fee78528ddb3\', \'multiverseId\': 631082}, \'multiverseid\': 631082}, {\'name\': \'盛装掷饼人\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n欢庆～只要本回合中有两个或更多非地永久物在你的操控下进战场，盛装掷饼人便具有连击异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 矮人／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「红帽混蛋，你们点的报应来了！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe84d0d9-0e5b-4bab-9cae-4cf1f6cd09d8\', \'multiverseId\': 631343}, \'multiverseid\': 631343}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anspruchsvoller Geldgeber\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\\n{2}{W}: Bestimme einen anderen Spieler. Er übernimmt die Kontrolle über einen Schatz deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst. Du ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629772&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb9de4e8-78eb-4f06-9edd-693c0eb2f850\', \'multiverseId\': 629772}, \'multiverseid\': 629772}, {\'name\': \'Financiero con buen ojo\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si un oponente controla más tierras que tú, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\\n{2}{W}: Elige otro jugador. Ese jugador gana el control del Tesoro objetivo que controlas. Robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01029a51-fbe3-4394-b20b-732a398183a6\', \'multiverseId\': 630033}, \'multiverseid\': 630033}, {\'name\': \'Financier judicieux\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\\n{2}{W} : Choisissez un autre joueur. Ce joueur acquiert le contrôle d\'un trésor ciblé que vous contrôlez. Vous piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630294&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1417b8a5-3c03-45f8-9041-b7c9d21d62b1\', \'multiverseId\': 630294}, \'multiverseid\': 630294}, {\'name\': \'Finanziatore Accorto\', \'text\': \'All\\\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se un avversario controlla più terre di te, crei una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\\n{2}{W}: Scegli un altro giocatore. Quel giocatore prende il controllo di un Tesoro bersaglio che controlli. Peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71bdf409-0da0-4216-a63d-bd2fc03d55e1\', \'multiverseId\': 630555}, \'multiverseid\': 630555}, {\'name\': \'具眼の資本家\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n{2}{W}：あなたがコントロールしている宝物１つを対象とする。あなたでないプレイヤー１人を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーはそれのコントロールを得る。あなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'977f5fc1-3597-495e-8eeb-ba288ab96cd9\', \'multiverseId\': 630816}, \'multiverseid\': 630816}, {\'name\': \'Financiador Exigente\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se um oponente controlar mais terrenos que você, crie uma ficha de Tesouro. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".)\\n{2}{W}: Escolha outro jogador. Aquele jogador ganha o controle do Tesouro alvo que você controla. Você compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e06c170a-eccd-4f32-ada3-90488b3c0449\', \'multiverseId\': 631077}, \'multiverseid\': 631077}, {\'name\': \'锐眼权贵\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若某对手操控的地比你多，则你派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\\n{2}{W}：选择另一位牌手。该牌手获得目标由你操控的珍宝之操控权。你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2a2083f-3c4f-45ef-b7fd-3a88f359ce2d\', \'multiverseId\': 631338}, \'multiverseid\': 631338}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anstürmender Radaubruder\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Anstürmende Radaubruder angreift, erhält er für jede angreifende Kreatur +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls eine Ratte angreift, verursacht der Anstürmende Radaubruder Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': \'„Bald werden die Ratten diese Stadt regieren, also werde ich mich ihnen anschließen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632094&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c6eb728-42b7-41b0-b821-f8e2e4baa5e2\', \'multiverseId\': 632094}, \'multiverseid\': 632094}, {\'name\': \'Gamberro a la carga\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Gamberro a la carga ataque, obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno por cada criatura atacante. Si una Rata está atacando, el Gamberro a la carga gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Plebeyo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Las ratas invadirán pronto esta ciudad ¡y yo las acompañaré!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ffb0a6-75b5-4886-b753-9fb4575e9f51\', \'multiverseId\': 632109}, \'multiverseid\': 632109}, {\'name\': \'Aigrefin chargeur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Aigrefin chargeur attaque, il gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque créature attaquante. Si un rat attaque, l\'Aigrefin chargeur acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et paysan\', \'flavor\': \'« Ces rats vont bientôt contrôler toute la ville, alors autant les avoir dans ma poche ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632124&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3dd13c6-c413-492e-89a4-4be17ccd3c87\', \'multiverseId\': 632124}, \'multiverseid\': 632124}, {\'name\': \'Teppista alla Carica\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Teppista alla Carica attacca, prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno per ogni creatura attaccante. Se un Ratto sta attaccando, il Teppista alla Carica ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Popolano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Presto i ratti saranno in carica di questa città, tanto vale caricare con loro!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be3afe1e-28d7-498a-b342-b63426a3f2ae\', \'multiverseId\': 632139}, \'multiverseid\': 632139}, {\'name\': \'突進する悪党\', \'text\': \'突進する悪党が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは攻撃クリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。ネズミが攻撃しているなら、ターン終了時まで、突進する悪党はトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・農民\', \'flavor\': \'「じきにネズミがこの街を走る。俺も一緒に走ろうじゃないか！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c703ea1-dace-4a75-b7c8-df55106d4dbc\', \'multiverseId\': 632154}, \'multiverseid\': 632154}, {\'name\': \'Vândalo em Carga\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Vândalo em Carga ataca, ele recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno por cada criatura atacante. Se um Rato estiver atacando, Vândalo em Carga ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Plebeu\', \'flavor\': \'"Logo os ratos vão dominar esta cidade, e eu estarei do lado deles!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ae5ddf0-b23e-43d7-95b0-7fee79d1122a\', \'multiverseId\': 632169}, \'multiverseid\': 632169}, {\'name\': \'莽撞小混混\', \'text\': \'每当莽撞小混混攻击时，每有一个进行攻击的生物，它便得+1/+0直到回合结束。若有老鼠正进行攻击，则莽撞小混混获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／平民\', \'flavor\': \'「这城很快会被老鼠接管，我要和它们一起撒欢！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ecef1f2-8ac4-48e3-bece-fa2e8a45e1b0\', \'multiverseId\': 632184}, \'multiverseid\': 632184}]', '[{\'name\': \'Appell an den Spiegel\', \'text\': \'Feilschen (Du kannst ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder einen Spielstein opfern, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte, schicke sie verdeckt ins Exil und mische danach. Falls um diesen Zauberspruch gefeilscht wurde, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen, falls der Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs 4 oder weniger ist. Nimm die ins Exil geschickte Karte auf deine Hand, falls sie nicht auf diese Weise gewirkt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629844&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbf46f86-8414-41ab-a3c8-5e88287d32fc\', \'multiverseId\': 629844}, \'multiverseid\': 629844}, {\'name\': \'Suplicarle al espejo\', \'text\': \'Negociar. (Puedes sacrificar un artefacto, encantamiento o ficha al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nBusca en tu biblioteca una carta, exíliala boca abajo y luego baraja. Si este hechizo fue negociado, puedes lanzar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná si el valor de maná de ese hechizo es de 4 o menos. Pon la carta exiliada en tu mano si no fue lanzada de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'800e78c7-cae3-48cc-b4ce-666073d27c37\', \'multiverseId\': 630105}, \'multiverseid\': 630105}, {\'name\': \'Implorer le miroir\', \'text\': "Négociation (Vous pouvez sacrifier un artefact, un enchantement ou un jeton au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nCherchez une carte dans votre bibliothèque, exilez-la face cachée, puis mélangez. Si ce sort a été négocié, vous pouvez lancer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si la valeur de mana de ce sort est inférieure ou égale à 4. Mettez la carte exilée dans votre main si elle n\'a pas été lancée de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630366&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f1695a3-66b1-4606-8a8d-2a0d351f2ddf\', \'multiverseId\': 630366}, \'multiverseid\': 630366}, {\'name\': \'Implorare lo Specchio\', \'text\': \'Negoziare (Puoi sacrificare un artefatto, un incantesimo o una pedina mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta, esiliala a faccia in giù, poi rimescola. Se questa magia è stata negoziata, puoi lanciare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se il valore di mana di quella magia è pari o inferiore a 4. Se non è stata lanciata in questo modo, aggiungi la carta esiliata alla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'300f9d9c-ca9b-40ec-90ee-39d3613a2ea7\', \'multiverseId\': 630627}, \'multiverseid\': 630627}, {\'name\': \'鏡に願いを\', \'text\': \'協約（この呪文を唱えるに際し、アーティファクトやエンチャントやトークンのうち１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。）\\nあなたのライブラリーからカード１枚を探し、裏向きで追放する。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。この呪文が協約されているなら、その追放されたカードを、それの呪文としてのマナ総量が４以下であるなら、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。これによりそれを唱えなかったなら、その追放されたカードをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03e365c2-9093-4332-a6fb-ab0fd71bb51b\', \'multiverseId\': 630888}, \'multiverseid\': 630888}, {\'name\': \'Rogar ao Espelho\', \'text\': \'Negociar (Você pode sacrificar um artefato, um encantamento ou uma ficha conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nProcure em seu grimório um card, exile-o com a face voltada para baixo e depois embaralhe. Se esta mágica foi negociada, você pode conjurar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana se o valor de mana daquela mágica for igual ou inferior a 4. Coloque o card exilado em sua mão se ele não tiver sido conjurado dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd89c7f1-abdb-4aba-af0e-1fe5ee96641d\', \'multiverseId\': 631149}, \'multiverseid\': 631149}, {\'name\': \'恳求魔镜\', \'text\': \'加码（你施放此咒语时可以牺牲一个神器，结界或衍生物。）\\n从你牌库中搜寻一张牌，将它牌面朝下地放逐，然后洗牌。若此咒语已加码，则如果所放逐之牌施放时的咒语之法术力值等于或小于4，你便可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果未以此法施放该牌，则将所放逐的牌置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887f9398-aa01-43ae-be0b-aa7b37f04d47\', \'multiverseId\': 631410}, \'multiverseid\': 631410}]', '[{\'name\': \'Appell an den Spiegel\', \'text\': \'Feilschen\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte, schicke sie verdeckt ins Exil und mische danach. Falls um diesen Zauberspruch gefeilscht wurde, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen, falls der Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs 4 oder weniger ist. Nimm die ins Exil geschickte Karte auf deine Hand, falls sie nicht auf diese Weise gewirkt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631869&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24408231-a1cc-49c3-9cd0-890d153d0e88\', \'multiverseId\': 631869}, \'multiverseid\': 631869}, {\'name\': \'Implorer le miroir\', \'text\': "Négociation\\nCherchez une carte dans votre bibliothèque, exilez-la face cachée, puis mélangez. Si ce sort a été négocié, vous pouvez lancer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si la valeur de mana de ce sort est inférieure ou égale à 4. Mettez la carte exilée dans votre main si elle n\'a pas été lancée de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631916&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebb9390a-dd4b-4e47-813a-fa333e0f4be7\', \'multiverseId\': 631916}, \'multiverseid\': 631916}, {\'name\': \'鏡に願いを\', \'text\': \'協約\\nあなたのライブラリーからカード１枚を探し、裏向きで追放する。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。この呪文が協約されているなら、その追放されたカードを、それの呪文としてのマナ総量が４以下であるなら、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。これによりそれを唱えなかったなら、その追放されたカードをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85d8fdbc-0331-4a38-ad17-3098d9f27fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 631963}, \'multiverseid\': 631963}, {\'name\': \'恳求魔镜\', \'text\': \'加码\\n从你牌库中搜寻一张牌，将它牌面朝下地放逐，然后洗牌。若此咒语已加码，则如果所放逐之牌施放时的咒语之法术力值等于或小于4，你便可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果未以此法施放该牌，则将所放逐的牌置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c7fded-d376-4c8f-ac1b-a81f7c5cc333\', \'multiverseId\': 632010}, \'multiverseid\': 632010}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aquatic Alchemist // Hochblubbern\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erhält der Aquatische Alchemist +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Aquatic Alchemist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629802&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f88b49c-9021-4f1b-826f-c986ca82ff71\', \'multiverseId\': 629802}, \'multiverseid\': 629802}, {\'name\': \'Aquatic Alchemist // Borbotear\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances tu primer hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro cada turno, la Alquimista de agua obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Aquatic Alchemist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c053fcf7-012d-43d8-8b65-45c0dd266fc9\', \'multiverseId\': 630063}, \'multiverseid\': 630063}, {\'name\': \'Aquatic Alchemist // Bouillonner\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez votre premier sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel à chaque tour, l\'Alchimiste aquatique gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Aquatic Alchemist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630324&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4630ff0-aec8-41cf-a0c7-b2338507eed4\', \'multiverseId\': 630324}, \'multiverseid\': 630324}, {\'name\': \'Aquatic Alchemist // Tornare a Galla\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci la tua prima magia istantaneo o stregoneria in ogni turno, l\'Alchimista Acquatico prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Aquatic Alchemist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a5d94c-654b-4e52-bf02-44fbff82ec43\', \'multiverseId\': 630585}, \'multiverseid\': 630585}, {\'name\': \'Aquatic Alchemist // 泡（あわ）立（だ）て\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの１つ目のインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、水生まれの錬金術師は＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Aquatic Alchemist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'636d9c20-914b-4e42-b9a3-73687060803d\', \'multiverseId\': 630846}, \'multiverseid\': 630846}, {\'name\': \'Aquatic Alchemist // Borbulhar\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura sua primeira mágica instantânea ou feitiço a cada turno, Alquimista Aquático recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Aquatic Alchemist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aae5a240-d9fb-4a7a-a178-c73cf1ca83bf\', \'multiverseId\': 631107}, \'multiverseid\': 631107}, {\'name\': \'Aquatic Alchemist // 水泡浮升\', \'text\': \'每当你施放每回合中你的第一个瞬间或法术咒语时，水生炼金术士得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Aquatic Alchemist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eb9cf71-5f39-49e6-8776-8e9e7125596e\', \'multiverseId\': 631368}, \'multiverseid\': 631368}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archivdrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nAbwehr {2} (Immer wenn diese Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {2}.)\\nWenn der Archivdrache ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Faszinierend. Hier steht, dass Drachen nicht lesen können."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629803&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89eadf6b-bb27-4ae3-b440-4ceb4416a777\', \'multiverseId\': 629803}, \'multiverseid\': 629803}, {\'name\': \'Dragón del archivo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nRebatir {2}. (Siempre que esta criatura sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarréstalo a menos que ese jugador pague {2}.)\\nCuando el Dragón del archivo entre al campo de batalla, adivina 2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"Fascinante. Aquí dice que los dragones no saben leer".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf6b70bb-a715-4abe-986a-4eb0ed23d5fe\', \'multiverseId\': 630064}, \'multiverseid\': 630064}, {\'name\': \'Dragon des archives\', \'text\': "Vol\\nParade {2} (À chaque fois que cette créature devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {2}.)\\nQuand le Dragon des archives arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 2.", \'type\': \'Créature — dragon et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Fascinant. Ce livre explique que les dragons ne savent pas lire. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630325&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51ea3609-5e3c-453d-b2c5-6346f09103da\', \'multiverseId\': 630325}, \'multiverseid\': 630325}, {\'name\': "Drago dell\'Archivio", \'text\': "Volare\\nEgida {2} (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {2}.)\\nQuando il Drago dell\'Archivio entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 2.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"Interessante. Dice che i draghi non sanno leggere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5583c31d-fba7-4165-a076-6f1254cba772\', \'multiverseId\': 630586}, \'multiverseid\': 630586}, {\'name\': \'書庫のドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n護法{2}（このクリーチャーが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\\n書庫のドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「実に興味深い。ドラゴンは文字が読めないとこの本には書いてある。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d1f83d0-f0ef-4796-b516-d325899a979e\', \'multiverseId\': 630847}, \'multiverseid\': 630847}, {\'name\': \'Dragão do Arquivo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nSalvaguarda {2} (Toda vez que esta criatura se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, anule-a, a menos que aquele jogador pague {2}.)\\nQuando Dragão do Arquivo entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Fascinante. Aqui diz que os dragões não sabem ler..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40daa847-c661-4fa3-931d-fc8a4d32618e\', \'multiverseId\': 631108}, \'multiverseid\': 631108}, {\'name\': \'书库巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n守护{2}（每当此生物成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该牌手支付{2}，否则反击之。）\\n当书库巨龙进战场时，占卜2。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 龙／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「真有趣。这里写着龙不识字。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1edf0153-f090-452f-828b-47b6b62c5a37\', \'multiverseId\': 631369}, \'multiverseid\': 631369}]', "[{'name': 'Archon der Wilden Rose', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die von Auren, die du kontrollierst, verzaubert sind, haben Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 4/4 und Flugfähigkeit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Archon', 'flavor': 'Der Fluch der Rotzahnburg konnte nur von einer mystischen Rose, die im Mondlicht blüht, gebrochen werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629763&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9311f10-e874-487b-a772-9d40cf70215c', 'multiverseId': 629763}, 'multiverseid': 629763}, {'name': 'Arconte de las rosas salvajes', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas que están encantadas por Auras que controlas tienen una fuerza y resistencia base de 4/4 y la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Arconte', 'flavor': 'La maldición de la Fortaleza de Dienterrojo solo podía romperse con una rosa mística que florece a la luz de la luna.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630024&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03e21611-d4a3-4b64-800e-96d5c175a744', 'multiverseId': 630024}, 'multiverseid': 630024}, {'name': 'Archonte des rosiers sauvages', 'text': 'Vol\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez qui sont enchantées par des auras que vous contrôlez ont une force et une endurance de base de 4/4 et ont le vol.', 'type': 'Créature — archonte', 'flavor': 'La malédiction de la Forteresse de Croc-rouge ne pouvait être brisée que par une rose mystique qui fleurit au clair de lune.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630285&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ff3e698-7c5b-4955-9807-e52c0259419e', 'multiverseId': 630285}, 'multiverseid': 630285}, {'name': 'Arconte della Rosa Selvatica', 'text': 'Volare\\nLe altre creature che controlli e che sono incantate da Aure che controlli hanno forza e costituzione base 4/4 e volare.', 'type': 'Creatura — Arconte', 'flavor': 'La maledizione di Fortezza Zannarossa può essere spezzata solamente da una mistica rosa che fiorisce alla luce della luna.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630546&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35a31d33-fd2e-42d2-9fba-532e57814bca', 'multiverseId': 630546}, 'multiverseid': 630546}, {'name': '野薔薇のアルコン', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているオーラがついていて、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは基本のパワーとタフネスが４/４になり、飛行を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 執政官', 'flavor': '赤歯砦の呪いは、月明かりに咲く神秘的な薔薇でのみ解くことができる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630807&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '464060cb-df8c-474c-a385-3154fde61c54', 'multiverseId': 630807}, 'multiverseid': 630807}, {'name': 'Arconte da Rosa Selvagem', 'text': 'Voar\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla que estejam encantadas por Auras que você controla têm poder e resistência básicos 4/4 e têm voar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Arconte', 'flavor': 'A maldição da Bastilha de Rubrodente só podia ser quebrada por uma rosa mística que desabrocha ao luar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631068&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6cf0e21-a5b0-4f05-89a9-8377a855a27c', 'multiverseId': 631068}, 'multiverseid': 631068}, {'name': '野玫瑰统领', 'text': '飞行\\n对由你操控且受有由你操控之灵气的其他生物而言，它们的基础力量与防御力为4/4且具有飞行异能。', 'type': '生物 — 统领', 'flavor': '赤牙砦下的诅咒，唯有午夜盛开的神秘玫瑰方能解开。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631329&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8807d7e0-2a80-4ead-aa7d-8bd929d6d22b', 'multiverseId': 631329}, 'multiverseid': 631329}]", "[{'name': 'Archon der Wilden Rose', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die von Auren, die du kontrollierst, verzaubert sind, haben Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 4/4 und Flugfähigkeit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Archon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631856&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fea1204a-e803-4a96-b05e-75246d13f6a2', 'multiverseId': 631856}, 'multiverseid': 631856}, {'name': 'Archonte des rosiers sauvages', 'text': 'Vol\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez qui sont enchantées par des auras que vous contrôlez ont une force et une endurance de base de 4/4 et ont le vol.', 'type': 'Créature — archonte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631903&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '193c6e22-777c-403f-a9e4-5fbd50f3d9af', 'multiverseId': 631903}, 'multiverseid': 631903}, {'name': '野薔薇のアルコン', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているオーラがついていて、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは基本のパワーとタフネスが４/４になり、飛行を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 執政官', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631950&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c423b743-9748-466f-a46e-de0f9c2d3a25', 'multiverseId': 631950}, 'multiverseid': 631950}, {'name': '野玫瑰统领', 'text': '飞行\\n对由你操控且受有由你操控之灵气的其他生物而言，它们的基础力量与防御力为4/4且具有飞行异能。', 'type': '生物 — 统领', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631997&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd168a702-b235-4b94-bce9-8c6ab8f5b4ca', 'multiverseId': 631997}, 'multiverseid': 631997}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ashiok, boshafte Manipulation\', \'text\': \'Falls du Lebenspunkte bezahlen würdest, während deine Bibliothek mindestens entsprechend viele Karten enthält, schicke stattdessen entsprechend viele Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil.\\n+1: Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Schicke eine davon ins Exil und nimm die andere auf deine Hand.\\n−2: Erzeuge zwei 1/1 schwarze Nachtmahr-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls in diesem Zug eine Karte ins Exil geschickt wurde, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur."\\n−7: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl schickt die obersten X Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, wobei X gleich dem Gesamt-Manabetrag der Karten ist, die du besitzt und die sich im Exil befinden.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629840&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74c2a6e9-6852-4bfe-b21e-cf21b547176b\', \'multiverseId\': 629840}, \'multiverseid\': 629840}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, la Manipulación Vil\', \'text\': \'Si fueras a pagar vidas mientras tu biblioteca tiene al menos esa misma cantidad de cartas, en vez de eso, exilia esa misma cantidad de cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\n+1: Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Exilia una de ellas y pon la otra en tu mano.\\n−2: Crea dos fichas de criatura Pesadilla negras 1/1 con "Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si una carta fue al exilio este turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura".\\n−7: El jugador objetivo exilia las X primeras cartas de su biblioteca, donde X es el valor de maná total de las cartas de las cuales eres propietario en el exilio.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d30f1c3-1835-4057-b4cc-30116865b010\', \'multiverseId\': 630101}, \'multiverseid\': 630101}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, manipulateur maléfique\', \'text\': "Si vous deviez payer des points de vie alors que votre bibliothèque contient au moins autant de cartes, exilez autant de cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque à la place.\\n+1: Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Exilez l\'une d\'elles et mettez l\'autre dans votre main.\\n−2: Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 noire Cauchemar avec « Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si une carte a été mise en exil ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature. »\\n−7: Un joueur ciblé exile les X cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque, X étant la valeur de mana totale des cartes que vous possédez en exil.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630362&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'477b78cb-38a0-46b1-abfb-49b35a58008a\', \'multiverseId\': 630362}, \'multiverseid\': 630362}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, Manipolatore Perfido\', \'text\': \'Se stai per pagare punti vita mentre il tuo grimorio ha almeno altrettante carte, esilia invece altrettante carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\n+1: Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Esiliane una e aggiungi l\\\'altra alla tua mano.\\n−2: Crea due pedine creatura Incubo 1/1 nere con "All\\\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se una carta è stata messa in esilio in questo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura".\\n−7: Un giocatore bersaglio esilia le prime X carte del suo grimorio, dove X è il valore di mana totale delle carte che possiedi in esilio.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9056ac92-4270-4ae5-b908-71822c522d27\', \'multiverseId\': 630623}, \'multiverseid\': 630623}, {\'name\': \'忌まわしき干渉者、アショク\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーに支払う点数以上の枚数のカードがある間にライフを支払うなら、代わりにあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるその点数に等しい枚数のカードを追放する。\\n+1：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見る。そのうち１枚を追放し、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。\\n-2：「あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、このターンにカードが追放領域に置かれた場合、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。」を持つ黒の１/１のナイトメア・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\n-7：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を追放する。Ｘは、あなたがオーナーであり追放領域にあるカードのマナ総量の合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アショク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f157226-9600-485b-98f4-4323a6686da9\', \'multiverseId\': 630884}, \'multiverseid\': 630884}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, a Manipulação Vil\', \'text\': \'Se você pagaria pontos de vida enquanto seu grimório tivesse ao menos aquela quantidade de cards, em vez disso, exile aquela quantidade de cards do topo de seu grimório.\\n+1: Olhe os dois cards do topo do seu grimório. Exile um deles e coloque o outro em sua mão.\\n−2: Crie duas fichas de criatura Pesadelo preta 1/1 com "No início do combate no seu turno, se um card tiver sido colocado no exílio neste turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura".\\n−7: O jogador alvo exila os X cards do topo do próprio grimório, sendo X o valor de mana total dos cards que você possui no exílio.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db8896fb-e48f-478f-b079-cdacd67dbc35\', \'multiverseId\': 631145}, \'multiverseid\': 631145}, {\'name\': \'弄恶安梭苛\', \'text\': \'如果你将支付生命时你牌库中有至少相同数量的牌，则改为从你牌库顶放逐等量的牌。\\n+1：检视你牌库顶的两张牌。将其中一张放逐，另一张则置于你手上。\\n−2：派出两个1/1黑色梦魇衍生生物，且具有「在你回合的战斗开始时，若本回合中有牌进入放逐区，则在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。」\\n−7：目标牌手放逐其牌库顶的X张牌，X为放逐区中由你拥有之牌的法术力值总和。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 — 安梭苛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'919212f8-0b72-4e79-8d11-cec28b7f89b0\', \'multiverseId\': 631406}, \'multiverseid\': 631406}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashiok, boshafte Manipulation\', \'text\': \'Falls du Lebenspunkte bezahlen würdest, während deine Bibliothek mindestens entsprechend viele Karten enthält, schicke stattdessen entsprechend viele Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil.\\n+1: Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Schicke eine davon ins Exil und nimm die andere auf deine Hand.\\n−2: Erzeuge zwei 1/1 schwarze Nachtmahr-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls in diesem Zug eine Karte ins Exil geschickt wurde, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur."\\n−7: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl schickt die obersten X Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, wobei X gleich dem Gesamt-Manabetrag der Karten ist, die du besitzt und die sich im Exil befinden.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631791&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66941f1d-9be0-44d1-92e7-36a117b1e7fa\', \'multiverseId\': 631791}, \'multiverseid\': 631791}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, la Manipulación Vil\', \'text\': \'Si fueras a pagar vidas mientras tu biblioteca tiene al menos esa misma cantidad de cartas, en vez de eso, exilia esa misma cantidad de cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\n+1: Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Exilia una de ellas y pon la otra en tu mano.\\n−2: Crea dos fichas de criatura Pesadilla negras 1/1 con "Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si una carta fue al exilio este turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura".\\n−7: El jugador objetivo exilia las X primeras cartas de su biblioteca, donde X es el valor de maná total de las cartas de las cuales eres propietario en el exilio.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'536f0e19-bc57-48ca-8e47-00a472a5f55c\', \'multiverseId\': 631792}, \'multiverseid\': 631792}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, manipulateur maléfique\', \'text\': "Si vous deviez payer des points de vie alors que votre bibliothèque contient au moins autant de cartes, exilez autant de cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque à la place.\\n+1: Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Exilez l\'une d\'elles et mettez l\'autre dans votre main.\\n−2: Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 noire Cauchemar avec « Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si une carte a été mise en exil ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature. »\\n−7: Un joueur ciblé exile les X cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque, X étant la valeur de mana totale des cartes que vous possédez en exil.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631793&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a297d7ca-4033-4751-aa96-4626564f3fc1\', \'multiverseId\': 631793}, \'multiverseid\': 631793}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, Manipolatore Perfido\', \'text\': \'Se stai per pagare punti vita mentre il tuo grimorio ha almeno altrettante carte, esilia invece altrettante carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\n+1: Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Esiliane una e aggiungi l\\\'altra alla tua mano.\\n−2: Crea due pedine creatura Incubo 1/1 nere con "All\\\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se una carta è stata messa in esilio in questo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura".\\n−7: Un giocatore bersaglio esilia le prime X carte del suo grimorio, dove X è il valore di mana totale delle carte che possiedi in esilio.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62bc5c82-36bc-4507-a6e0-91732c1b511e\', \'multiverseId\': 631794}, \'multiverseid\': 631794}, {\'name\': \'忌まわしき干渉者、アショク\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーに支払う点数以上の枚数のカードがある間にライフを支払うなら、代わりにあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるその点数に等しい枚数のカードを追放する。\\n+1：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見る。そのうち１枚を追放し、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。\\n-2：「あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、このターンにカードが追放領域に置かれた場合、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。」を持つ黒の１/１のナイトメア・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\n-7：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を追放する。Ｘは、あなたがオーナーであり追放領域にあるカードのマナ総量の合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アショク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d287e91-4f65-4311-a964-d86cf082b3bb\', \'multiverseId\': 631795}, \'multiverseid\': 631795}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, a Manipulação Vil\', \'text\': \'Se você pagaria pontos de vida enquanto seu grimório tivesse ao menos aquela quantidade de cards, em vez disso, exile aquela quantidade de cards do topo de seu grimório.\\n+1: Olhe os dois cards do topo do seu grimório. Exile um deles e coloque o outro em sua mão.\\n−2: Crie duas fichas de criatura Pesadelo preta 1/1 com "No início do combate no seu turno, se um card tiver sido colocado no exílio neste turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura".\\n−7: O jogador alvo exila os X cards do topo do próprio grimório, sendo X o valor de mana total dos cards que você possui no exílio.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1c768f5-c5d2-4613-9827-afa24f455524\', \'multiverseId\': 631796}, \'multiverseid\': 631796}, {\'name\': \'弄恶安梭苛\', \'text\': \'如果你将支付生命时你牌库中有至少相同数量的牌，则改为从你牌库顶放逐等量的牌。\\n+1：检视你牌库顶的两张牌。将其中一张放逐，另一张则置于你手上。\\n−2：派出两个1/1黑色梦魇衍生生物，且具有「在你回合的战斗开始时，若本回合中有牌进入放逐区，则在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。」\\n−7：目标牌手放逐其牌库顶的X张牌，X为放逐区中由你拥有之牌的法术力值总和。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 — 安梭苛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30dda817-1c56-4977-b852-2064ae01ac0f\', \'multiverseId\': 631797}, \'multiverseid\': 631797}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashioks Schnitter\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Verzauberung, die du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nachtmahr\', \'flavor\': \'Nevas Träume waren von Erinnerungen an die Invasion geplagt — von Öl geschwärzte Ranken, die durch den Nebel nach ihr griffen. Oder … war dies etwas Neues?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629841&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'895edb24-cdae-4609-a388-18bfa82dec1c\', \'multiverseId\': 629841}, \'multiverseid\': 629841}, {\'name\': \'Parca de Ashiok\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un encantamiento que controlas vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadilla\', \'flavor\': \'Los recuerdos de la invasión atormentaban a Nieves en sus sueños: unos oleosos zarcillos negros tratando de agarrarla entre la niebla. O... ¿era algo nuevo?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e0e825-53a3-4e5d-b4bc-e6a7232bb987\', \'multiverseId\': 630102}, \'multiverseid\': 630102}, {\'name\': "Faucheur d\'Ashiok", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — cauchemar\', \'flavor\': "Les rêves de Néva étaient hantés par les souvenirs de l\'invasion—des vrilles de pétrole noir qui tentaient de l\'attraper dans la brume. Ou... était-ce autre chose ?", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630363&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60961047-b3bd-49cc-ad21-7b06a798cda5\', \'multiverseId\': 630363}, \'multiverseid\': 630363}, {\'name\': \'Mietitore di Ashiok\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo che controlli viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Incubo\', \'flavor\': "I sogni di Nives erano infestati dai ricordi dell\'invasione: tentacoli neri come la pece che la afferravano nella nebbia. O... era qualcos\'altro?", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6969fa8f-6512-4129-9307-aff591f01609\', \'multiverseId\': 630624}, \'multiverseid\': 630624}, {\'name\': \'アショクの死神\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているエンチャント１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナイトメア\', \'flavor\': \'ネヴァの夢は、侵攻の記憶に取り憑かれていた――それは霧の中、黒く、油ぎった蔦が彼女に絡みつく夢だった。あるいは……新たな何かだったろうか？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e97dc0fc-6163-4509-8f94-e67e4e7b3e24\', \'multiverseId\': 630885}, \'multiverseid\': 630885}, {\'name\': \'Ceifador de Ashiok\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um encantamento que você controla for colocado em um cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadelo\', \'flavor\': \'Os sonhos de Neva eram assombrados pelas lembranças da invasão: tentáculos de óleo negro saindo da névoa para agarrá-la. Ou… será que aquilo era alguma coisa nova?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83a7913b-7897-4384-8b62-f82067f46164\', \'multiverseId\': 631146}, \'multiverseid\': 631146}, {\'name\': \'安梭苛的镰刀手\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的结界从战场进入坟墓场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 梦魇\', \'flavor\': \'大侵攻记忆在白涅娃梦中萦绕不散～经常会有油黑触手穿过迷雾向她袭来。或者…这次是不同的东西？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29fff40a-e647-4e43-a2fa-ce89f6364df6\', \'multiverseId\': 631407}, \'multiverseid\': 631407}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aska, selbstgeladener Gast\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nFeier — Immer wenn Aska, selbstgeladener Gast, angreift und falls zwei oder mehr bleibende Karten, die keine Länder sind, in diesem Zug unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen sind, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Aska.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': \'„Steht auf und tanzt! Lasst eure Füße donnern wie Schmiedehämmer!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f08eced8-d5b9-4d36-8062-85b87c960362\', \'multiverseId\': 629963}, \'multiverseid\': 629963}, {\'name\': \'Cinisia, reina de la fiesta\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCelebración — Siempre que Cinisia, reina de la fiesta ataque, si dos o más permanentes que no sean tierra entraron al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Cinisia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Plebeyo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Levántense y bailen! ¡Que sus pies atruenen como los martillos de una forja!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9836f9df-4de8-4d7a-9f76-4fcba66691af\', \'multiverseId\': 630224}, \'multiverseid\': 630224}, {\'name\': \'Cendrilaine, trouble-fête\', \'text\': \'Célérité\\nCélébration — À chaque fois que Cendrilaine, trouble-fête attaque, si au moins deux permanents non-terrain sont arrivés sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Cendrilaine.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et paysan\', \'flavor\': "« Levez-vous et dansez ! Que vos pieds martèlent le sol comme les marteaux l\'enclume ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630485&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'275a28bd-2ba1-49e4-ad0a-4b20f094e790\', \'multiverseId\': 630485}, \'multiverseid\': 630485}, {\'name\': \'Cenerella, Intrusa della Festa\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nCelebrazione — Ogniqualvolta Cenerella, Intrusa della Festa attacca, se due o più permanenti non terra sono entrati nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Cenerella.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Popolano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Alzatevi e danzate! Fate tuonare i piedi come martelli sull\\\'incudine!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bd12274-29bc-4b0f-8516-c6f634a0f069\', \'multiverseId\': 630746}, \'multiverseid\': 630746}, {\'name\': \'パーティー破り、アッシュ\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n祝祭 — パーティー破り、アッシュが攻撃するたび、このターンに土地でない２つ以上のパーマネントがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たことがある場合、パーティー破り、アッシュの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・農民\', \'flavor\': \'「さあ踊りなさい！鍛冶鎚のように靴を鳴らすのよ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdc14235-05c4-4f50-9d23-b72b0d90dd0e\', \'multiverseId\': 631007}, \'multiverseid\': 631007}, {\'name\': \'Cinzerela, Penetra da Festa\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nCelebração — Toda vez que Cinzerela, Penetra da Festa, atacar, se duas ou mais permanentes não de terreno tiverem entrado no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Cinzerela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Plebeu\', \'flavor\': \'"Levantem-se e dancem! Deixem os pés ribombarem como os martelos da forja!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c139598-be26-49e2-aa3b-704353caff99\', \'multiverseId\': 631268}, \'multiverseid\': 631268}, {\'name\': \'舞会红人灰钴娘\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n欢庆～每当舞会红人灰钴娘攻击时，若本回合中有两个或更多非地永久物在你的操控下进战场，则在灰钴娘上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／平民\', \'flavor\': \'「起身，跳舞！踏动双脚，震撼发声，如铸锤般作响！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef82484-e7b1-48cf-b138-ea24736a7de8\', \'multiverseId\': 631529}, \'multiverseid\': 631529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf Eis legen\', \'text\': \'Feilschen (Du kannst ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder einen Spielstein opfern, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nDieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {1} weniger, falls um ihn gefeilscht wurde.\\nNeutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Hylda machte Eisfiguren aus all jenen, die den Worten „bleib mir fern" keine Beachtung schenkten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629816&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1275993f-3c57-4441-a8f5-ab1f7a54c47a\', \'multiverseId\': 629816}, \'multiverseid\': 629816}, {\'name\': \'Congelar hasta las ideas\', \'text\': \'Negociar. (Puedes sacrificar un artefacto, encantamiento o ficha al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo si es negociado.\\nContrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Hylda juntó una colección de estatuas de hielo con todos los que no comprendieron las palabras "Fuera de aquí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98e13b27-04ce-42f6-85b3-720ac582e5b7\', \'multiverseId\': 630077}, \'multiverseid\': 630077}, {\'name\': \'Dégel\', \'text\': "Négociation (Vous pouvez sacrifier un artefact, un enchantement ou un jeton au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nCe sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer s\'il est négocié.\\nContrecarrez un sort ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Hylda créa un statuaire de glace constitué de tous ceux qui ne comprenaient pas les mots « Laissez-moi tranquille ».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630338&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'544dda14-5441-4237-a178-b1ea0dc5d93c\', \'multiverseId\': 630338}, \'multiverseid\': 630338}, {\'name\': \'Reagire con Freddezza\', \'text\': \'Negoziare (Puoi sacrificare un artefatto, un incantesimo o una pedina mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nQuesta magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata se è stata negoziata.\\nNeutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Hylda creò una collezione di statue di ghiaccio composta da tutti coloro che non avevano capito "vattene".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'037a9561-058f-4521-aaac-069acc91229d\', \'multiverseId\': 630599}, \'multiverseid\': 630599}, {\'name\': \'氷封\', \'text\': \'協約（この呪文を唱えるに際し、アーティファクトやエンチャントやトークンのうち１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。）\\nこれが協約されていたなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ヒルダは「立ち去れ」が理解できないもののために氷の彫像を作った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ba50d83-af08-413c-8afb-9a5ba1754ec5\', \'multiverseId\': 630860}, \'multiverseid\': 630860}, {\'name\': \'Gelar\', \'text\': \'Negociar (Você pode sacrificar um artefato, um encantamento ou uma ficha conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nEsta mágica custa {1} a menos para conjurar se tiver sido negociada.\\nAnule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Hylda criou uma coleção de estátuas de gelo com todos aqueles incapazes de entender o significado de "vá embora".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8be3aad-d6e5-4110-9fc2-64f3dd36fd12\', \'multiverseId\': 631121}, \'multiverseid\': 631121}, {\'name\': \'凝冰抗袭\', \'text\': \'加码（你施放此咒语时可以牺牲一个神器，结界或衍生物。）\\n如果此咒语已加码，则它减少{1}来施放。\\n反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'希尔妲将那些装作听不懂「走开」命令的人全都冻作一尊冰雕，以儆效尤。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd039e89-ac9b-4644-afa8-d0c598ce0544\', \'multiverseId\': 631382}, \'multiverseid\': 631382}]', "[{'name': 'Aufblühende Schildkröte', 'text': 'Immer wenn die Aufblühende Schildkröte ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, millst du drei Karten und bringst dann eine Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\\nAktivierte Fähigkeiten von Ländern, die du kontrollierst, kosten beim Aktivieren {1} weniger.\\nLandkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Schildkröte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629925&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2df71299-6cc9-443e-88c7-795e795efde0', 'multiverseId': 629925}, 'multiverseid': 629925}, {'name': 'Tortuga floreciente', 'text': 'Siempre que la Tortuga floreciente entre al campo de batalla o ataque, muele tres cartas. Luego, regresa una carta de tierra de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuesta {1} menos activar las habilidades activadas de las tierras que controlas.\\nLas criaturas tierra que controlas obtienen +1/+1.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tortuga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630186&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02b2f711-b868-4112-a19f-d61051559f3e', 'multiverseId': 630186}, 'multiverseid': 630186}, {'name': 'Tortue florissante', 'text': 'À chaque fois que la Tortue florissante arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, meulez trois cartes, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain depuis votre cimetière.\\nLes capacités activées des terrains que vous contrôlez coûtent {1} de moins à activer.\\nLes créatures-terrains que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.', 'type': 'Créature — tortue terrestre', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630447&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4948ba5-2d49-459c-9d70-f902969740a3', 'multiverseId': 630447}, 'multiverseid': 630447}, {'name': 'Testuggine Fiorita', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta la Testuggine Fiorita entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, macina tre carte, poi rimetti sul campo di battaglia TAPpata una carta terra dal tuo cimitero.\\nLe abilità attivate delle terre che controlli costano {1} in meno per essere attivate.\\nLe creature terra che controlli prendono +1/+1.', 'type': 'Creatura — Tartaruga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630708&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56142704-3a74-4e59-b82a-07bad1ed1457', 'multiverseId': 630708}, 'multiverseid': 630708}, {'name': '開花の亀', 'text': '開花の亀が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、カード３枚を切削し、その後、あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\\nあなたがコントロールしている土地の起動型能力を起動するためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての土地・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 海亀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630969&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f58c8ba5-202f-4141-ad09-9be1a483e049', 'multiverseId': 630969}, 'multiverseid': 630969}, {'name': 'Jabuti Florescente', 'text': 'Toda vez que Jabuti Florescente entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, triture três cards e depois devolva um card de terreno de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado.\\nAs habilidades ativadas de terrenos que você controla custam {1} a menos para serem ativadas.\\nAs criaturas terreno que você controla recebem +1/+1.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tartaruga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631230&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e03561f-914b-4269-b60d-dbf077763715', 'multiverseId': 631230}, 'multiverseid': 631230}, {'name': '繁花龟', 'text': '每当繁花龟进战场或攻击时，磨三张牌，然后将一张地牌从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。\\n由你操控的地之起动式异能减少{1}来起动。\\n由你操控的地生物得+1/+1。', 'type': '生物 — 龟', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631491&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb1e55d5-3e5e-48cc-8878-dba2da1492e7', 'multiverseId': 631491}, 'multiverseid': 631491}]", "[{'name': 'Aufblühende Schildkröte', 'text': 'Immer wenn die Aufblühende Schildkröte ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, millst du drei Karten und bringst dann eine Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\\nAktivierte Fähigkeiten von Ländern, die du kontrollierst, kosten beim Aktivieren {1} weniger.\\nLandkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Schildkröte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631887&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7053f2bd-89b6-48cd-96da-bf07ee038dae', 'multiverseId': 631887}, 'multiverseid': 631887}, {'name': 'Tortue florissante', 'text': 'À chaque fois que la Tortue florissante arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, meulez trois cartes, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain depuis votre cimetière.\\nLes capacités activées des terrains que vous contrôlez coûtent {1} de moins à activer.\\nLes créatures-terrains que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.', 'type': 'Créature — tortue terrestre', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631934&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a28bbc7-7faf-435c-81a1-2b058e81a13b', 'multiverseId': 631934}, 'multiverseid': 631934}, {'name': '開花の亀', 'text': '開花の亀が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、カード３枚を切削し、その後、あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\\nあなたがコントロールしている土地の起動型能力を起動するためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての土地・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 海亀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631981&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6318172-2c7d-4144-8c54-f4e6707c7772', 'multiverseId': 631981}, 'multiverseid': 631981}, {'name': '繁花龟', 'text': '每当繁花龟进战场或攻击时，磨三张牌，然后将一张地牌从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。\\n由你操控的地之起动式异能减少{1}来起动。\\n由你操控的地生物得+1/+1。', 'type': '生物 — 龟', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632028&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '596e3a5e-ac0d-49f3-81bc-4c07d912013e', 'multiverseId': 632028}, 'multiverseid': 632028}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ausguck der Knäuelschlucht\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Aura unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Trolle haben deine Fährte aufgenommen, Reisender. Spute dich, ich kümmere mich um sie."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'073946c0-4cd0-47ee-96fa-8a8c1717febe\', \'multiverseId\': 629950}, \'multiverseid\': 629950}, {\'name\': \'Vigía de la Sima Enredada\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Aura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los troles te olieron, viajero. Vete, deprisa, y deja que yo me encargue de ellos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f58003e4-cf71-43ab-822d-d0bc24c31cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 630211}, \'multiverseid\': 630211}, {\'name\': \'Vigie du Front de lianes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une aura arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — satyre\', \'flavor\': "« Les trolls ont repéré ton odeur, voyageur. Presse-toi, et laisse-moi m\'occuper d\'eux. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630472&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0426c5bf-1a83-42a7-8ce8-8e49d80bf3f2\', \'multiverseId\': 630472}, \'multiverseid\': 630472}, {\'name\': "Vedetta dell\'Insenaltura", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'Aura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'"I troll seguono la tua scia, viaggiatore. Affrettati e lascia che me ne occupi io."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0c80ff-6e33-463a-96e6-ed8ace38fc4e\', \'multiverseId\': 630733}, \'multiverseid\': 630733}, {\'name\': \'絡み架かりの見張り\', \'text\': \'オーラ１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス\', \'flavor\': \'「旅人さん、トロールはあんたの匂いを嗅ぎつけてくる。ここは私に任せて、先を急ぎな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f09b5b48-6edf-4c27-9c58-e632052ef5b3\', \'multiverseId\': 630994}, \'multiverseid\': 630994}, {\'name\': \'Vigia da Fenda dos Liames\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma Aura entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Os trols pegaram o seu cheiro, viajante. Aperte o passo e deixe que eu cuido deles."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929fb735-22b5-48e2-89f6-62c38983ede6\', \'multiverseId\': 631255}, \'multiverseid\': 631255}, {\'name\': \'蜿结谷警戒员\', \'text\': \'每当一个灵气在你的操控下进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': \'「旅行者，巨魔已经闻到了你的味道。快快赶路，他们就交给我来对付。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88accfdd-3b28-4782-8071-8b8681d1f534\', \'multiverseId\': 631516}, \'multiverseid\': 631516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausguck der Knäuelschlucht\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Aura unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632198&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbd75b3d-95a0-457b-8a52-36f7bc2a9ee5\', \'multiverseId\': 632198}, \'multiverseid\': 632198}, {\'name\': \'Vigía de la Sima Enredada\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Aura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df7326e9-8021-4eaa-aadb-0d5fa2167bb6\', \'multiverseId\': 632203}, \'multiverseid\': 632203}, {\'name\': \'Vigie du Front de lianes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une aura arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — satyre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efe28a43-6b6a-4d8a-8f7e-4ec81fa27ee5\', \'multiverseId\': 632208}, \'multiverseid\': 632208}, {\'name\': "Vedetta dell\'Insenaltura", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'Aura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Satiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'845e96af-2915-4123-b679-0abb4ff75c58\', \'multiverseId\': 632213}, \'multiverseid\': 632213}, {\'name\': \'絡み架かりの見張り\', \'text\': \'オーラ１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10470ea6-e199-46b5-b954-0cb8ec535993\', \'multiverseId\': 632218}, \'multiverseid\': 632218}, {\'name\': \'Vigia da Fenda dos Liames\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma Aura entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'357be7fd-fcd8-4e39-90e2-f377d27034b2\', \'multiverseId\': 632223}, \'multiverseid\': 632223}, {\'name\': \'蜿结谷警戒员\', \'text\': \'每当一个灵气在你的操控下进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d63d23b0-41ec-4d67-9c4d-a46135054efc\', \'multiverseId\': 632228}, \'multiverseid\': 632228}]', '[{\'name\': \'Außergewöhnliche Reise\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Außergewöhnliche Reise ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu X Kreaturen deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Besitzer kann jede jener Karten spielen, solange sie im Exil bleibt.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Nichtspielsteinkreaturen ins Spiel kommen und falls eine oder mehrere davon aus dem Exil ins Spiel gekommen oder aus dem Exil gewirkt wurden, ziehst du eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629810&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2393b93-a3c5-4139-b962-71c462fe6ccb\', \'multiverseId\': 629810}, \'multiverseid\': 629810}, {\'name\': \'Viaje extraordinario\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Viaje extraordinario entre al campo de batalla, exilia hasta X criaturas objetivo. Por cada una de esas cartas, su propietario puede jugarla mientras permanezca exiliada.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que no sean fichas entren al campo de batalla, si una o más de ellas entró desde el exilio o fue lanzada desde el exilio, roba una carta. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8e9a519-c56d-4b3f-ab1d-ae0f151b95f3\', \'multiverseId\': 630071}, \'multiverseid\': 630071}, {\'name\': \'Voyage extraordinaire\', \'text\': "Quand le Voyage extraordinaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à X créatures ciblées. Pour chacune de ces cartes, son propriétaire peut la jouer tant qu\'elle reste exilée.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille, si au moins l\'une d\'elles est arrivée depuis l\'exil ou a été lancée depuis l\'exil, vous piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630332&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c095a56-3677-4ae5-b60c-022b8eab44ce\', \'multiverseId\': 630332}, \'multiverseid\': 630332}, {\'name\': \'Viaggio Straordinario\', \'text\': "Quando il Viaggio Straordinario entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia fino a X creature bersaglio. Per ognuna di quelle carte, il suo proprietario può giocarla fintanto che rimane esiliata.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature non pedina entrano nel campo di battaglia, se una o più di esse sono entrate dall\'esilio o sono state lanciate dall\'esilio, peschi una carta. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7330d63f-5afb-48e9-a776-09573d53fa17\', \'multiverseId\': 630593}, \'multiverseid\': 630593}, {\'name\': \'超常の旅\', \'text\': \'超常の旅が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー最大Ｘ体を対象とする。それらを追放する。それらの各カードにつきそれぞれ、そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、それのオーナーはそれをプレイしてもよい。\\nトークンでない１体以上のクリーチャーが戦場に出るたび、それらのうち１体以上が追放領域から戦場に出たか追放領域から唱えられていた場合、あなたはカード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0acaf6ae-1fc6-4a64-bdc1-afde9dab16d2\', \'multiverseId\': 630854}, \'multiverseid\': 630854}, {\'name\': \'Jornada Extraordinária\', \'text\': \'Quando Jornada Extraordinária entrar no campo de batalha, exile até X criaturas alvo. Para cada um daqueles cards, seu dono poderá jogá-lo enquanto ele permanecer exilado.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas não ficha entrarem no campo de batalha, se uma ou mais delas tiverem entrado vindas do exílio ou tiverem sido conjuradas do exílio, você compra um card. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3bb1537-9c52-49bd-bb82-52e1888f7077\', \'multiverseId\': 631115}, \'multiverseid\': 631115}, {\'name\': \'非凡旅途\', \'text\': \'当非凡旅途进战场时，放逐至多X个目标生物。对每张此类牌而言，于它持续放逐的时段内，其拥有者可以使用之。\\n每当一个或数个非衍生物的生物进战场时，若其中有由放逐区进入或从放逐区施放者，则你抓一张牌。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6335035-20b1-465f-b2b2-e2185ff4a2b1\', \'multiverseId\': 631376}, \'multiverseid\': 631376}]', '[{\'name\': \'Außergewöhnliche Reise\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Außergewöhnliche Reise ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu X Kreaturen deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Besitzer kann jede jener Karten spielen, solange sie im Exil bleibt.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Nichtspielsteinkreaturen ins Spiel kommen und falls eine oder mehrere davon aus dem Exil ins Spiel gekommen oder aus dem Exil gewirkt wurden, ziehst du eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631864&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c85692c-5bc8-4415-ba96-c805de04a49d\', \'multiverseId\': 631864}, \'multiverseid\': 631864}, {\'name\': \'Voyage extraordinaire\', \'text\': "Quand le Voyage extraordinaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à X créatures ciblées. Pour chacune de ces cartes, son propriétaire peut la jouer tant qu\'elle reste exilée.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille, si au moins l\'une d\'elles est arrivée depuis l\'exil ou a été lancée depuis l\'exil, vous piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506da70b-63ff-4b7a-b7ea-608692be44e5\', \'multiverseId\': 631911}, \'multiverseid\': 631911}, {\'name\': \'超常の旅\', \'text\': \'超常の旅が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー最大Ｘ体を対象とする。それらを追放する。それらの各カードにつきそれぞれ、そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、それのオーナーはそれをプレイしてもよい。\\nトークンでない１体以上のクリーチャーが戦場に出るたび、それらのうち１体以上が追放領域から戦場に出たか追放領域から唱えられていた場合、あなたはカード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'893fdd0b-6560-42e9-b686-1917dbc4c123\', \'multiverseId\': 631958}, \'multiverseid\': 631958}, {\'name\': \'非凡旅途\', \'text\': \'当非凡旅途进战场时，放逐至多X个目标生物。对每张此类牌而言，于它持续放逐的时段内，其拥有者可以使用之。\\n每当一个或数个非衍生物的生物进战场时，若其中有由放逐区进入或从放逐区施放者，则你抓一张牌。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ace55d2-080e-4131-866e-c45c73a93b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 632005}, \'multiverseid\': 632005}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baron Wusel, König der Kanalisation\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Ratte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu eine Karte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners ins Exil.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ratte, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629859&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'def27505-80ff-4cd8-a5b9-81a3187cd4c1\', \'multiverseId\': 629859}, \'multiverseid\': 629859}, {\'name\': \'Señor Escurridizo, rey de las cloacas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra Rata entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, exilia hasta una carta objetivo del cementerio de un oponente.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear".\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble rata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee62b63d-94af-4101-adf2-5a4d15f8d26f\', \'multiverseId\': 630120}, \'multiverseid\': 630120}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur Grouilleur, roi des égouts\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre rat arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, exilez jusqu\'à une carte ciblée du cimetière d\'un adversaire.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. »", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — rat et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630381&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b61cf039-5607-435b-89cd-47a7d9dc7654\', \'multiverseId\': 630381}, \'multiverseid\': 630381}, {\'name\': \'Lord Squittio, Re delle Fogne\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro Ratto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, esilia fino a una carta bersaglio dal cimitero di un avversario.\\nAll\\\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera con "Questa creatura non può bloccare".\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Ratto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbb225ab-9958-480c-828a-03c1e784be09\', \'multiverseId\': 630642}, \'multiverseid\': 630642}, {\'name\': \'下水王、駆け抜け侯\', \'text\': \'これでないネズミ１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、対戦相手の墓地にあるカード最大１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ネズミ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9615930f-f3f5-477c-952c-260019050494\', \'multiverseId\': 630903}, \'multiverseid\': 630903}, {\'name\': \'Lorde Esgueiro, Rei do Esgoto\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outro Rato entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, exile até um card alvo do cemitério de um oponente.\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Rato preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear".\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Rato Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47025a34-1b73-4edb-9ea0-aeb428f3e0b4\', \'multiverseId\': 631164}, \'multiverseid\': 631164}, {\'name\': \'水渠鼠霸捷敏王\', \'text\': \'每当另一个老鼠在你的操控下进战场时，将至多一张目标牌从对手坟墓场放逐。\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 老鼠／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47f53348-7a7c-4a7f-93b9-ab724a01a612\', \'multiverseId\': 631425}, \'multiverseid\': 631425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baron Wusel, König der Kanalisation\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Ratte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu eine Karte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners ins Exil.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ratte, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631872&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c05e610d-2a25-47e9-b271-6e491a843148\', \'multiverseId\': 631872}, \'multiverseid\': 631872}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur Grouilleur, roi des égouts\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre rat arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, exilez jusqu\'à une carte ciblée du cimetière d\'un adversaire.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. »", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — rat et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad65718-4a00-46c9-8480-68b2b17af313\', \'multiverseId\': 631919}, \'multiverseid\': 631919}, {\'name\': \'下水王、駆け抜け侯\', \'text\': \'これでないネズミ１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、対戦相手の墓地にあるカード最大１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ネズミ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5b7a9c5-ccf6-4817-a6f8-efab71dfdbd8\', \'multiverseId\': 631966}, \'multiverseid\': 631966}, {\'name\': \'水渠鼠霸捷敏王\', \'text\': \'每当另一个老鼠在你的操控下进战场时，将至多一张目标牌从对手坟墓场放逐。\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 老鼠／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc686577-c1e2-48c7-8412-c6029cfdd239\', \'multiverseId\': 632013}, \'multiverseid\': 632013}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baron Wusels Fleischer\', \'text\': \'Wenn Baron Wusels Fleischer ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\\n• Du kannst eine andere Kreatur opfern. Falls du dies tust, wende Hellsicht 2 an und ziehe dann eine Karte.\\n• Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629861&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02b7f3f9-ba64-415f-9b5f-52adbd249510\', \'multiverseId\': 629861}, \'multiverseid\': 629861}, {\'name\': \'Carnicero del señor Escurridizo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Carnicero del señor Escurridizo entre al campo de batalla, elige uno:\\n• Crea una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear".\\n• Puedes sacrificar otra criatura. Si lo haces, adivina 2 y luego roba una carta.\\n• Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Plebeyo rata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c894e5f-aa67-4ea0-8b8e-2742937b4262\', \'multiverseId\': 630122}, \'multiverseid\': 630122}, {\'name\': \'Boucher de Seigneur Grouilleur\', \'text\': "Quand le Boucher de Seigneur Grouilleur arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. »\\n• Vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature. Si vous faites ainsi, regard 2, puis piochez une carte.\\n• Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — rat et paysan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630383&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72a0d144-7167-4ffc-af55-e25064c92f43\', \'multiverseId\': 630383}, \'multiverseid\': 630383}, {\'name\': \'Macellaio di Lord Squittio\', \'text\': \'Quando il Macellaio di Lord Squittio entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno —\\n• Crea una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera con "Questa creatura non può bloccare".\\n• Puoi sacrificare un\\\'altra creatura. Se lo fai, profetizza 2, poi pesca una carta.\\n• Le creature che controlli hanno minacciare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Popolano Ratto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b550b67b-2333-45ec-8708-11832f5e06d6\', \'multiverseId\': 630644}, \'multiverseid\': 630644}, {\'name\': \'駆け抜け侯の解体屋\', \'text\': \'駆け抜け侯の解体屋が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n・これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、占術２を行い、その後、カード１枚を引く。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは威迫を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ・農民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5aceca-2197-45fe-b208-aa096c65be48\', \'multiverseId\': 630905}, \'multiverseid\': 630905}, {\'name\': \'Açougueiro do Lorde Esgueiro\', \'text\': \'Quando Açougueiro do Lorde Esgueiro entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um —\\n• Crie uma ficha de criatura Rato preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear".\\n• Você pode sacrificar outra criatura. Se fizer isso, use vidência 2 e depois compre um card.\\n• As criaturas que você controla ganham ameaçar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rato Plebeu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9316479e-ff90-49fd-8e0b-d48a9d591f92\', \'multiverseId\': 631166}, \'multiverseid\': 631166}, {\'name\': \'捷敏王的屠夫\', \'text\': \'当捷敏王的屠夫进战场时，选择一项～\\n•派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\\n•你可以牺牲另一个生物。若你如此作，则占卜2，然后抓一张牌。\\n•由你操控的生物获得威慑异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 老鼠／平民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8320f99-a79b-4ca2-b2f2-9b5ee6098907\', \'multiverseId\': 631427}, \'multiverseid\': 631427}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baron Wusels Segen\', \'text\': \'Wenn Baron Wusels Segen ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Böse-Rolle-Spielstein, angelegt an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. (Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1. Wenn diese Aura auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.)\\nZu Beginn deines Ziehsegments und falls du eine verzauberte Kreatur kontrollierst, verlierst du 1 Lebenspunkt und ziehst eine zusätzliche Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629860&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b5cd22f-6b43-4dfe-b2d8-73138dd9ab93\', \'multiverseId\': 629860}, \'multiverseid\': 629860}, {\'name\': \'Bendición del señor Escurridizo\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Bendición del señor Escurridizo entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Papel de Malvado anexada a la criatura objetivo que controlas. (La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1. Cuando esta Aura vaya a un cementerio, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.)\\nAl comienzo de tu paso de robar, si controlas una criatura encantada, pierdes 1 vida y robas una carta adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e543f995-2062-47ea-961f-6ace5d92e842\', \'multiverseId\': 630121}, \'multiverseid\': 630121}, {\'name\': \'Bénédiction de Seigneur Grouilleur\', \'text\': \'Quand la Bénédiction de Seigneur Grouilleur arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de rôle Maléfique attaché à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. (La créature enchantée gagne +1/+1. Quand cette aura est mise dans un cimetière, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.)\\nAu début de votre étape de pioche, si vous contrôlez une créature enchantée, vous perdez 1 point de vie et vous piochez une carte supplémentaire.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630382&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8984d3a-9037-4464-9f86-bc4e4914383f\', \'multiverseId\': 630382}, \'multiverseid\': 630382}, {\'name\': \'Benedizione di Lord Squittio\', \'text\': "Quando la Benedizione di Lord Squittio entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Ruolo Perfido assegnata a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. (La creatura incantata prende +1/+1. Quando quest\'Aura viene messa in un cimitero, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.)\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase di acquisizione, se controlli una creatura incantata, perdi 1 punto vita e peschi una carta addizionale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b6d5de9-85cb-4777-aefb-086bc76ea7b0\', \'multiverseId\': 630643}, \'multiverseid\': 630643}, {\'name\': \'駆け抜け侯の祝福\', \'text\': \'駆け抜け侯の祝福が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ひねくれ者・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。（エンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。このオーラが墓地に置かれたとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。）\\nあなたのドロー・ステップの開始時に、あなたがオーラがついているクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、あなたは１点のライフを失い、追加でカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ed9359-5e4f-4fb5-b520-d438f8901356\', \'multiverseId\': 630904}, \'multiverseid\': 630904}, {\'name\': \'Bênção do Lorde Esgueiro\', \'text\': \'Quando Bênção do Lorde Esgueiro entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Papel de Malvado anexada à criatura alvo que você controla. (A criatura encantada recebe +1/+1. Quando esta Aura é colocada em um cemitério, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.)\\nNo início de sua etapa de compra, se você controla uma criatura encantada, você perde 1 ponto de vida e compra um card adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0798cc53-b9ae-4d14-8a62-00e5e379fed4\', \'multiverseId\': 631165}, \'multiverseid\': 631165}, {\'name\': \'捷敏王祝福\', \'text\': \'当捷敏王祝福进战场时，派出一个恶人角色衍生物，并贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。（所结附的生物得+1/+1。当此灵气进入坟墓场时，每位对手各失去1点生命。）\\n在你的抓牌步骤开始时，若你操控受有灵气的生物，则你失去1点生命且额外抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'987919ff-09ec-4593-b7b9-2ce68b8f4975\', \'multiverseId\': 631426}, \'multiverseid\': 631426}]', "[{'name': 'Baron Wusels Segen', 'text': 'Wenn Baron Wusels Segen ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Böse-Rolle-Spielstein, angelegt an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\nZu Beginn deines Ziehsegments und falls du eine verzauberte Kreatur kontrollierst, verlierst du 1 Lebenspunkt und ziehst eine zusätzliche Karte.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631873&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73bbdb1a-7f2f-4204-b849-c29df0d2e4bf', 'multiverseId': 631873}, 'multiverseid': 631873}, {'name': 'Bénédiction de Seigneur Grouilleur', 'text': 'Quand la Bénédiction de Seigneur Grouilleur arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de rôle Maléfique attaché à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nAu début de votre étape de pioche, si vous contrôlez une créature enchantée, vous perdez 1 point de vie et vous piochez une carte supplémentaire.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631920&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b423845f-77ba-4628-9640-2524476417df', 'multiverseId': 631920}, 'multiverseid': 631920}, {'name': '駆け抜け侯の祝福', 'text': '駆け抜け侯の祝福が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ひねくれ者・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。\\nあなたのドロー・ステップの開始時に、あなたがオーラがついているクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、あなたは１点のライフを失い、追加でカード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631967&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee41e1e4-b2eb-4800-b591-a8344f690554', 'multiverseId': 631967}, 'multiverseid': 631967}, {'name': '捷敏王祝福', 'text': '当捷敏王祝福进战场时，派出一个恶人角色衍生物，并贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。\\n在你的抓牌步骤开始时，若你操控受有灵气的生物，则你失去1点生命且额外抓一张牌。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632014&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65a8a308-3c75-4d0f-9c47-8c8ae0ceecaa', 'multiverseId': 632014}, 'multiverseid': 632014}]", '[{\'name\': \'Beanstalk Wurm // Bohnen pflanzen\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn Belunas Haustiere aus Sturmquell ausbüxen, werden Dörfer eingeebnet und neue Immerranken sprießen.\', \'faceName\': \'Beanstalk Wurm\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7fdbcc0-1257-43c0-a720-5c2134c4fe31\', \'multiverseId\': 629923}, \'multiverseid\': 629923}, {\'name\': \'Beanstalk Wurm // Plantar habichuelas\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe planta\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando las mascotas de Beluna escapan de Fuentetormentas, los pueblos sucumben y surgen nuevos talloinfinitos.\', \'faceName\': \'Beanstalk Wurm\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc9a1af6-6c59-4eb1-9f74-69a422b38f61\', \'multiverseId\': 630184}, \'multiverseid\': 630184}, {\'name\': \'Beanstalk Wurm // Planter des haricots\', \'text\': \'Portée\', \'type\': \'Créature — plante et guivre\', \'flavor\': "Lorsque les animaux de compagnie de Beluna s\'échappent de Foudrekeld, des villages succombent et de nouvelles tiges éternelles s\'élèvent.", \'faceName\': \'Beanstalk Wurm\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630445&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d625ccb-c955-448f-b2e4-1942c96f7057\', \'multiverseId\': 630445}, \'multiverseid\': 630445}, {\'name\': \'Beanstalk Wurm // Piantare i Fagioli\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm Pianta\', \'flavor\': \'Quando gli animali da compagnia di Beluna fuggono da Nimborgo, cadono villaggi e si innalzano nuovi Steli Eterni.\', \'faceName\': \'Beanstalk Wurm\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79ce0bda-862c-4860-b427-263b86906b4f\', \'multiverseId\': 630706}, \'multiverseid\': 630706}, {\'name\': \'Beanstalk Wurm // 豆（まめ）撒（ま）き\', \'text\': \'到達\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・ワーム\', \'flavor\': \'ベルーナのペットがストームケルドを脱走するたびに村が滅び、新たな永久の木が育つのだ。\', \'faceName\': \'Beanstalk Wurm\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad0660d-6089-4e7d-a62a-4e34f2fc8f33\', \'multiverseId\': 630967}, \'multiverseid\': 630967}, {\'name\': \'Beanstalk Wurm // Plantar Feijões\', \'text\': \'Alcance\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Planta Vorme\', \'flavor\': \'Quando os bichinhos de Beluna fogem de Tempesburgo, vilarejos caem e novos pés-de-toda-vida crescem.\', \'faceName\': \'Beanstalk Wurm\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e219790-04e1-454c-8db5-32913cb3c045\', \'multiverseId\': 631228}, \'multiverseid\': 631228}, {\'name\': \'Beanstalk Wurm // 种下魔豆\', \'text\': \'延势\', \'type\': \'生物 — 植物／亚龙\', \'flavor\': \'贝伦娜的宠物逃离暴风域后，只见村庄尽毁、新生极茎拔地而起。\', \'faceName\': \'Beanstalk Wurm\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cc5c24c-1e54-4b07-af03-7c5d155cc6ff\', \'multiverseId\': 631489}, \'multiverseid\': 631489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bedrängte Speerwache\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nWenn die Bedrängte Speerwache stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Warum seid ihr Ungeziefer nur so dumm? Das hier ist ein Lager voller Ziegel. ZIEGEL! Ziegel kann man nicht essen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcfae815-2f8c-4079-8584-ee1227848359\', \'multiverseId\': 629897}, \'multiverseid\': 629897}, {\'name\': \'Guardialanza preocupada\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCuando la Guardialanza preocupada muera, crea una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Alimañas, ¿por qué son tan estúpidas? Este almacén está lleno de ladrillos. ¡LADRILLOS! No pueden comer ladrillos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7661862-0f21-4f8b-b7fb-9838f761a529\', \'multiverseId\': 630158}, \'multiverseid\': 630158}, {\'name\': \'Garde lancière harcelée\', \'text\': \'Célérité\\nQuand la Garde lancière harcelée meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. »\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Pourquoi la vermine est-elle toujours si stupide ? C\'est un entrepôt de briques. DE BRIQUES ! Ça ne se mange pas. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630419&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'906df8b6-9967-404c-a213-0f78eb35fbec\', \'multiverseId\': 630419}, \'multiverseid\': 630419}, {\'name\': \'Guardialancia Intimorita\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nQuando la Guardialancia Intimorita muore, crea una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera con "Questa creatura non può bloccare".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché siete così insistenti, maledetti parassiti? Questo magazzino è pieno di mattoni. MATTONI! Non potete mangiare i mattoni."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7772a86c-e1ce-40c8-9b32-b9d401b72528\', \'multiverseId\': 630680}, \'multiverseid\': 630680}, {\'name\': \'攻め立てられる槍護衛\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n攻め立てられる槍護衛が死亡したとき、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「まぬけな害獣どもめ。ここは煉瓦を保管している倉庫だよ。煉瓦だよ？煉瓦なんて食べられないでしょうが。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c742b2f2-7aea-42f3-b29b-16f5aba75c57\', \'multiverseId\': 630941}, \'multiverseid\': 630941}, {\'name\': \'Guarda Lanceira Assediada\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nQuando Guarda Lanceira Assediada morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Rato preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Por que vocês são tão idiotas, suas pragas? Esse armazém tá cheio de tijolo. TIJOLO! Vocês não comem tijolo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21151083-b34d-40f0-9486-54c0f356161e\', \'multiverseId\': 631202}, \'multiverseid\': 631202}, {\'name\': \'烦乱矛卫\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n当烦乱矛卫死去时，派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「你们这些脏东西是多蠢？仓库里全是砖头。全是砖头！你们又没法吃砖头。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3bc010-9297-40d1-8714-7556970edaf6\', \'multiverseId\': 631463}, \'multiverseid\': 631463}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begegnung mit der Wildnis\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte ins Exil schicken. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Du kannst die ins Exil geschickte Karte in diesem Zug wirken. Zu Beginn der nächsten Kampfphase in diesem Zug fügt eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, bis zu einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92c0bb32-c73d-4b1b-9372-679ce87bb514\', \'multiverseId\': 629931}, \'multiverseid\': 629931}, {\'name\': \'Encuentro salvaje\', \'text\': \'Mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes exiliar una carta de criatura de entre ellas. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Puedes lanzar la carta exiliada este turno. Al comienzo de la próxima fase de combate este turno, la criatura objetivo que controlas hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a una criatura objetivo que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abf214ba-a47c-4d33-9c6a-7f2d8e57330d\', \'multiverseId\': 630192}, \'multiverseid\': 630192}, {\'name\': \'Rencontre sauvage\', \'text\': "Regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez exiler une carte de créature parmi elles. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Vous pouvez lancer la carte exilée ce tour-ci. Au début de la prochaine phase de combat ce tour-ci, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb247dfc-15ee-4d3e-a049-6c6263c59a71\', \'multiverseId\': 630453}, \'multiverseid\': 630453}, {\'name\': \'Incontro Feroce\', \'text\': "Guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi esiliare una carta creatura scelta tra esse. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale. Puoi lanciare la carta esiliata in questo turno. All\'inizio della prossima fase di combattimento in questo turno, una creatura bersaglio che controlli infligge danno pari alla sua forza a fino a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e400445-25cb-462a-a6a1-8da23716ee8a\', \'multiverseId\': 630714}, \'multiverseid\': 630714}, {\'name\': \'野生との遭遇\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を見る。その中からクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放してもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。このターン、その追放されているカードを唱えてもよい。このターン、次の戦闘フェイズの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8adfe6ac-9e18-4c02-b28e-00901179e980\', \'multiverseId\': 630975}, \'multiverseid\': 630975}, {\'name\': \'Encontro Feral\', \'text\': \'Olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode exilar um card de criatura dentre eles. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória. Você pode conjurar o card exilado neste turno. No início de sua próxima fase de combate neste turno, a criatura alvo que você controla causa dano igual ao próprio poder à criatura alvo que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ac4d220-6158-4d90-8f77-978d1bbecd0e\', \'multiverseId\': 631236}, \'multiverseid\': 631236}, {\'name\': \'野境遇袭\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以放逐其中一张生物牌。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。本回合中，你可以施放所放逐的牌。在本回合下一个战斗阶段开始时，目标由你操控的生物对至多一个目标不由你操控的生物造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e16119-70b8-4b18-b507-536d2469ddd3\', \'multiverseId\': 631497}, \'multiverseid\': 631497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begegnung mit der Wildnis\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte ins Exil schicken. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Du kannst die ins Exil geschickte Karte in diesem Zug wirken. Zu Beginn der nächsten Kampfphase in diesem Zug fügt eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, bis zu einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631889&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84dcc7d5-e17e-428f-bd44-10313b3144cd\', \'multiverseId\': 631889}, \'multiverseid\': 631889}, {\'name\': \'Rencontre sauvage\', \'text\': "Regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez exiler une carte de créature parmi elles. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Vous pouvez lancer la carte exilée ce tour-ci. Au début de la prochaine phase de combat ce tour-ci, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631936&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'398e59b7-b58a-4139-b086-7c32ed28eacb\', \'multiverseId\': 631936}, \'multiverseid\': 631936}, {\'name\': \'野生との遭遇\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を見る。その中からクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放してもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。このターン、その追放されているカードを唱えてもよい。このターン、次の戦闘フェイズの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ef9f0af-6b60-453b-89e2-16dd0cfc9236\', \'multiverseId\': 631983}, \'multiverseid\': 631983}, {\'name\': \'野境遇袭\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以放逐其中一张生物牌。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。本回合中，你可以施放所放逐的牌。在本回合下一个战斗阶段开始时，目标由你操控的生物对至多一个目标不由你操控的生物造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a0518f5-2f78-4b41-a5e3-9f089d6c338e\', \'multiverseId\': 632030}, \'multiverseid\': 632030}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beharrlicher Foliantenjäger\', \'text\': \'Feilschen (Du kannst ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder einen Spielstein opfern, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nWenn der Beharrliche Foliantenjäger ins Spiel kommt und falls um ihn gefeilscht wurde, bringe eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein unversehrter Band von Geschichten aus dem Feenland? Der König wird entzückt sein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629836&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'660d7193-b5b9-40f5-b891-b5cdd78fb12a\', \'multiverseId\': 629836}, \'multiverseid\': 629836}, {\'name\': \'Buscatomos tenaz\', \'text\': \'Negociar. (Puedes sacrificar un artefacto, encantamiento o ficha al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nCuando el Buscatomos tenaz entre al campo de batalla, si fue negociado, regresa la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Un volumen intacto de los Cuentos de hadas? El rey estará encantado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6da1f78-ed7b-4875-9c2b-3d473fe448c7\', \'multiverseId\': 630097}, \'multiverseid\': 630097}, {\'name\': \'Chercheur de grimoires tenace\', \'text\': "Négociation (Vous pouvez sacrifier un artefact, un enchantement ou un jeton au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nQuand le Chercheur de grimoires tenace arrive sur le champ de bataille, s\'il a été négocié, renvoyez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': \'« Un volume intact des Contes des Fæs ? Le roi sera ravi. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630358&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6b5445d-18f5-4927-bfa9-9634f47f2b50\', \'multiverseId\': 630358}, \'multiverseid\': 630358}, {\'name\': \'Cercatomi Tenace\', \'text\': \'Negoziare (Puoi sacrificare un artefatto, un incantesimo o una pedina mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nQuando il Cercatomi Tenace entra nel campo di battaglia, se è stato negoziato, riprendi in mano una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Un volume intonso di Racconti delle Fate? Il re sarà soddisfatto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'114470a3-23e8-4ae7-bb45-7124e78b1cd3\', \'multiverseId\': 630619}, \'multiverseid\': 630619}, {\'name\': \'執拗な秘本探し\', \'text\': \'協約（この呪文を唱えるに際し、アーティファクトやエンチャントやトークンのうち１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。）\\n執拗な秘本探しが戦場に出たとき、これが協約されていた場合、あなたの墓地にあるインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「フェイの物語の美品だと？王はさぞかし喜ばれることだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b06263-6e06-48f0-b9f2-8718fe20fc47\', \'multiverseId\': 630880}, \'multiverseid\': 630880}, {\'name\': \'Busca-tomos Tenaz\', \'text\': \'Negociar (Você pode sacrificar um artefato, um encantamento ou uma ficha conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nQuando Busca-tomos Tenaz entrar no campo de batalha, se ele tiver sido negociado, devolva o card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Um volume intacto de Contos das Fadinas? O rei ficará feliz."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc23b475-2312-4f04-88b6-7d3d19a7f44c\', \'multiverseId\': 631141}, \'multiverseid\': 631141}, {\'name\': \'顽强寻册客\', \'text\': \'加码（你施放此咒语时可以牺牲一个神器，结界或衍生物。）\\n当顽强寻册客进战场时，若它已加码，则将目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「全新的完本《仙儿传说》？皇上一定会喜出望外。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83104524-e517-412e-b23c-bdc3ad5c8ae2\', \'multiverseId\': 631402}, \'multiverseid\': 631402}]', '[{\'name\': \'Behütende Eltern\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Behütenden Eltern sterben, erzeuge einen Junger-Held-Rolle-Spielstein, angelegt an bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. (Falls du bereits eine andere daran angelegte Rolle kontrollierst, lege die alte Rolle auf den Friedhof. Die verzauberte Kreatur hat „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift und falls ihre Widerstandskraft 3 oder weniger ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629786&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91392d5b-6ff6-4637-a123-2e82c5eeda15\', \'multiverseId\': 629786}, \'multiverseid\': 629786}, {\'name\': \'Padres protectores\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Padres protectores mueran, crea una ficha de Papel de Héroe joven anexada a hasta una criatura objetivo que controlas. (Si controlas otro Papel sobre ella, pon ese en el cementerio. La criatura encantada tiene "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, si su resistencia es de 3 o menos, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Plebeyo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0080b5d-8049-4dc8-983e-2e43c107d23b\', \'multiverseId\': 630047}, \'multiverseid\': 630047}, {\'name\': \'Parents protecteurs\', \'text\': "Quand les Parents protecteurs meurent, créez un jeton de rôle Jeune héros attaché à jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. (Si vous contrôlez un autre rôle sur elle, mettez-le au cimetière. La créature enchantée a « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, si son endurance est inférieure ou égale à 3, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle ».)", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et paysan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630308&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecdc0e53-6805-4e36-9191-3e5ad99bd326\', \'multiverseId\': 630308}, \'multiverseid\': 630308}, {\'name\': \'Genitori Protettivi\', \'text\': \'Quando i Genitori Protettivi muoiono, crea una pedina Ruolo Giovane Eroe assegnata a fino a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. (Se controlli un altro Ruolo assegnato a quella creatura, metti quel Ruolo nel cimitero. La creatura incantata ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, se la sua costituzione è pari o inferiore a 3, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Popolano Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06087fff-1ad9-48f4-8eea-b65cc57cb473\', \'multiverseId\': 630569}, \'multiverseid\': 630569}, {\'name\': \'庇う両親\', \'text\': \'庇う両親が死亡したとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。若き英雄・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。（あなたがコントロールしている役割がすでにそれについていたなら、その役割を墓地に置く。エンチャントしているクリーチャーは、「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、これのタフネスが３以下である場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。」を持つ。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・農民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'038dccce-bdf3-4efd-a584-29ce2fa318a5\', \'multiverseId\': 630830}, \'multiverseid\': 630830}, {\'name\': \'Pais Protetores\', \'text\': \'Quando Pais Protetores morrer, crie uma ficha de Papel de Herói Jovem anexada a até uma criatura alvo que você controla. (Se você controlar outro Papel nela, coloque aquele no cemitério. A criatura encantada tem "Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, se sua resistência for igual ou inferior a 3, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Plebeu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cfcb07c-6545-4cbc-ac7c-5bfe16e407c4\', \'multiverseId\': 631091}, \'multiverseid\': 631091}, {\'name\': \'戒护家长\', \'text\': \'当戒护家长死去时，派出一个青年英雄角色衍生物，并贴附在至多一个目标由你操控的生物上。（如果其上已有另一个你操控的角色，则将已有之角色置入坟墓场。所结附的生物具有「每当此生物攻击时，若它的防御力等于或小于3，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。」）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／平民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d09fdf12-5735-4331-98b0-b4f09803125d\', \'multiverseId\': 631352}, \'multiverseid\': 631352}]', "[{'name': 'Bellowing Bruiser // Richtung einschlagen', 'text': 'Eile', 'type': 'Kreatur — Oger', 'flavor': 'Man kann einen Oger nicht hinter die Fichte führen.', 'faceName': 'Bellowing Bruiser', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629883&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb5823c8-06dd-488c-a882-681e24152941', 'multiverseId': 629883}, 'multiverseid': 629883}, {'name': 'Bellowing Bruiser // Abrirse camino', 'text': 'Prisa.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ogro', 'flavor': 'Frente a un ogro, no te andes con chiquitas.', 'faceName': 'Bellowing Bruiser', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630144&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49a7d3c1-a868-4d84-bdcd-ed1ef1fc5b4d', 'multiverseId': 630144}, 'multiverseid': 630144}, {'name': 'Bellowing Bruiser // Prendre les sentiers battus', 'text': 'Célérité', 'type': 'Créature — ogre', 'flavor': 'On ne peut pas faire courir un ogre.', 'faceName': 'Bellowing Bruiser', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630405&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '784c4786-ccd6-428f-ad94-bc7aa02861bc', 'multiverseId': 630405}, 'multiverseid': 630405}, {'name': 'Bellowing Bruiser // Battere un Sentiero', 'text': 'Rapidità', 'type': 'Creatura — Ogre', 'flavor': 'Non è facile seminare un ogre.', 'faceName': 'Bellowing Bruiser', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630666&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3491285b-ec06-4eb6-a7b5-694e56cdba77', 'multiverseId': 630666}, 'multiverseid': 630666}, {'name': 'Bellowing Bruiser // 道（みち）を切（き）り拓（ひら）く', 'text': '速攻', 'type': 'クリーチャー — オーガ', 'flavor': 'オーガに迂回させることはできない。', 'faceName': 'Bellowing Bruiser', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630927&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02d8eeb7-9f9f-49f9-bc45-d9fc4e6ae8b0', 'multiverseId': 630927}, 'multiverseid': 630927}, {'name': 'Bellowing Bruiser // Bater Trilha', 'text': 'Ímpeto', 'type': 'Criatura — Ogro', 'flavor': 'Não dá pra despistar um ogro.', 'faceName': 'Bellowing Bruiser', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631188&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c293f940-7f75-46ec-91da-64472a612cb7', 'multiverseId': 631188}, 'multiverseid': 631188}, {'name': 'Bellowing Bruiser // 打通新路', 'text': '敏捷', 'type': '生物 — 食人魔', 'flavor': '绕路难绕食人魔。', 'faceName': 'Bellowing Bruiser', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631449&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0386f413-d660-44ad-b43e-3a29e440fb35', 'multiverseId': 631449}, 'multiverseid': 631449}]", '[{\'name\': \'Beluna Grandsquall // Abenteuerlichkeit\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nBleibende-Karte-Zaubersprüche mit Abenteuer, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Riese, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Beluna Grandsquall\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'175e09f0-f735-45d6-b0fc-567562ff48ee\', \'multiverseId\': 629982}, \'multiverseid\': 629982}, {\'name\': \'Beluna Grandsquall // A la aventura\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de permanente que tengan una Aventura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Beluna Grandsquall\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d8ea7a0-c9ab-4adf-b35c-6fdbe6f9f0d0\', \'multiverseId\': 630243}, \'multiverseid\': 630243}, {\'name\': \'Beluna Grandsquall // En quête de frissons\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nLes sorts de permanent que vous lancez qui ont une aventure coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — géant et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Beluna Grandsquall\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630504&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d200112-2ee1-4e6e-a554-dfce9c30e9d4\', \'multiverseId\': 630504}, \'multiverseid\': 630504}, {\'name\': \'Beluna Grandsquall // In Cerca di Azione\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nLe magie permanente che lanci e che hanno un\'Avventura costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Beluna Grandsquall\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'566603fb-62f6-4b60-b537-6ead1d5ad50b\', \'multiverseId\': 630765}, \'multiverseid\': 630765}, {\'name\': \'Beluna Grandsquall // 快（かい）楽（らく）の渇（かつ）望（ぼう）\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたが出来事を持つパーマネント・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 巨人・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Beluna Grandsquall\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36ebc95b-2bca-4141-9995-76de3dddbe69\', \'multiverseId\': 631026}, \'multiverseid\': 631026}, {\'name\': \'Beluna Grandsquall // Buscar a Emoção\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nAs mágicas de permanente com uma Aventura que você conjura custam {1} a menos para conjurar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Gigante Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Beluna Grandsquall\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa2678c7-3e4c-493f-9d46-c4c049cc8148\', \'multiverseId\': 631287}, \'multiverseid\': 631287}, {\'name\': \'Beluna Grandsquall // 寻求刺激\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n你施放之具历险的永久物咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 巨人／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Beluna Grandsquall\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ce78a1-63ee-437e-9f5d-6436aeb2ece0\', \'multiverseId\': 631548}, \'multiverseid\': 631548}]', '[{\'name\': \'Besotted Knight // Verlobung mit dem Biest\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„In meinen Augen bist du kein Ungeheuer, meine Liebste."\', \'faceName\': \'Besotted Knight\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629766&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb2f0a0f-e6f4-4224-8c4b-79eb4fe73ad8\', \'multiverseId\': 629766}, \'multiverseid\': 629766}, {\'name\': \'Besotted Knight // Comprometerse con la bestia\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Para mí no eres un monstruo, amor mío".\', \'faceName\': \'Besotted Knight\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f95b8a7d-ce59-4353-b291-5c931caf63ca\', \'multiverseId\': 630027}, \'multiverseid\': 630027}, {\'name\': \'Besotted Knight // Se fiancer avec la bête\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« À mes yeux, tu n\'es pas un monstre, mon amour. »", \'faceName\': \'Besotted Knight\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630288&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53000d0e-5437-4c65-800c-39d6670f9fce\', \'multiverseId\': 630288}, \'multiverseid\': 630288}, {\'name\': \'Besotted Knight // Proporsi alla Bestia\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Per me non sei certo un mostro, amore mio."\', \'faceName\': \'Besotted Knight\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71848387-243c-4075-b441-d0ecff608eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 630549}, \'multiverseid\': 630549}, {\'name\': \'Besotted Knight // 獣（けもの）との婚（こん）約（やく）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「愛しい人よ、私にとってあなたは獣などではありません。」\', \'faceName\': \'Besotted Knight\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ffcb204-e63d-40a0-9701-766d3a5abb5d\', \'multiverseId\': 630810}, \'multiverseid\': 630810}, {\'name\': \'Besotted Knight // Desposar a Fera\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Você não é nenhum monstro pra mim, meu amor."\', \'faceName\': \'Besotted Knight\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77a548d3-a5ed-4c9b-bf94-c8f9da374610\', \'multiverseId\': 631071}, \'multiverseid\': 631071}, {\'name\': \'Besotted Knight // 亲结野兽\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「亲爱的，你不是我的怪物。」\', \'faceName\': \'Besotted Knight\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be6c4a9f-b051-4281-b564-6515c591efc0\', \'multiverseId\': 631332}, \'multiverseid\': 631332}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestialische Blutlinie\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2.\\n{4}{G}: Bringe die Bestialische Blutlinie aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Man spürt unbändige Freude, wenn man sich der Wildheit hingibt, und bitteren Schmerz, wenn man danach wieder zu Sinnen kommt. Du wirst das nie verstehen können."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a40d2d32-2d8a-4dba-827c-0427c76ee21a\', \'multiverseId\': 629924}, \'multiverseid\': 629924}, {\'name\': \'Linaje bestial\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2.\\n{4}{G}: Regresa el Linaje bestial de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Resulta extremadamente gozoso dejarse llevar por la brutalidad y dolorosamente amargo recuperar la cordura después. Nunca lo entenderás".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d51cc8-c800-44aa-8fbb-a0fd99b7d704\', \'multiverseId\': 630185}, \'multiverseid\': 630185}, {\'name\': \'Lignée bestiale\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2.\\n{4}{G} : Renvoyez la Lignée bestiale depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Se perdre dans la sauvagerie procure une féroce joie, et recouvrer ses sens plus tard apporte une douleur amère. Tu ne pourrais pas comprendre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e164aad6-aa8b-4656-a011-ed8ad82da9d0\', \'multiverseId\': 630446}, \'multiverseid\': 630446}, {\'name\': \'Stirpe Bestiale\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2.\\n{4}{G}: Riprendi in mano la Stirpe Bestiale dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"C\\\'è una gioia feroce nel lasciarsi andare alla barbarie e un dolore pungente nel recuperare poi la ragione. Non puoi capire."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64fa8d4d-2e8d-48a7-a792-1830dd7291d3\', \'multiverseId\': 630707}, \'multiverseid\': 630707}, {\'name\': \'獣の血筋\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n{4}{G}：あなたの墓地にある獣の血筋をあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「我を忘れると残虐行為に激しい快楽を覚えて、正気に戻ると苦痛に襲われる。あなたには理解できないでしょうね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c54b5d67-ceb8-4689-afa5-ce081eb0dead\', \'multiverseId\': 630968}, \'multiverseid\': 630968}, {\'name\': \'Linhagem Bestial\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2.\\n{4}{G}: Devolva Linhagem Bestial de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Há uma alegria selvagem em se entregar à selvageria, e uma dor amarga ao voltar a si depois. Você jamais entenderia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94173fb8-e5ba-480a-ba20-336a4d70d884\', \'multiverseId\': 631229}, \'multiverseid\': 631229}, {\'name\': \'野性血脉\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2。\\n{4}{G}：将野性血脉从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「受制野性沉沦其间，能享非凡狂乐；而在恢复意识重掌情绪后，又会苦楚悔恨。这种感受你永远都不会懂。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b91c75bd-c7b6-4215-bdae-09bee60de83a\', \'multiverseId\': 631490}, \'multiverseid\': 631490}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestienwerdung\', \'text\': \'Eine oder zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Erzeuge für jede jener Kreaturen einen an sie angelegten Monster-Rolle-Spielstein. (Falls du bereits eine andere daran angelegte Rolle kontrollierst, lege die alte Rolle auf den Friedhof. Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und verursacht Trampelschaden.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632093&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f49a9bde-bba4-4b3f-89f1-296622f8f5ef\', \'multiverseId\': 632093}, \'multiverseid\': 632093}, {\'name\': \'Bestializar\', \'text\': \'Una o dos criaturas objetivo ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Por cada una de esas criaturas, crea una ficha de Papel de Monstruo anexada a ella. (Si controlas otro Papel sobre ella, pon ese en el cementerio. La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21f18a3e-97a6-47e7-8033-bb85e58c83dd\', \'multiverseId\': 632108}, \'multiverseid\': 632108}, {\'name\': \'Devenir des brutes\', \'text\': "Une ou deux créatures ciblées acquièrent chacune la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Pour chacune de ces créatures, créez un jeton de rôle Monstre qui lui est attaché. (Si vous contrôlez un autre rôle sur elle, mettez-le au cimetière. La créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a le piétinement.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b9f12cd-9387-4383-9ab9-9128e970c0d0\', \'multiverseId\': 632123}, \'multiverseid\': 632123}, {\'name\': \'Imbestialire\', \'text\': \'Una o due creature bersaglio hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno. Per ognuna di quelle creature, crea una pedina Ruolo Mostro assegnata a essa. (Se controlli un altro Ruolo assegnato a quella creatura, metti quel Ruolo nel cimitero. La creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha travolgere.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ebbbe35-1c08-4b87-a5f2-bbcede443df8\', \'multiverseId\': 632138}, \'multiverseid\': 632138}, {\'name\': \'凶獣化\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体か２体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。それらの各クリーチャーにつきそれぞれ、怪物・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。（あなたがコントロールしている役割がすでにそれについていたなら、その役割を墓地に置く。エンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを持つ。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc5e6d33-bb5e-4eaf-9b55-a08b22c6e660\', \'multiverseId\': 632153}, \'multiverseid\': 632153}, {\'name\': \'Embrutecer-se\', \'text\': \'Uma ou duas criaturas alvo ganham ímpeto até o final do turno. Para cada uma dessas criaturas, crie uma ficha de Papel de Monstro anexada a ela. (Se você controlar outro Papel nela, coloque aquele no cemitério. A criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem atropelar.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd89fc4-2c10-4d15-9b5a-8c61094727b5\', \'multiverseId\': 632168}, \'multiverseid\': 632168}, {\'name\': \'蛮力迸发\', \'text\': \'一个或两个目标生物各获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。为每个此类生物各派出一个怪物角色衍生物并贴附于其上。（如果其上已有另一个你操控的角色，则将已有之角色置入坟墓场。所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有践踏异能。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'717d2694-ad44-4bfc-bdc2-5a984afd9a37\', \'multiverseId\': 632183}, \'multiverseid\': 632183}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutkappen-Gossenbewohner\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nWenn der Blutkappen-Gossenbewohner ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 schwarze Ratte-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du eine andere Kreatur opfern. Falls du dies tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutkappen-Gossenbewohner und schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629908&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f992ec01-9381-4ff3-b0ce-ce7d1d24358f\', \'multiverseId\': 629908}, \'multiverseid\': 629908}, {\'name\': \'Moralcantarillas gorro rojo\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nCuando el Moralcantarillas gorro rojo entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Rata negras 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear".\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes sacrificar otra criatura. Si lo haces, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Moralcantarillas gorro rojo y exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3645dff-639e-4c85-b1bb-63b6c9ff62f6\', \'multiverseId\': 630169}, \'multiverseid\': 630169}, {\'name\': \'Égoutier bonnet-rouge\', \'text\': "Menace\\nQuand l\'Égoutier bonnet-rouge arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. »\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Égoutier bonnet-rouge et exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630430&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed0ce5f9-5f79-4e1b-8eb7-520aac899b3e\', \'multiverseId\': 630430}, \'multiverseid\': 630430}, {\'name\': \'Berretto Rosso dei Bassifondi\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\\nQuando il Berretto Rosso dei Bassifondi entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Ratto 1/1 nere con "Questa creatura non può bloccare".\\nAll\\\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi sacrificare un\\\'altra creatura. Se lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Berretto Rosso dei Bassifondi ed esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ec10e7c-78b2-4044-82ed-2e44cb0867dd\', \'multiverseId\': 630691}, \'multiverseid\': 630691}, {\'name\': \'レッドキャップのどぶ住まい\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nレッドキャップのどぶ住まいが戦場に出たとき、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、レッドキャップのどぶ住まいの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、そのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d0b6b1e-846c-483d-85c3-f8875c5281db\', \'multiverseId\': 630952}, \'multiverseid\': 630952}, {\'name\': \'Sarjetano Barrete Vermelho\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nQuando Sarjetano Barrete Vermelho entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura Rato preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear".\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode sacrificar outra criatura. Se fizer isso, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Sarjetano Barrete Vermelho e exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aquele card neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf862fc-ac90-4312-8c18-f8bad0d1843a\', \'multiverseId\': 631213}, \'multiverseid\': 631213}, {\'name\': \'居渠红帽客\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n当居渠红帽客进战场时，派出两个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以牺牲另一个生物。若你如此作，则在居渠红帽客上放置一个+1/+1指示物并放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'757f279f-d32c-4ea0-b3fb-f6154302037a\', \'multiverseId\': 631474}, \'multiverseid\': 631474}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutkappen-Gossenbewohner\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nWenn der Blutkappen-Gossenbewohner ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 schwarze Ratte-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du eine andere Kreatur opfern. Falls du dies tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutkappen-Gossenbewohner und schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631884&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf005b25-f4d4-490b-bdd1-0d0c5b9e3562\', \'multiverseId\': 631884}, \'multiverseid\': 631884}, {\'name\': \'Égoutier bonnet-rouge\', \'text\': "Menace\\nQuand l\'Égoutier bonnet-rouge arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. »\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Égoutier bonnet-rouge et exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631931&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'683990f3-01c2-403e-bc58-a325a8fb92bd\', \'multiverseId\': 631931}, \'multiverseid\': 631931}, {\'name\': \'レッドキャップのどぶ住まい\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nレッドキャップのどぶ住まいが戦場に出たとき、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、レッドキャップのどぶ住まいの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、そのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f86750db-5349-489d-b91e-61e63091b4f9\', \'multiverseId\': 631978}, \'multiverseid\': 631978}, {\'name\': \'居渠红帽客\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n当居渠红帽客进战场时，派出两个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以牺牲另一个生物。若你如此作，则在居渠红帽客上放置一个+1/+1指示物并放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4384a77b-e7f7-4c04-baf5-26f4f58148ef\', \'multiverseId\': 632025}, \'multiverseid\': 632025}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutkappendieb\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Blutkappendieb ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Am besten ist Glitzerndes. Dann Scharfes. Scharf ist gut. Alles andere ist wertlos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629909&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'920d8141-e4a4-4a1c-a230-2e937a6fb0c4\', \'multiverseId\': 629909}, \'multiverseid\': 629909}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón gorro rojo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ladrón gorro rojo entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo mejor es lo brillante. Luego lo afilado. Lo afilado está bien. Lo demás es basura, básicamente".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46775453-1984-45b2-9ccd-c728f186d98d\', \'multiverseId\': 630170}, \'multiverseid\': 630170}, {\'name\': \'Voleur bonnet-rouge\', \'text\': "Quand le Voleur bonnet-rouge arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« C\'qui brille c\'est le mieux. Puis c\'qui coupe. C\'qui coupe, c\'est bien. Le reste, c\'est à jeter. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630431&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bb753af-8db9-4aff-8065-a08f1679118b\', \'multiverseId\': 630431}, \'multiverseid\': 630431}, {\'name\': \'Berretto Rosso Ladro\', \'text\': \'Quando il Berretto Rosso Ladro entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Brillante è il meglio. Poi affilato. Affilato va bene. Tutto il resto è spazzatura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c30105-817c-4b7e-b4a6-cb4e45527d78\', \'multiverseId\': 630692}, \'multiverseid\': 630692}, {\'name\': \'レッドキャップの盗賊\', \'text\': \'レッドキャップの盗賊が戦場に出たとき、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「光るものが一番いい。その次が鋭いものだ。鋭いものもいい。それ以外のものはゴミ同然だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78899a25-48f7-4fb4-abe0-95705ea61110\', \'multiverseId\': 630953}, \'multiverseid\': 630953}, {\'name\': \'Ladrão Barrete Vermelho\', \'text\': \'Quando Ladrão Barrete Vermelho entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Tesouro. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Brilhante é melhor. Depois é afiado. Afiado é bom. Qualquer outra coisa, basicamente, é lixo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d4c468-2ead-4816-b671-bb0b49e57d1c\', \'multiverseId\': 631214}, \'multiverseid\': 631214}, {\'name\': \'窃物红帽客\', \'text\': \'当窃物红帽客进战场时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鬼怪／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「亮晶晶的最好。然后是刺尖尖。刺尖尖的不错。其他就都垃圾。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cb7a55c-4460-48ff-9cee-8d1e62c9ed0b\', \'multiverseId\': 631475}, \'multiverseid\': 631475}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bramble Familiar // Apportieraufgabe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Bringe den Dornenstrauch-Vertrauten auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Waschbär\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Bramble Familiar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a412f26c-47e3-482d-bb18-104406f6924f\', \'multiverseId\': 629926}, \'multiverseid\': 629926}, {\'name\': \'Bramble Familiar // Misión de recolección\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, descartar una carta: Regresa el Familiar de las zarzas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mapache elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Bramble Familiar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eac449f0-ad9a-4e53-91c9-229da968ccf7\', \'multiverseId\': 630187}, \'multiverseid\': 630187}, {\'name\': \'Bramble Familiar // Partir en quête\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Renvoyez le Familier de ronces dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature — élémental et raton-laveur\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Bramble Familiar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630448&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ee50e26-7d3a-4450-a359-8137bda726fc\', \'multiverseId\': 630448}, \'multiverseid\': 630448}, {\'name\': \'Bramble Familiar // Missione di Ricerca\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, Scarta una carta: Fai tornare il Famiglio di Rovi in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Procione Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Bramble Familiar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'654bb8d7-189d-440a-b315-0327ed21c680\', \'multiverseId\': 630709}, \'multiverseid\': 630709}, {\'name\': \'Bramble Familiar // 初（はじ）めてのお使（つか）い\', \'text\': \'{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{1}{G}, {T}, カード１枚を捨てる：木苺の使い魔をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・アライグマ\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Bramble Familiar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'180da8f9-21fe-4ce1-8ec6-5b2d9495f77b\', \'multiverseId\': 630970}, \'multiverseid\': 630970}, {\'name\': \'Bramble Familiar // Demanda de Busca\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, descarte um card: Devolva Familiar da Sarça para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Guaxinim\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Bramble Familiar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf470e24-491b-4c1f-8216-6079f423b3e6\', \'multiverseId\': 631231}, \'multiverseid\': 631231}, {\'name\': \'Bramble Familiar // 寻得标的\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}。\\n{1}{G}，{T}，弃一张牌：将刺藤佣兽移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 元素／浣熊\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Bramble Familiar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86b93f3d-b712-4b01-bb69-3e00e186ab5c\', \'multiverseId\': 631492}, \'multiverseid\': 631492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Buboh-Störenfried\', \'text\': \'Feilschen (Du kannst ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder einen Spielstein opfern, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nWenn der Buboh-Störenfried ins Spiel kommt und falls um ihn gefeilscht wurde, schicke ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, das bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Buboh\', \'flavor\': \'Schwer ruht das Haupt, das eine Vase drückt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629956&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eb73784-d9df-4bc3-b990-41b09b667f6f\', \'multiverseId\': 629956}, \'multiverseid\': 629956}, {\'name\': \'Oufé alborotador\', \'text\': \'Negociar. (Puedes sacrificar un artefacto, encantamiento o ficha al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nCuando el Oufé alborotador entre al campo de batalla, si fue negociado, exilia el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Oufé\', \'flavor\': \'Pesada es la cabeza que porta el jarrón.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec71c34-db9a-40bb-804e-914e4d1a3eb1\', \'multiverseId\': 630217}, \'multiverseid\': 630217}, {\'name\': \'Orphe fauteur de troubles\', \'text\': "Négociation (Vous pouvez sacrifier un artefact, un enchantement ou un jeton au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nQuand l\'Orphe fauteur de troubles arrive sur le champ de bataille, s\'il a été négocié, exilez une cible, artefact ou enchantement, qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature — orphe\', \'flavor\': \'Lourde est la tête qui porte le vase.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630478&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de16dbc5-e29c-420e-b0dc-63c644bca7c4\', \'multiverseId\': 630478}, \'multiverseid\': 630478}, {\'name\': \'Ouphe Piantagrane\', \'text\': "Negoziare (Puoi sacrificare un artefatto, un incantesimo o una pedina mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nQuando l\'Ouphe Piantagrane entra nel campo di battaglia, se è stato negoziato, esilia un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio controllato da un avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ouphe\', \'flavor\': \'Pesante è il capo di chi indossa un vaso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a1c7829-86c2-4366-9e9f-0143a76ae8d0\', \'multiverseId\': 630739}, \'multiverseid\': 630739}, {\'name\': \'やんちゃなアウフ\', \'text\': \'協約（この呪文を唱えるに際し、アーティファクトやエンチャントやトークンのうち１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。）\\nやんちゃなアウフが戦場に出たとき、これが協約されていた場合、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち対戦相手がコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アウフ\', \'flavor\': \'花瓶を抱えた頭は重いものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94acf121-c406-42a0-abb8-ebfe6b8c1b98\', \'multiverseId\': 631000}, \'multiverseid\': 631000}, {\'name\': \'Trasgo Encrenqueiro\', \'text\': \'Negociar (Você pode sacrificar um artefato, um encantamento ou uma ficha conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nQuando Trasgo Encrenqueiro entrar no campo de batalha, se ele tiver sido negociado, exile o artefato ou encantamento alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Pesada é a cabeça que usa o vaso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ee59d05-127e-43a7-becc-c004d87ccbc4\', \'multiverseId\': 631261}, \'multiverseid\': 631261}, {\'name\': \'惹祸奥夫\', \'text\': \'加码（你施放此咒语时可以牺牲一个神器，结界或衍生物。）\\n当惹祸奥夫进战场时，若它已加码，则放逐目标由对手操控的神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 奥夫\', \'flavor\': \'花瓶越重，责任越大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832d5f2d-48de-442a-bee5-840caed19330\', \'multiverseId\': 631522}, \'multiverseid\': 631522}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böser Besucher\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Verzauberung, die du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nachtmahr\', \'flavor\': \'Verschmelzungen verschiedenster Albträume pirschen durch das Reich der Träume und laben sich am kollektiven Schrecken aller, die im Bösen Schlummer gefangen sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629880&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d950fcac-21e3-4f62-a30d-77eeb3e88fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 629880}, \'multiverseid\': 629880}, {\'name\': \'Visitante vil\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un encantamiento que controlas vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadilla\', \'flavor\': \'En el reino de los sueños acechaban amalgamas de pesadillas infantiles que alimentaban el terror colectivo de los atrapados en el Sueño embrujado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cf8641d-a408-408c-b51f-bad318bc87b6\', \'multiverseId\': 630141}, \'multiverseid\': 630141}, {\'name\': \'Visiteur maléfique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — cauchemar\', \'flavor\': "Des amalgames de bon nombre de cauchemars d\'enfance arpentaient le royaume des rêves, se délectant de la terreur collective de tous ceux qui étaient piégés dans le Sommeil maléfique.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630402&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eb840ae-8601-4d7c-97bd-78bf96804d84\', \'multiverseId\': 630402}, \'multiverseid\': 630402}, {\'name\': \'Visitatore Perfido\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo che controlli viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Incubo\', \'flavor\': \'Un amalgama di svariati incubi di gioventù infestava il reame dei sogni, nutrendosi del terrore collettivo di tutte le vittime del Sonno Stregato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae260d7-2ce3-4528-ba5f-7f98e8093623\', \'multiverseId\': 630663}, \'multiverseid\': 630663}, {\'name\': \'忌まわしき訪問者\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているエンチャント１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナイトメア\', \'flavor\': \'子供の頃の悪夢の融合体は夢の世界を徘徊し、忌まわしき眠りに閉じ込められた者たちの集合的な恐怖を糧にしていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfcc390f-7029-4b3c-ae09-61971b6dfb8d\', \'multiverseId\': 630924}, \'multiverseid\': 630924}, {\'name\': \'Visitante Malvado\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um encantamento que você controla é colocado em um cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadelo\', \'flavor\': \'Amálgamas de muitos pesadelos de infância espreitavam no reino dos sonhos, alimentando-se do terror coletivo de todos os prisioneiros da Sonolência Maldita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69960efc-44a1-4e87-ad76-4c1a679b1dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 631185}, \'multiverseid\': 631185}, {\'name\': \'邪恶访客\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的结界从战场进入坟墓场时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 梦魇\', \'flavor\': \'童年时期的诸多梦魇拼合成形、漫游梦境，不断汲取受困于沉睡咒中众人的恐惧之情而日益壮大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a1f44c0-09a6-4997-a409-be2e9739585c\', \'multiverseId\': 631446}, \'multiverseid\': 631446}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böswilliger Hexendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Böswillige Hexendrache ins Spiel kommt, opfere eine beliebige Anzahl an Artefakten, Verzauberungen und/oder Spielsteinen und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'„Gab es hier in der Nähe eine furchterregende Hexe? Oder war es ein grausamer Drache? Die Geschichten waren widersprüch— oh nein."\\n—Osval, Abenteurer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632091&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31780914-724f-4e03-abcf-5d408e1314a1\', \'multiverseId\': 632091}, \'multiverseid\': 632091}, {\'name\': \'Milanobrujo malévolo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Milanobrujo malévolo entre al campo de batalla, sacrifica cualquier cantidad de artefactos, encantamientos y/o fichas, luego roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Había una brujo aterrador por aquí? ¿O era un cruel dragón? Las historias eran confu... oh, oh".\\n—Osval, aventurero\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b00b31f3-160d-41e4-83d6-8cf74e50ba57\', \'multiverseId\': 632106}, \'multiverseid\': 632106}, {\'name\': \'Escouflemage maléfique\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Escouflemage maléfique arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez n\'importe quel nombre d\'artefacts, d\'enchantements et/ou de jetons, puis piochez autant de cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature — dragon et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': \'« Il y aurait eu un terrifiant sorcier par ici... Ou encore un cruel dragon ? Les rumeurs étaient contradi... Oh non. »\\n—Osval, aventurier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632121&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'561fa9ee-de3b-4518-a3e5-1d472a269346\', \'multiverseId\': 632121}, \'multiverseid\': 632121}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Stregone Malevolo\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Nibbio Stregone Malevolo entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrifica un qualsiasi numero di artefatti, incantesimi e/o pedine, poi pesca altrettante carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"È qui che risiedeva un terribile stregone? O era un drago crudele? Le storie erano confu... oh no."\\n— Osval, avventuriero\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7263a5ab-8992-4de8-84ef-fb578d1beded\', \'multiverseId\': 632136}, \'multiverseid\': 632136}, {\'name\': \'邪悪なウィッチカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n邪悪なウィッチカイトが戦場に出たとき、望む数のアーティファクトやエンチャントやトークンを生け贄に捧げる。その後、その数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「おそろしい魔女はいなかったか？ひょっとすると残忍なドラゴンではなかったか？言い伝えがどうにも……ってそんな馬鹿な。」\\n——冒険者、オスヴァル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bd6a4ef-ab3f-4a5f-af2f-4c5ef4db11cd\', \'multiverseId\': 632151}, \'multiverseid\': 632151}, {\'name\': \'Dragão-bruxo Malévolo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Dragão-bruxo Malévolo entrar no campo de batalha, sacrifique qualquer número de artefatos, encantamentos e/ou fichas e depois compre aquela quantidade de cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão Bruxo\', \'flavor\': \'"Havia um temível bruxo por essas bandas? Ou teria sido um dragão cruel? As histórias me conf...ah, não."\\n— Osval, aventureiro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9edc105-d1bd-44f4-9451-ee658817eeaf\', \'multiverseId\': 632166}, \'multiverseid\': 632166}, {\'name\': \'恶毒残虐巫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当恶毒残虐巫进战场时，牺牲任意数量的神器，结界和／或衍生物，然后抓等量的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 龙／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'「这里究竟是有可怕的巫师？还是残暴的巨龙？传说语焉不～啊，不。」\\n～冒险家欧斯瓦\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84e5727c-002d-4522-8c92-f3810cac13bb\', \'multiverseId\': 632181}, \'multiverseid\': 632181}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böswilliger Hexendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Böswillige Hexendrache ins Spiel kommt, opfere eine beliebige Anzahl an Artefakten, Verzauberungen und/oder Spielsteinen und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632051&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b961cc4f-27be-4577-be05-e5e708603f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 632051}, \'multiverseid\': 632051}, {\'name\': \'Escouflemage maléfique\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Escouflemage maléfique arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez n\'importe quel nombre d\'artefacts, d\'enchantements et/ou de jetons, puis piochez autant de cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature — dragon et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632056&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b86e63-145a-4229-98ad-5a7069c9e87c\', \'multiverseId\': 632056}, \'multiverseid\': 632056}, {\'name\': \'邪悪なウィッチカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n邪悪なウィッチカイトが戦場に出たとき、望む数のアーティファクトやエンチャントやトークンを生け贄に捧げる。その後、その数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baff0ff4-bfb7-43dc-8046-9bc226043b57\', \'multiverseId\': 632061}, \'multiverseid\': 632061}, {\'name\': \'恶毒残虐巫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当恶毒残虐巫进战场时，牺牲任意数量的神器，结界和／或衍生物，然后抓等量的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 龙／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5b6f5f7-c342-418c-b639-96e585da0036\', \'multiverseId\': 632066}, \'multiverseid\': 632066}]', '[{\'name\': \'Callous Sell-Sword // Gemeinsamer Untergang\', \'text\': \'Der Ruchlose Söldner kommt für jede Kreatur, die in diesem Zug unter deiner Kontrolle gestorben ist, mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Callous Sell-Sword\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ca782f6-c183-431d-b665-5eb74769a77e\', \'multiverseId\': 629983}, \'multiverseid\': 629983}, {\'name\': \'Callous Sell-Sword // Eliminación mutua\', \'text\': \'El Asesino a sueldo desalmado entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él por cada criatura que murió bajo tu control este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Callous Sell-Sword\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'270af391-1ed0-4d0b-b8eb-f4fd27c56e04\', \'multiverseId\': 630244}, \'multiverseid\': 630244}, {\'name\': \'Callous Sell-Sword // Brûler ensemble\', \'text\': "L\'Épée à louer inhumaine arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 pour chaque créature qui est morte sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Callous Sell-Sword\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630505&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db2ae10f-047c-48a2-85d6-f57a23425e81\', \'multiverseId\': 630505}, \'multiverseid\': 630505}, {\'name\': \'Callous Sell-Sword // Bruciare Insieme\', \'text\': \'Il Prezzolato Insensibile entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni creatura che è morta sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Callous Sell-Sword\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00a49edb-0486-48b1-84c8-2b1882e96fa8\', \'multiverseId\': 630766}, \'multiverseid\': 630766}, {\'name\': \'Callous Sell-Sword // 合（ごう）同（どう）火（か）葬（そう）\', \'text\': \'無感情の売剣は、このターンにあなたのコントロール下で死亡したクリーチャー１体につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Callous Sell-Sword\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48bd368e-3bb0-4186-b15b-3fdc725e499d\', \'multiverseId\': 631027}, \'multiverseid\': 631027}, {\'name\': \'Callous Sell-Sword // Queimar Juntos\', \'text\': \'Mercenário Impiedoso entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 por cada criatura que morreu sob seu controle neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Callous Sell-Sword\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcacc1ec-edd5-4511-a7a0-d6adb26af332\', \'multiverseId\': 631288}, \'multiverseid\': 631288}, {\'name\': \'Callous Sell-Sword // 同归一烬\', \'text\': \'冷酷贷剑客进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于本回合中在你操控下死去的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Callous Sell-Sword\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffafb4ef-2ac9-4d01-9cf4-e31b7431f409\', \'multiverseId\': 631549}, \'multiverseid\': 631549}]', '[{\'name\': \'Charmante Halunkin\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nWenn die Charmante Halunkin ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Wirf eine Karte ab und ziehe dann eine Karte.\\n• Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\n• Erzeuge einen Böse-Rolle-Spielstein, angelegt an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629886&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0e225df-c91b-4fa2-8ebc-e757caab9e8c\', \'multiverseId\': 629886}, \'multiverseid\': 629886}, {\'name\': \'Truhana encantadora\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCuando la Truhana encantadora entre al campo de batalla, elige uno:\\n• Descarta una carta, luego roba una carta.\\n• Crea una ficha de Tesoro.\\n• Crea una ficha de Papel de Malvado anexada a la criatura objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9a4ffa-79ce-4c73-ae2d-78ce724a75c8\', \'multiverseId\': 630147}, \'multiverseid\': 630147}, {\'name\': \'Vaurienne charmante\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nQuand la Vaurienne charmante arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Défaussez-vous d\'une carte, puis piochez une carte.\\n• Créez un jeton Trésor.\\n• Créez un jeton de rôle Maléfique attaché à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630408&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf18ca8f-7d37-4111-acb2-07dce16aa9bb\', \'multiverseId\': 630408}, \'multiverseid\': 630408}, {\'name\': \'Canaglia Affascinante\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nQuando la Canaglia Affascinante entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno —\\n• Scarta una carta, poi pesca una carta.\\n• Crea una pedina Tesoro.\\n• Crea una pedina Ruolo Perfido assegnata a una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6395858e-77ba-4b79-927f-9e94f59e4aab\', \'multiverseId\': 630669}, \'multiverseid\': 630669}, {\'name\': \'魅力的な悪漢\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n魅力的な悪漢が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• カード１枚を捨てる。その後、カード１枚を引く。\\n・宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n・あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ひねくれ者・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05f7ab82-9e77-4c39-a3b6-b5f444425648\', \'multiverseId\': 630930}, \'multiverseid\': 630930}, {\'name\': \'Patife Charmosa\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nQuando Patife Charmosa entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um —\\n• Descarte um card e depois compre um card.\\n• Crie uma ficha de Tesouro.\\n• Crie uma ficha de Papel de Malvado anexada à criatura alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc60dbe-b471-4e13-aad8-5b026f495ce4\', \'multiverseId\': 631191}, \'multiverseid\': 631191}, {\'name\': \'俊美恶棍\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n当俊美恶棍进战场时，选择一项～\\n•弃一张牌，然后抓一张牌。\\n•派出一个珍宝衍生物。\\n•派出一个恶人角色衍生物，并贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0da9d503-b360-4083-8d70-6077a9fac466\', \'multiverseId\': 631452}, \'multiverseid\': 631452}]', '[{\'name\': \'Charmante Halunkin\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nWenn die Charmante Halunkin ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Wirf eine Karte ab und ziehe dann eine Karte.\\n• Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\n• Erzeuge einen Böse-Rolle-Spielstein, angelegt an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf4987d2-17a6-4a0b-9d66-06de30dfcafd\', \'multiverseId\': 631878}, \'multiverseid\': 631878}, {\'name\': \'Vaurienne charmante\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nQuand la Vaurienne charmante arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Défaussez-vous d\'une carte, puis piochez une carte.\\n• Créez un jeton Trésor.\\n• Créez un jeton de rôle Maléfique attaché à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631925&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9d403dd-2e03-431a-b144-8c82e5384c94\', \'multiverseId\': 631925}, \'multiverseid\': 631925}, {\'name\': \'魅力的な悪漢\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n魅力的な悪漢が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• カード１枚を捨てる。その後、カード１枚を引く。\\n・宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n・あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ひねくれ者・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5ffd1da-915a-4482-a478-e1f571843121\', \'multiverseId\': 631972}, \'multiverseid\': 631972}, {\'name\': \'俊美恶棍\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n当俊美恶棍进战场时，选择一项～\\n•弃一张牌，然后抓一张牌。\\n•派出一个珍宝衍生物。\\n•派出一个恶人角色衍生物，并贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1c0c006-1155-432c-a68f-2b77e40e08da\', \'multiverseId\': 632019}, \'multiverseid\': 632019}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cheeky House-Mouse // Maustricksen\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Maus\', \'flavor\': \'„Komm zurück, du grässlicher Nager! Ich war noch nicht damit fertig, diesen Ring mit einem Fluch zu belegen!"\', \'faceName\': \'Cheeky House-Mouse\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629769&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fac56ec-1a2c-482a-bec7-f616c8f1a327\', \'multiverseId\': 629769}, \'multiverseid\': 629769}, {\'name\': \'Cheeky House-Mouse // Por los pelos\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ratón\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Vuelve aquí, dichoso roedor! ¡Casi había terminado de maldecir ese anillo!".\', \'faceName\': \'Cheeky House-Mouse\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06fadd97-9566-4128-bd9a-b8340ed268db\', \'multiverseId\': 630030}, \'multiverseid\': 630030}, {\'name\': \'Cheeky House-Mouse // À un poil près\', \'type\': \'Créature — souris\', \'flavor\': "« Reviens ici, vil rongeur ! J\'avais presque terminé de maudire cette bague ! »", \'faceName\': \'Cheeky House-Mouse\', \'image