verseid': 630000}, {'name': 'Tempest Hart // Examinar las nubes', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo con valor de maná de 5 o más, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Venado de la tempestad.', 'type': 'Criatura — Alce elemental', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Tempest Hart', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630261&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef71b6ae-15a3-47c2-a93c-e1546f357cce', 'multiverseId': 630261}, 'multiverseid': 630261}, {'name': 'Tempest Hart // Scruter les nuages', 'text': 'Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 5, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Cerf des tempêtes.', 'type': 'Créature — élémental et élan', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Tempest Hart', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630522&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94d9df4b-2399-45cc-bb7d-cd087df9ebe7', 'multiverseId': 630522}, 'multiverseid': 630522}, {'name': 'Tempest Hart // Scrutare le Nubi', 'text': 'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia con valore di mana pari o superiore a 5, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Cervo della Tempesta.', 'type': 'Creatura — Alce Elementale', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Tempest Hart', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630783&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc24ab24-28ba-412b-9a30-da5ab03954e5', 'multiverseId': 630783}, 'multiverseid': 630783}, {'name': 'Tempest Hart // 雲（くも）の走（そう）査（さ）', 'text': 'トランプル\\nあなたがマナ総量が５以上である呪文１つを唱えるたび、大嵐の雄鹿の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・大鹿', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Tempest Hart', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631044&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a58a82bd-5bbb-482d-bb36-4ef34d8a544e', 'multiverseId': 631044}, 'multiverseid': 631044}, {'name': 'Tempest Hart // Varredura das Nuvens', 'text': 'Atropelar\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica com valor de mana igual ou superior a 5, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Cervo da Tempestade.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental Alce', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Tempest Hart', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631305&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac743902-4ef0-4ac4-b82c-bc10ebf7f05b', 'multiverseId': 631305}, 'multiverseid': 631305}, {'name': 'Tempest Hart // 寻遍层云', 'text': '践踏\\n每当你施放法术力值等于或大于5的咒语时，在暴风雄鹿上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物 — 元素／麋鹿', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Tempest Hart', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631566&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1072a7ae-306d-4fdb-b2b1-dd0be2cf7fdd', 'multiverseId': 631566}, 'multiverseid': 631566}]", '[{\'name\': \'Threadbind Clique // Nahtriss\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Entzücktes Gekicher könnte das Letzte sein, was du jemals hörst.\', \'faceName\': \'Threadbind Clique\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630001&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2c38fac-02d9-49b0-9989-1a3088a5e17a\', \'multiverseId\': 630001}, \'multiverseid\': 630001}, {\'name\': \'Threadbind Clique // Rasgar las costuras\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hada\', \'flavor\': \'Puede que lo último que oigas sean unas risitas de deleite.\', \'faceName\': \'Threadbind Clique\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37da78a6-824f-411c-bc00-7d88ceab318a\', \'multiverseId\': 630262}, \'multiverseid\': 630262}, {\'name\': \'Threadbind Clique // Déchirer les coutures\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée\', \'flavor\': \'Des gloussements de joie pourraient bien être la dernière chose que vous entendrez.\', \'faceName\': \'Threadbind Clique\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630523&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6305036c-0acd-4409-8bcd-44a9ccb0fd37\', \'multiverseId\': 630523}, \'multiverseid\': 630523}, {\'name\': \'Threadbind Clique // Strappare la Cucitura\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spiritello\', \'flavor\': "L\'ultima cosa che sentirai potrebbe essere un coro di risate soddisfatte.", \'faceName\': \'Threadbind Clique\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd89bf07-82fb-4571-aab2-cf54fa19399b\', \'multiverseId\': 630784}, \'multiverseid\': 630784}, {\'name\': \'Threadbind Clique // 継（つ）ぎ目（め）破（やぶ）り\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー\', \'flavor\': \'最後に聞く声が、楽しげな笑い声になるかもしれない。\', \'faceName\': \'Threadbind Clique\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5882480d-8823-4b40-bcac-b23a102afb4a\', \'multiverseId\': 631045}, \'multiverseid\': 631045}, {\'name\': \'Threadbind Clique // Rasgar a Costura\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada\', \'flavor\': \'Risinhos de deleite podem ser a última coisa que você vai ouvir.\', \'faceName\': \'Threadbind Clique\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa71872c-f2d4-4c18-a647-ea989d3f8ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 631306}, \'multiverseid\': 631306}, {\'name\': \'Threadbind Clique // 撕裂缝口\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物 — 仙灵\', \'flavor\': \'这些欢闹的嬉笑声，可能就是你最后听到的声音。\', \'faceName\': \'Threadbind Clique\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ff7d573-37fb-4550-9b77-e403699157dc\', \'multiverseId\': 631567}, \'multiverseid\': 631567}]', '[{\'name\': \'Titanisches Wachstum\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +4/+4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Mir scheint, Sie bräuchten ein größeres Netz, werter Herr Feenfänger."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629953&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'882d10e3-39ef-41a0-b4ce-94e9ab2605da\', \'multiverseId\': 629953}, \'multiverseid\': 629953}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento titánico\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +4/+4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Veo que necesita una red más grande, señor cazador de hadas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adf9e4fc-877d-4bb5-a2ed-5fbe48b5175b\', \'multiverseId\': 630214}, \'multiverseid\': 630214}, {\'name\': \'Croissance titanesque\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +4/+4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Il va te falloir un filet plus grand, monsieur l\'attrapeur de fæ. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630475&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a71c61ed-903f-46f9-aced-4d4b23682a6d\', \'multiverseId\': 630475}, \'multiverseid\': 630475}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Titanica\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +4/+4 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Avrai bisogno di una rete più grande, caro il mio cacciatore di spiritelli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01ec4bcc-450e-45c8-8071-160e02e83203\', \'multiverseId\': 630736}, \'multiverseid\': 630736}, {\'name\': \'剛力化\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋４/＋４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「その網じゃ捕まえられそうにないね、フェイの密猟者さん。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a310777-4af1-4bad-b156-3cf5c120aa7d\', \'multiverseId\': 630997}, \'multiverseid\': 630997}, {\'name\': \'Crescimento Titânico\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +4/+4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Parece que você precisa de uma rede maior, senhor caçador de fadas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f4ae0a3-d27a-446f-bd11-ee2028274cf3\', \'multiverseId\': 631258}, \'multiverseid\': 631258}, {\'name\': \'巨力成长\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+4/+4直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「捕仙客先生，你可能要换张大点的网。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea7d2abe-7244-4777-8002-78b49771c940\', \'multiverseId\': 631519}, \'multiverseid\': 631519}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tobende Kampfmaus\', \'text\': \'Der zweite Zauberspruch, den du pro Zug wirkst, kostet beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nFeier — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls zwei oder mehr bleibende Karten, die keine Länder sind, in diesem Zug unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen sind, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Maus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629905&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db73e786-0a5c-491c-b648-872d2a6d98b1\', \'multiverseId\': 629905}, \'multiverseid\': 629905}, {\'name\': \'Ratón de combate rabioso\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar el segundo hechizo que lances cada turno.\\nCelebración — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si dos o más permanentes que no sean tierra entraron al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, la criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ratón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f67df42d-619a-4d21-87a8-9d8488b67ccd\', \'multiverseId\': 630166}, \'multiverseid\': 630166}, {\'name\': \'Souris de combat enragée\', \'text\': "Le deuxième sort que vous lancez à chaque tour coûte {1} de moins à lancer.\\nCélébration — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si au moins deux permanents non-terrain sont arrivés sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — souris\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c15dfc95-ab3e-4031-b0e9-03909a3dd40c\', \'multiverseId\': 630427}, \'multiverseid\': 630427}, {\'name\': \'Topo da Battaglia Furioso\', \'text\': "La seconda magia che lanci in ogni turno costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata.\\nCelebrazione — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se due o più permanenti non terra sono entrati nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Topo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ac908a1-32ef-4a32-ab0a-d688ff073499\', \'multiverseId\': 630688}, \'multiverseid\': 630688}, {\'name\': \'怒り狂う戦闘ネズミ\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２つ目の呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n祝祭 — あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、このターンに土地でない２つ以上のパーマネントがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たことがある場合、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハツカネズミ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd31aa3-cafb-4a91-a138-654322515197\', \'multiverseId\': 630949}, \'multiverseid\': 630949}, {\'name\': \'Camundongo de Batalha Enfurecido\', \'text\': \'A segunda mágica que você conjura a cada turno custa {1} a menos para conjurar.\\nCelebração — No início do combate no seu turno, se duas ou mais permanentes não de terreno tiverem entrado no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno, a criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Camundongo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd7b6824-7a00-4ee8-8bb2-247971509c3e\', \'multiverseId\': 631210}, \'multiverseid\': 631210}, {\'name\': \'狂怒战鼠\', \'text\': \'你每回合中施放的第二个咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n欢庆～在你回合的战斗开始时，若本回合中有两个或更多非地永久物在你的操控下进战场，则目标由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 家鼠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39b20fe6-e3d7-4957-b19b-6a894ac9919c\', \'multiverseId\': 631471}, \'multiverseid\': 631471}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tobende Kampfmaus\', \'text\': \'Der zweite Zauberspruch, den du pro Zug wirkst, kostet beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nFeier — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls zwei oder mehr bleibende Karten, die keine Länder sind, in diesem Zug unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen sind, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Maus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631882&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bbef5a4-4c4d-461e-94bf-8ad37ea260be\', \'multiverseId\': 631882}, \'multiverseid\': 631882}, {\'name\': \'Souris de combat enragée\', \'text\': "Le deuxième sort que vous lancez à chaque tour coûte {1} de moins à lancer.\\nCélébration — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si au moins deux permanents non-terrain sont arrivés sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — souris\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631929&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'992ec854-bcb3-4934-b716-f72e17cb1a27\', \'multiverseId\': 631929}, \'multiverseid\': 631929}, {\'name\': \'怒り狂う戦闘ネズミ\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２つ目の呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n祝祭 — あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、このターンに土地でない２つ以上のパーマネントがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たことがある場合、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハツカネズミ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81217021-b29c-4528-b5a8-f47673590e91\', \'multiverseId\': 631976}, \'multiverseid\': 631976}, {\'name\': \'狂怒战鼠\', \'text\': \'你每回合中施放的第二个咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n欢庆～在你回合的战斗开始时，若本回合中有两个或更多非地永久物在你的操控下进战场，则目标由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 家鼠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27b0555a-f58a-4526-8208-725e0ce8fee5\', \'multiverseId\': 632023}, \'multiverseid\': 632023}]', '[{\'name\': \'Totentanz der Rattenfänger\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Totentanz der Rattenfänger oder eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\\n{1}{B}: Eine angreifende Ratte deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister, Barde\', \'flavor\': \'Unter den Ratten fand er die Akzeptanz, die ihm in der Welt der Menschen nie zuteilgeworden war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4f19fad-b41b-4086-bcd4-ef0f48e63c91\', \'multiverseId\': 629978}, \'multiverseid\': 629978}, {\'name\': \'Totentanz, flautista del enjambre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Totentanz, flautista del enjambre u otra criatura que no sea ficha que controlas muera, crea una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear".\\n{1}{B}: La Rata atacante objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bardo brujo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Las ratas le otorgaron la aceptación que el mundo de los humanos nunca le concedió.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07494f25-ac3c-4dbd-9570-c5c49158ed85\', \'multiverseId\': 630239}, \'multiverseid\': 630239}, {\'name\': \'Totentanz, joueur de flûte\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Totentanz, joueur de flûte ou qu\'une autre créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer ».\\n{1}{B} : Un rat attaquant ciblé que vous contrôlez acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et psychagogue et barde\', \'flavor\': "Chez les rats, il se sentit accepté comme il ne l\'avait jamais été par le monde humain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630500&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'affc90f6-c07e-4ab2-b052-ccda2214481d\', \'multiverseId\': 630500}, \'multiverseid\': 630500}, {\'name\': \'Totentanz, Pifferaio della Colonia\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Totentanz, Pifferaio della Colonia o un\\\'altra creatura non pedina che controlli muore, crea una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera con "Questa creatura non può bloccare".\\n{1}{B}: Un Ratto attaccante bersaglio che controlli ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Bardo Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': "Tra i ratti aveva trovato l\'approvazione che il mondo non gli aveva mai concesso.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13e87ed6-16a5-4041-93e4-82039c3f25e0\', \'multiverseId\': 630761}, \'multiverseid\': 630761}, {\'name\': \'大群の笛吹き、トーテンタンズ\', \'text\': \'大群の笛吹き、トーテンタンズや、あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{1}{B}：あなたがコントロールしていて攻撃しているネズミ１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・邪術師・バード\', \'flavor\': \'彼は、人間界で得られなかった支持をネズミたちから得た。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9293b281-d3ad-4158-bc46-6c1cadb6c002\', \'multiverseId\': 631022}, \'multiverseid\': 631022}, {\'name\': \'Totentanz, Flautista da Horda\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Totentanz, Flautista da Horda, ou outra criatura não ficha que você controla morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Rato preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear".\\n{1}{B}: O Rato atacante alvo que você controla ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Bruxo Bardo\', \'flavor\': \'Entre os ratos, ele encontrou a aceitação que o mundo humano jamais lhe dera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'814350a3-4a8f-4f2b-b256-21b910e1d05d\', \'multiverseId\': 631283}, \'multiverseid\': 631283}, {\'name\': \'鼠群笛手托腾坦\', \'text\': \'每当鼠群笛手托腾坦或另一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\\n{1}{B}：目标由你操控且进行攻击的老鼠获得死触异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／邪术师／诗人\', \'flavor\': \'他在老鼠群中，找到了人类世界从未给过他的归属感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'debcbde6-0c91-4e19-ba08-f10e05bf4a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 631544}, \'multiverseid\': 631544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Traumverderber\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du während des Zuges eines Gegners einen Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'Der Böse Schlummer rettete Eldraine vor den Klauen Phyrexias, statt jedoch nach der Invasion zu vergehen, griff er immer weiter um sich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629847&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9caebfb-4b63-4c41-a418-ecf101555c33\', \'multiverseId\': 629847}, \'multiverseid\': 629847}, {\'name\': \'Fastidiasueños\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo durante el turno de un oponente, hasta una criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo hada\', \'flavor\': \'El Sueño embrujado salvó a Eldraine de las garras de Pirexia, pero en vez de desaparecer cuando finalizó la invasión, siguió extendiéndose.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2107026-8838-40e4-99a7-e04017278a29\', \'multiverseId\': 630108}, \'multiverseid\': 630108}, {\'name\': \'Gâcheurs de rêve\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort pendant le tour d\'un adversaire, jusqu\'à une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': "Le Sommeil maléfique avait épargné Eldraine de l\'emprise de Phyrexia, mais au lieu de se dissiper après l\'invasion, il continua de se propager.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630369&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f64e5193-3898-4272-9921-c4a4f0227e22\', \'multiverseId\': 630369}, \'multiverseid\': 630369}, {\'name\': \'Rovinasogni\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia durante il turno di un avversario, fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Spiritello\', \'flavor\': "Il Sonno Stregato aveva salvato Eldraine dalla stretta di Phyrexia, ma invece di svanire al termine dell\'invasione, aveva continuato a diffondersi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'874ac1e4-57da-40f7-9d2d-2f23e8c7cab9\', \'multiverseId\': 630630}, \'multiverseid\': 630630}, {\'name\': \'夢ばれ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n対戦相手のターン中にあなたが呪文１つを唱えるたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'忌まわしき眠りは、ファイレクシアの掌握からエルドレインを守りはしたが、侵攻が終わった後も消えるどころか拡大し続けた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22263f6f-78ea-49e9-8710-f03887f8b77d\', \'multiverseId\': 630891}, \'multiverseid\': 630891}, {\'name\': \'Estraga-sonhos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica durante o turno de um oponente, até uma criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Bruxo\', \'flavor\': \'A Sonolência Maldita salvou Eldraine das garras de Phyrexia, mas, em vez de enfraquecer quando a invasão terminou, ela continuou a se alastrar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14850a5c-7a5d-482b-9582-adebc610ee39\', \'multiverseId\': 631152}, \'multiverseid\': 631152}, {\'name\': \'坏梦仙灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你在对手的回合中施放咒语时，至多一个目标由对手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 仙灵／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'沉睡咒令艾卓逃过非瑞克西亚的魔爪，但侵攻结束后，这一诅咒非但没有消退，反而愈发蔓延。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2d5d2af-b61d-4100-84a0-fb89c06f0014\', \'multiverseId\': 631413}, \'multiverseid\': 631413}]', '[{\'name\': \'Treuer Greif\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{2}{W}, opfere zwei Verzauberungen: Bringe den Treuen Greif aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Greif\', \'flavor\': \'Sie wich nur von der Seite ihres Meisters, um zu jagen. Sie würde ihn beschützen, bis er erwachte, wie lange das auch dauern möge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629773&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be50622f-1181-4e0e-bffc-b3aa1296480f\', \'multiverseId\': 629773}, \'multiverseid\': 629773}, {\'name\': \'Grifo obediente\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{2}{W}, sacrificar dos encantamientos: Regresa el Grifo obediente de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'Permanecía junto a su amo y solo salía para cazar. Lo protegería hasta que despertara, tardase el tiempo que tardase.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e583ef8d-8585-4d06-b9d5-e686fa7b15a2\', \'multiverseId\': 630034}, \'multiverseid\': 630034}, {\'name\': \'Griffon consciencieux\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{2}{W}, sacrifiez deux enchantements : Renvoyez le Griffon consciencieux depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature — griffon\', \'flavor\': "Il demeura aux côtés de son maître, le quittant juste pour partir chasser. Il veillerait sur lui jusqu\'à son réveil, quel qu\'en soit le temps nécessaire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630295&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d101bb55-320d-4e20-86b8-8eb6a690ce78\', \'multiverseId\': 630295}, \'multiverseid\': 630295}, {\'name\': \'Grifone Diligente\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{2}{W}, Sacrifica due incantesimi: Riprendi in mano il Grifone Diligente dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Grifone\', \'flavor\': \'Non lasciava mai il fianco del suo signore, allontanandosi solo per cacciare. Avrebbe vegliato sul suo sonno, fino al giorno del suo risveglio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c883d05-cbcc-4edb-8235-02c9588f81cd\', \'multiverseId\': 630556}, \'multiverseid\': 630556}, {\'name\': \'従順なグリフィン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{2}{W}, エンチャント２つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にある従順なグリフィンをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グリフィン\', \'flavor\': \'狩りに行くとき以外、彼女は主の傍を離れようとしなかった。たとえそれがどんなに長い眠りだったとしても、彼女は彼が目覚めるまで守り続ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd4968b-3432-44a5-92bb-8481995527ef\', \'multiverseId\': 630817}, \'multiverseid\': 630817}, {\'name\': \'Grifo Obediente\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{2}{W}, sacrifique dois encantamentos: Devolva Grifo Obediente de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'Ela ficou ao lado do mestre, saindo apenas para caçar. Ela o protegeria até ele acordar, não importava quanto tempo levasse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'439571b4-fff8-448d-b231-156c8c0f3a81\', \'multiverseId\': 631078}, \'multiverseid\': 631078}, {\'name\': \'守责狮鹫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{2}{W}，牺牲两个结界：将守责狮鹫从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 狮鹫\', \'flavor\': \'她一直留在主人身旁，只在猎食时才离开。她一直守护主人安危，不论他多久才醒来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2efd2633-b7d1-4f7a-a136-c143896f840e\', \'multiverseId\': 631339}, \'multiverseid\': 631339}]', '[{\'name\': \'Triumphale Rückkehr\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Erzeuge einen an sie angelegten Junger-Held-Rolle-Spielstein. (Die verzauberte Kreatur hat „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift und falls ihre Widerstandskraft 3 oder weniger ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie." Falls du später eine andere Rolle an die Kreatur anlegst, lege die alte Rolle auf den Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629788&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12d300d7-7518-47bc-adac-20a2609fde1e\', \'multiverseId\': 629788}, \'multiverseid\': 629788}, {\'name\': \'Regresar victorioso\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Crea una ficha de Papel de Héroe joven anexada a ella. (La criatura encantada tiene "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, si su resistencia es de 3 o menos, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella". Si pones otro Papel sobre la criatura más adelante, pon este en el cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dffc8791-3364-4cdf-a4a3-40554a331b30\', \'multiverseId\': 630049}, \'multiverseid\': 630049}, {\'name\': \'Retour triomphal\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3. Créez un jeton de rôle Jeune héros qui lui est attaché. (La créature enchantée a « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, si son endurance est inférieure ou égale à 3, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle ». Si vous mettez un autre rôle sur la créature plus tard, mettez-celui-ci au cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630310&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a3f7d44-0a7c-4de3-aee4-64d9af001376\', \'multiverseId\': 630310}, \'multiverseid\': 630310}, {\'name\': \'Ritorno Trionfante\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero. Crea una pedina Ruolo Giovane Eroe assegnata ad essa. (La creatura incantata ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, se la sua costituzione è pari o inferiore a 3, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa". Se in seguito metti un altro Ruolo su quella creatura, metti questo nel cimitero.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1cfbba8-f20b-47ef-9c52-f13d8b28d316\', \'multiverseId\': 630571}, \'multiverseid\': 630571}, {\'name\': \'勝利者の帰還\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。若き英雄・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。（エンチャントしているクリーチャーは、「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、これのタフネス３以下である場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。」を持つ。あなたが後でそのクリーチャーにこれでない役割をつけたなら、この役割を墓地に置く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd9e420a-2764-4691-9766-61370339cd15\', \'multiverseId\': 630832}, \'multiverseid\': 630832}, {\'name\': \'Retornar Triunfante\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card de criatura alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Crie uma ficha de Papel de Herói Jovem anexada a ele. (A criatura encantada tem "Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, se sua resistência for igual ou inferior a 3, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela". Se você colocar outro Papel na criatura posteriormente, coloque este no cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ff653b0-0c71-4b71-9b25-a0329c715b50\', \'multiverseId\': 631093}, \'multiverseid\': 631093}, {\'name\': \'得胜凯旋\', \'text\': \'将目标法术力值等于或小于3的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。派出一个青年英雄角色衍生物并贴附于其上。（所结附的生物具有「每当此生物攻击时，若它的防御力等于或小于3，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。」如果你稍后再将另一个角色置于该生物上，则将此角色置入坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0250da11-0511-4f96-96dc-17b485707c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 631354}, \'multiverseid\': 631354}]', '[{\'name\': \'Troyan, kühner Erkunder\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {G}{U}. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Zaubersprüche mit Manabetrag 5 oder mehr oder mit {X} in ihren Manakosten zu wirken.\\n{U}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vedalken, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Straßen Ravnicas waren erdrückend. Eldraine ist ein endloses Abenteuer voller goldener Gelegenheit."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dcaa948-f308-48b7-82b0-bb92d07bb0a9\', \'multiverseId\': 629979}, \'multiverseid\': 629979}, {\'name\': \'Troyan, explorador con agallas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G}{U}. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos con valor de maná de 5 o más o hechizos con {X} en sus costes de maná.\\n{U}, {T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Explorador vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"Las calles de Rávnica eran agobiantes. Eldraine es una aventura infinita pavimentada en oro".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e58f9c3-9dfc-46ec-a446-577e467f2a7f\', \'multiverseId\': 630240}, \'multiverseid\': 630240}, {\'name\': \'Troyan, courageux explorateur\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {G}{U}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 5 ou des sorts avec {X} dans leur coût de mana.\\n{U}, {T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — vedalken et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "« Les rues de Ravnica étaient étouffantes. Eldraine est une aventure sans fin pavée d\'or. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630501&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf07e55a-692d-476f-aedb-8d39bcbe73e0\', \'multiverseId\': 630501}, \'multiverseid\': 630501}, {\'name\': \'Troyan, Esploratore Ardito\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G}{U}. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie con valore di mana pari o superiore a 5 o magie con {X} nei loro costi di mana.\\n{U}, {T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Esploratore Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"Le strade di Ravnica erano soffocanti. Eldraine è un\\\'infinita avventura lastricata d\\\'oro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e022882a-39cd-44d5-8f8b-e5e2fd515f53\', \'multiverseId\': 630762}, \'multiverseid\': 630762}, {\'name\': \'度胸ある冒険者、トロヤン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{G}{U}を加える。このマナは、マナ総量が５以上である呪文や、マナ・コストに{X}を含む呪文を唱えるためにしか支払えない。\\n{U}, {T}：カード１枚を引く。その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「ラヴニカの街頭は息の詰まる思いだった。それに比べてエルドレインは黄金で敷かれた終わりなき冒険だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67effc09-5d8a-413a-95d4-c2a450c756fa\', \'multiverseId\': 631023}, \'multiverseid\': 631023}, {\'name\': \'Troyan, Explorador Destemido\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {G}{U}. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar mágicas com valor de mana igual ou superior a 5 ou mágicas com {X} no custo de mana.\\n{U}, {T}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vedalkeano Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"As ruas de Ravnica eram paralisantes. Eldraine é uma aventura sem fim, ladrilhada de ouro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'487c11d7-0d5d-4abe-8e69-dd52ff5245c4\', \'multiverseId\': 631284}, \'multiverseid\': 631284}, {\'name\': \'勇敢探索客特洛扬\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}{U}。此法术力只能用来施放法术力值等于或大于5或法术力费用中包括{X}的咒语。\\n{U}，{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 维多肯／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「拉尼卡的街道沉闷无趣。艾卓则是四处黄金的无尽冒险。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d11bd30-f2e6-4d63-98c9-100ed830991f\', \'multiverseId\': 631545}, \'multiverseid\': 631545}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tuinwald-Wegefinder\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nFeier — Der Tuinwald-Wegefinder erhält +1/+0 und hat Lebensverknüpfung, solange in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr bleibende Karten, die keine Länder sind, unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen sind.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Folge mir, müder Wanderer. Die Nacht ist ein Käfig und mein Licht ist der Schlüssel."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629798&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0097620-6a37-4c0f-a42b-0f1a3acf7653\', \'multiverseId\': 629798}, \'multiverseid\': 629798}, {\'name\': \'Guía del Valle de Tuin\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCelebración — El Guía del Valle de Tuin obtiene +1/+0 y tiene la habilidad de vínculo vital mientras dos o más permanentes que no sean tierra entraran al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador hada\', \'flavor\': \'"Agotado viajero, sígueme. La noche es una jaula y mi luz es la llave".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65b56dfc-b7fe-4c42-b1ec-3347d8eed1be\', \'multiverseId\': 630059}, \'multiverseid\': 630059}, {\'name\': \'Guide de Tuinval\', \'text\': "Vol\\nCélébration — La Guide de Tuinval gagne +1/+0 et a le lien de vie tant qu\'au moins deux permanents non-terrain sont arrivés sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': \'« Voyageur las, suis-moi. La nuit est une cage, et ma lumière en est la clé. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630320&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83973fb2-31d0-4301-8242-b4a617f7acf0\', \'multiverseId\': 630320}, \'multiverseid\': 630320}, {\'name\': \'Guida di Tuinvalle\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nCelebrazione — La Guida di Tuinvalle prende +1/+0 e ha legame vitale se due o più permanenti non terra sono entrati nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'"Stanco viaggiatore, segui la mia voce. La notte è una gabbia e la chiave è la mia luce."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e4a3627-f534-49df-b24a-7ad1615bb2a3\', \'multiverseId\': 630581}, \'multiverseid\': 630581}, {\'name\': \'チューインベイルの導き手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n祝祭 — このターンに土地でない２つ以上のパーマネントがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たことがあるなら、チューインベイルの導き手は＋１/＋０の修整を受け絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「疲れ果てた旅のお方、ついていらっしゃい。夜は檻、私の光はその鍵なのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94c0263-a43a-4da0-8b4c-0271d9b3e79a\', \'multiverseId\': 630842}, \'multiverseid\': 630842}, {\'name\': \'Guia do Vale Tuin\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nCelebração — Guia do Vale Tuin recebe +1/+0 e tem vínculo com a vida contanto que duas ou mais permanentes não de terreno tenham entrado no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"Viajante cansado, siga-me. A noite é uma jaula e minha luz é a chave."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dbc2811-6867-48a4-ab3c-39b45a2fd3a5\', \'multiverseId\': 631103}, \'multiverseid\': 631103}, {\'name\': \'图音谷向导\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n欢庆～只要本回合中有两个或更多非地永久物在你的操控下进战场，图音谷向导便得+1/+0且具有系命异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 仙灵／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「疲惫的旅人啊，快快随我来。若夜晚是加锁牢笼，我的灯光便是开锁之钥。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c8b273-7ed7-4186-9577-7f4618fddd74\', \'multiverseId\': 631364}, \'multiverseid\': 631364}]', '[{\'name\': \'Twining Twins // Spiralmanöver\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, Abwehr {1}\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir kreisen und kreisen, einfach nur um uns zu beschäftigen, aber irgendwie bist du derjenige, dem schwindlig wird."\', \'faceName\': \'Twining Twins\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a5d4696-b89d-49c8-af98-142f523bd3a0\', \'multiverseId\': 630002}, \'multiverseid\': 630002}, {\'name\': \'Twining Twins // Espiral rápida\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia, rebatir {1}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero hada\', \'flavor\': \'"Giramos y giramos para mantenernos ocupados, pero, por alguna razón, eres tú quien se marea".\', \'faceName\': \'Twining Twins\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70c57129-d12b-442c-af01-909930924103\', \'multiverseId\': 630263}, \'multiverseid\': 630263}, {\'name\': \'Twining Twins // Spirale expéditive\', \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance, parade {1}\', \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Nous tournons encore et encore pour nous amuser, mais c\'est vous qui avez le tournis. »", \'faceName\': \'Twining Twins\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e66e3389-e438-4d30-9dcb-ec6d2fac270e\', \'multiverseId\': 630524}, \'multiverseid\': 630524}, {\'name\': \'Twining Twins // Spirale Rapida\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela, egida {1}\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'"Altro non facciamo che girare, ma alla fine è la tua testa a girare."\', \'faceName\': \'Twining Twins\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10cd0aa2-2940-43c6-a365-5229498566a2\', \'multiverseId\': 630785}, \'multiverseid\': 630785}, {\'name\': \'Twining Twins // 敏（びん）捷（しょう）な螺（ら）旋（せん）\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、護法{1}\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「くるくるくるくる 僕らはつむぐ くるくるくるくる 君の目が回る。」\', \'faceName\': \'Twining Twins\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab1390e6-0b64-4b60-83ee-448c333582e0\', \'multiverseId\': 631046}, \'multiverseid\': 631046}, {\'name\': \'Twining Twins // Espiral Veloz\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância, salvaguarda {1}\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Giramos sem cessar por puro prazer, mas no final o tonto é você."\', \'faceName\': \'Twining Twins\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1617083a-74f0-4180-a91c-11e214b99784\', \'multiverseId\': 631307}, \'multiverseid\': 631307}, {\'name\': \'Twining Twins // 快速盘旋\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒，守护{1}\', \'type\': \'生物 — 仙灵／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们不断盘旋向上，好让自己闲不下来，但似乎只有你犯晕。」\', \'faceName\': \'Twining Twins\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'170ece1a-d434-4d95-945a-8a40461cea7d\', \'multiverseId\': 631568}, \'multiverseid\': 631568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Two-Headed Hunter // Doppelter Zorn\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich ziele, du schlägst zu!"\', \'faceName\': \'Two-Headed Hunter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629917&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f6d7122-6c2b-47c0-b354-8379afdf52ed\', \'multiverseId\': 629917}, \'multiverseid\': 629917}, {\'name\': \'Two-Headed Hunter // Rabia por dos\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Yo señalo, tú pegas!".\', \'faceName\': \'Two-Headed Hunter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b22ac2-be5a-4a73-b063-5f24c9231233\', \'multiverseId\': 630178}, \'multiverseid\': 630178}, {\'name\': \'Two-Headed Hunter // Double rage\', \'text\': \'Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\', \'type\': \'Créature — géant\', \'flavor\': \'« Je te fais signe, tu frappes ! »\', \'faceName\': \'Two-Headed Hunter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630439&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5721e472-ed65-41a4-b015-886d668908be\', \'multiverseId\': 630439}, \'multiverseid\': 630439}, {\'name\': \'Two-Headed Hunter // Doppia Rabbia\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"Io indico, tu colpisci!"\', \'faceName\': \'Two-Headed Hunter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4953644-9058-4e3e-bc57-e8648e3bec27\', \'multiverseId\': 630700}, \'multiverseid\': 630700}, {\'name\': \'Two-Headed Hunter // 倍（ばい）増（ぞう）する憤（ふん）怒（ぬ）\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「いいか？ 俺が指差すから、お前が叩け！」\', \'faceName\': \'Two-Headed Hunter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a62ed017-82c8-496f-b34b-d32ad313c53b\', \'multiverseId\': 630961}, \'multiverseid\': 630961}, {\'name\': \'Two-Headed Hunter // Raiva em Dobro\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu aponto, você senta o cacete!"\', \'faceName\': \'Two-Headed Hunter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94f52fc1-7998-4f4d-9b5f-c14355ebf816\', \'multiverseId\': 631222}, \'multiverseid\': 631222}, {\'name\': \'Two-Headed Hunter // 双倍怒火\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「我指，你挥！」\', \'faceName\': \'Two-Headed Hunter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b2fccbd-7ab0-4f93-ad8d-1322fd47f969\', \'multiverseId\': 631483}, \'multiverseid\': 631483}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unbändiges Katapult\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\n{T}: Das Unbändige Katapult fügt jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, enttappe das Unbändige Katapult.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Im Vorhinein dachte man, ein autonomes, selbstladendes Katapult wäre eine hervorragende Idee.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68f5bcad-7390-4daa-8dfd-6e0d25229a17\', \'multiverseId\': 629918}, \'multiverseid\': 629918}, {\'name\': \'Catapulta sin orden\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\n{T}: La Catapulta sin orden hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, endereza la Catapulta sin orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Una catapulta autónoma y autocargable parecía una gran idea.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b77f4267-1b3d-4612-b5b4-546970711805\', \'multiverseId\': 630179}, \'multiverseid\': 630179}, {\'name\': \'Catapulte indocile\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\n{T} : La Catapulte indocile inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, dégagez la Catapulte indocile.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — construction\', \'flavor\': \'Une catapulte à chargement autonome paraissait être une telle bonne idée au départ.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630440&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3731c16e-58e7-4bdd-bd0c-9adb0d06e653\', \'multiverseId\': 630440}, \'multiverseid\': 630440}, {\'name\': \'Catapulta Caotica\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\n{T}: La Catapulta Caotica infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, STAPpa la Catapulta Caotica.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Una catapulta autonoma e a caricamento automatico era sembrata una buona idea.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea564b0b-9eb7-4485-beda-43c7d2ed613d\', \'multiverseId\': 630701}, \'multiverseid\': 630701}, {\'name\': \'物騒なカタパルト\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n{T}：物騒なカタパルトは各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\nあなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるたび、物騒なカタパルトをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'自動装填式の自律型カタパルトは、構想段階では便利なもののように思えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65bfa3ae-3da6-4adc-9521-3a83147cb218\', \'multiverseId\': 630962}, \'multiverseid\': 630962}, {\'name\': \'Catapulta Incontrolável\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\n{T}: Catapulta Incontrolável causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, desvire Catapulta Incontrolável.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Uma catapulta autônoma autocarregante parecia uma boa ideia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5775d7b3-c3fb-4f89-92cc-a17668331d8b\', \'multiverseId\': 631223}, \'multiverseid\': 631223}, {\'name\': \'难驭投石车\', \'text\': \'守军\\n{T}：难驭投石车向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\\n每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，重置难驭投石车。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 — 组构体\', \'flavor\': \'投石车要是能自主瞄准、自动装填该有多棒～这事情还是想想就好。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88a170ed-e5f3-4643-a95b-754eea9f7275\', \'multiverseId\': 631484}, \'multiverseid\': 631484}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unheimliches Eingreifen\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Schaden, der dir und Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, in diesem Zug von Kreaturen zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ganze Reihen schlafender Ritter aus Ardenthal füllten Eriettes Thronsaal, stets bereit, ihre Hexenkönigin mit bedingungsloser Hingabe zu verteidigen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629774&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f6f425-3857-459f-ad4b-c50c3200427e\', \'multiverseId\': 629774}, \'multiverseid\': 629774}, {\'name\': \'Intromisión espeluznante\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño que las criaturas fueran a hacerte a ti y a las criaturas que controlas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Multitud de caballeros durmientes del Valle de Arden llenaron la sala del trono de Eriette, listos para defender a su reina bruja con devoción inconsciente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f7ed21d-583b-4c17-9100-581eb49dae6b\', \'multiverseId\': 630035}, \'multiverseid\': 630035}, {\'name\': \'Interférence inquiétante\', \'text\': \'Prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées à vous et aux créatures que vous contrôlez par des créatures ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les rangs de chevaliers d\'Ardenval endormis emplissaient la salle du trône d\'Eriette, prêts à défendre leur reine-sorcière avec une dévotion aveugle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630296&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b83cc339-ce89-4dab-b8ed-81b6dcf0352f\', \'multiverseId\': 630296}, \'multiverseid\': 630296}, {\'name\': \'Interferenza Inquietante\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto dalle creature a te e alle creature che controlli in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Orde di cavalieri dormienti di Ardenvalle accorsero alla sala del trono di Eriette, pronti a difendere la loro regina strega con cieca devozione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c9f5581-9583-41b6-a01f-fa1f916b8835\', \'multiverseId\': 630557}, \'multiverseid\': 630557}, {\'name\': \'不気味な干渉\', \'text\': \'このターン、クリーチャーからあなたやあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが受けるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'その無意識的信心で魔女王を守るため、アーデンベイルの眠れる騎士たちはエリエットの玉座の間に集結した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ea90bae-2043-4a52-ab4b-eabe9330d08a\', \'multiverseId\': 630818}, \'multiverseid\': 630818}, {\'name\': \'Interferência Misteriosa\', \'text\': \'Previna todo o dano que seria causado a você e às criaturas que você controla neste turno por criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Fileiras de cavaleiros dormentes do Vale Arden enchiam a sala do trono de Eriette, prontos para defender a rainha bruxa com devoção inconsciente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c48ad8a7-911b-4c3a-b433-276e08848199\', \'multiverseId\': 631079}, \'multiverseid\': 631079}, {\'name\': \'神秘干预\', \'text\': \'于本回合中，防止生物将对你和由你操控之生物造成的所有伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'雅登瓦迷睡骑士大军集聚艾纶缇所处正殿，准备以无谋衷心保卫巫后。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e08d81e-b184-40c7-9227-a1067c6de4e8\', \'multiverseId\': 631340}, \'multiverseid\': 631340}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unredlicher Treueschwur\', \'text\': \'Übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Enttappe sie. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nErzeuge einen Böse-Rolle-Spielstein, angelegt an bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. (Falls du bereits eine andere daran angelegte Rolle kontrollierst, lege die alte Rolle auf den Friedhof. Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1. Wenn diese Aura auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629916&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dee4721-c4b7-41f1-bf45-00e9fa5afb33\', \'multiverseId\': 629916}, \'multiverseid\': 629916}, {\'name\': \'Lealtad pérfida\', \'text\': \'Gana el control de la criatura objetivo hasta el final del turno. Endereza esa criatura. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\\nCrea una ficha de Papel de Malvado anexada a hasta una criatura objetivo. (Si controlas otro Papel sobre ella, pon ese en el cementerio. La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1. Cuando esta Aura vaya a un cementerio, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'851e1995-41df-4a1f-a590-158ed8c1724e\', \'multiverseId\': 630177}, \'multiverseid\': 630177}, {\'name\': \'Allégeance corrompue\', \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature. Elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nCréez un jeton de rôle Maléfique attaché à jusqu\'à une créature ciblée. (Si vous contrôlez un autre rôle sur elle, mettez-le au cimetière. La créature enchantée gagne +1/+1. Quand cette aura est mise dans un cimetière, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b1aac49-beff-4073-a830-e2592dc61259\', \'multiverseId\': 630438}, \'multiverseid\': 630438}, {\'name\': \'Fedeltà Distorta\', \'text\': "Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quella creatura. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\\nCrea una pedina Ruolo Perfido assegnata a fino a una creatura bersaglio. (Se controlli un altro Ruolo assegnato a quella creatura, metti quel Ruolo nel cimitero. La creatura incantata prende +1/+1. Quando quest\'Aura viene messa in un cimitero, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bae2f07-55c0-47eb-b803-b7149310f51b\', \'multiverseId\': 630699}, \'multiverseid\': 630699}, {\'name\': \'歪んだ忠義\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、その前者のコントロールを得る。その前者をアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、その前者は速攻を得る。\\nひねくれ者・役割・トークン１つをその後者についた状態で生成する。（あなたがコントロールしている役割がすでにそれについていたなら、その役割を墓地に置く。エンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。このオーラが墓地に置かれたとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4937c5de-21d0-448a-823c-7b1d40b64c18\', \'multiverseId\': 630960}, \'multiverseid\': 630960}, {\'name\': \'Fidelidade Distorcida\', \'text\': \'Ganhe o controle da criatura alvo até o final do turno. Desvire aquela criatura. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\\nCrie uma ficha de Papel de Malvado anexada a até uma criatura alvo. (Se você controlar outro Papel nela, coloque aquele no cemitério. A criatura encantada recebe +1/+1. Quando esta Aura é colocada em um cemitério, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48109575-1354-4165-b351-dd91f8317f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 631221}, \'multiverseid\': 631221}, {\'name\': \'扭曲忠贞\', \'text\': \'获得目标生物的操控权直到回合结束。重置该生物。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\\n派出一个恶人角色衍生物，并贴附在至多一个目标生物上。（如果其上已有另一个你操控的角色，则将已有之角色置入坟墓场。所结附的生物得+1/+1。当此灵气进入坟墓场时，每位对手各失去1点生命。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a82c8c3-a1c6-4415-afc0-590e9c5dec81\', \'multiverseId\': 631482}, \'multiverseid\': 631482}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unscheinbare Weise\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Unscheinbare Weise ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen an sie angelegten Magier-Rolle-Spielstein. (Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, wende Hellsicht 1 an.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Gesinde, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Erzmagierin Valya? Ich glaube den Namen habe ich schon einmal gehört."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629799&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e3feac6-b558-46cb-a8a0-7235c4a20749\', \'multiverseId\': 629799}, \'multiverseid\': 629799}, {\'name\': \'Sabia humilde\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Sabia humilde entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de Papel de Mago anexada a ella. (La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, adivina 1".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero plebeyo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿La archimaga Valya? Pues sí, creo que he oído hablar de ella".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57282c29-3d89-442f-a175-cc65d1af7288\', \'multiverseId\': 630060}, \'multiverseid\': 630060}, {\'name\': \'Sage discrète\', \'text\': \'Quand la Sage discrète arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de rôle Ensorceleur qui lui est attaché. (La créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, regard 1. »)\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et paysan et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« L\'archimage Valya ? Oui, je crois en avoir entendu parler. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630321&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec1a1b41-c25e-465d-af23-0a08199e3b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 630321}, \'multiverseid\': 630321}, {\'name\': \'Saggia Innocua\', \'text\': \'Quando la Saggia Innocua entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina Ruolo Stregone assegnata ad essa. (La creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, profetizza 1".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Popolano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'arcimaga Valya? Sì, credo di averne sentito parlare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1157736f-150b-49ea-af9e-7cae8fd5fef4\', \'multiverseId\': 630582}, \'multiverseid\': 630582}, {\'name\': \'謙虚な賢者\', \'text\': \'謙虚な賢者が戦場に出たとき、{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、魔術師・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。（エンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、占術１を行う。」を持つ。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・農民・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「大魔導師ヴァリヤだって？そりゃもちろん、知っているよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9a12dab-2453-4fb2-8792-0b187d27ec11\', \'multiverseId\': 630843}, \'multiverseid\': 630843}, {\'name\': \'Sábia Modesta\', \'text\': \'Quando Sábia Modesta entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de Papel de Feiticeiro anexada a ela. (A criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem "Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, use vidência 1".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Plebeu Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"A arquimaga Valya? Ah, sim! Acho que já ouvi falar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf08b527-cd96-4ff2-a243-8c87ad85f712\', \'multiverseId\': 631104}, \'multiverseid\': 631104}, {\'name\': \'低调智者\', \'text\': \'当低调智者进战场时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，则派出一个术士角色衍生物并贴附于其上。（所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有「每当此生物攻击时，占卜1。」）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／平民／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「大法师瓦尔娅？怎么，我确实听说过这么一个人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d57c5144-e549-482d-844d-f4357798c396\', \'multiverseId\': 631365}, \'multiverseid\': 631365}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unterhändler der Hochfeen\', \'text\': \'Feilschen (Du kannst ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder einen Spielstein opfern, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Unterhändler der Hochfeen ins Spiel kommt und falls um ihn gefeilscht wurde, verliert jeder Gegner 3 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629856&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6ee716a-e30d-4825-825c-e4cb1811dc76\', \'multiverseId\': 629856}, \'multiverseid\': 629856}, {\'name\': \'Gran hada negociadora\', \'text\': \'Negociar. (Puedes sacrificar un artefacto, encantamiento o ficha al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nVuela.\\nCuando la Gran hada negociadora entre al campo de batalla, si fue negociada, cada oponente pierde 3 vidas y tú ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd4ea22a-7fa7-4584-a41d-2322c567edb7\', \'multiverseId\': 630117}, \'multiverseid\': 630117}, {\'name\': \'Négociateur des Hauts Faes\', \'text\': "Négociation (Vous pouvez sacrifier un artefact, un enchantement ou un jeton au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nVol\\nQuand le Négociateur des Hauts Faes arrive sur le champ de bataille, s\'il a été négocié, chaque adversaire perd 3 points de vie et vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630378&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e3793ff-8b1a-42c5-8ec8-46a4cfa64198\', \'multiverseId\': 630378}, \'multiverseid\': 630378}, {\'name\': \'Negoziatore delle Alte Fate\', \'text\': \'Negoziare (Puoi sacrificare un artefatto, un incantesimo o una pedina mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nVolare\\nQuando il Negoziatore delle Alte Fate entra nel campo di battaglia, se è stato negoziato, ogni avversario perde 3 punti vita e tu guadagni 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Spiritello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56f13f09-0e4d-4507-9992-6a76ea74584a\', \'multiverseId\': 630639}, \'multiverseid\': 630639}, {\'name\': \'ハイフェイの交渉人\', \'text\': \'協約（この呪文を唱えるに際し、アーティファクトやエンチャントやトークンのうち１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。）\\n飛行\\nハイフェイの交渉人が戦場に出たとき、これが協約されていた場合、各対戦相手はそれぞれ３点のライフを失い、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fe08ca2-4c90-4fad-8efe-f07740ae2deb\', \'multiverseId\': 630900}, \'multiverseid\': 630900}, {\'name\': \'Negociador das Altas Fadinas\', \'text\': \'Negociar (Você pode sacrificar um artefato, um encantamento ou uma ficha conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nVoar\\nQuando Negociador das Altas Fadinas entra no campo de batalha, se ele tiver sido negociado, cada oponente perde 3 pontos de vida e você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97dba1e4-dca5-4a2c-8576-812c8ba9c108\', \'multiverseId\': 631161}, \'multiverseid\': 631161}, {\'name\': \'至高仙谈判员\', \'text\': \'加码（你施放此咒语时可以牺牲一个神器，结界或衍生物。）\\n飞行\\n当至高仙谈判员进战场时，若它已加码，则每位对手各失去3点生命且你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 仙灵／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01586c75-2bd3-45ef-967e-68713255091c\', \'multiverseId\': 631422}, \'multiverseid\': 631422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vantress Transmuter // Fluch des Quakens\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Befehle waren, dich lebend zu ergreifen. Sie haben aber nicht gesagt, in welcher Form."\', \'faceName\': \'Vantress Transmuter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629837&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0a6dd90-b2cb-46db-8ce7-c916bba60502\', \'multiverseId\': 629837}, \'multiverseid\': 629837}, {\'name\': \'Vantress Transmuter // Maldición croante\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mis órdenes eran capturarte con vida, pero no especificaban de qué forma".\', \'faceName\': \'Vantress Transmuter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6120d6bf-5a4f-4742-a895-fd383b1a9475\', \'multiverseId\': 630098}, \'multiverseid\': 630098}, {\'name\': \'Vantress Transmuter // Malédiction croassante\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'avais pour ordre de vous capturer vivant. On ne m\'a pas spécifié sous quelle forme. »", \'faceName\': \'Vantress Transmuter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630359&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b2f943-8ddf-465b-8f31-a19b4b8efb63\', \'multiverseId\': 630359}, \'multiverseid\': 630359}, {\'name\': \'Vantress Transmuter // Maledizione Gracidante\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho ricevuto l\\\'ordine di catturarti vivo. Non hanno specificato in quale forma."\', \'faceName\': \'Vantress Transmuter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e320d79-14a9-470e-bf8a-bd870ef200fb\', \'multiverseId\': 630620}, \'multiverseid\': 630620}, {\'name\': \'Vantress Transmuter // カエル声（ごえ）の呪（のろ）い\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「私は生きたまま捕まえろと命令されたまでだ。姿かたちの指示は受けていない。」\', \'faceName\': \'Vantress Transmuter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2493b570-768a-43df-adc7-5492c78ccc6a\', \'multiverseId\': 630881}, \'multiverseid\': 630881}, {\'name\': \'Vantress Transmuter // Maldição Coaxante\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Minhas ordens eram capturar você vivo. Não especificaram a forma."\', \'faceName\': \'Vantress Transmuter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71239413-79ec-41e2-b123-1404469b9eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 631142}, \'multiverseid\': 631142}, {\'name\': \'Vantress Transmuter // 呱叫诅咒\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我接到的命令是要抓活的。但却没规定怎样活。」\', \'faceName\': \'Vantress Transmuter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'558ce63b-fc86-4486-b886-e1bbb63e1640\', \'multiverseId\': 631403}, \'multiverseid\': 631403}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verfluchter Höfling\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nWenn der Verfluchte Höfling ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen an ihn angelegten Verflucht-Rolle-Spielstein. (Die verzauberte Kreatur ist 1/1.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'Es war das erste und letzte Mal, dass irgendjemand versuchte, bei den Hexen des Düstermoors Steuern einzutreiben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629771&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75c0811d-543c-4bbd-b260-bee0ffa47894\', \'multiverseId\': 629771}, \'multiverseid\': 629771}, {\'name\': \'Cortesano maldito\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nCuando el Cortesano maldito entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Papel de Maldito anexada a él. (La criatura encantada es 1/1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': \'Fue la primera y la última vez que alguien trató de recaudar impuestos de las brujas de Túmulo Pardo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83bd5103-e606-4ab7-8ee2-9402a28caf01\', \'multiverseId\': 630032}, \'multiverseid\': 630032}, {\'name\': \'Courtisan maudit\', \'text\': \'Lien de vie\\nQuand le Courtisan maudit arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de rôle Maudit qui lui est attaché. (La créature enchantée est 1/1.)\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et noble\', \'flavor\': "Ce fut la première et la dernière fois que quelqu\'un voulut faire payer un impôt aux ensorceleuses de Tertrebrun.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630293&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d92e3cfc-d0f3-4339-b37f-fe584590c0a3\', \'multiverseId\': 630293}, \'multiverseid\': 630293}, {\'name\': \'Cortigiano Maledetto\', \'text\': \'Legame vitale\\nQuando il Cortigiano Maledetto entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Ruolo Maledetto assegnata ad esso. (La creatura incantata è 1/1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Fu il primo e ultimo tentativo di riscuotere le tasse dalle streghe di Tumulo Grigio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a05a564f-a661-4bf1-b5c4-9b8e40d04bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 630554}, \'multiverseid\': 630554}, {\'name\': \'呪われし廷臣\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n呪われし廷臣が戦場に出たとき、呪われし者・役割・トークン１つをこれについた状態で生成する。（エンチャントしているクリーチャーは１/１である。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'ダンバロウの魔女に徴税を試みたのは、この者が最初で最後となった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dbbbee4-aa7b-49be-9b3d-1995b1ec2281\', \'multiverseId\': 630815}, \'multiverseid\': 630815}, {\'name\': \'Cortesão Amaldiçoado\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\\nQuando Cortesão Amaldiçoado entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Papel de Amaldiçoado anexada a ele. (A criatura encantada é 1/1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'Foi a primeira e última vez que alguém tentou cobrar impostos das bruxas de Tumbagris.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33eda0f5-a0f0-4cad-ac9e-f90fbe524279\', \'multiverseId\': 631076}, \'multiverseid\': 631076}, {\'name\': \'遭诅朝臣\', \'text\': \'系命\\n当遭诅朝臣进战场时，派出一个倒楣鬼角色衍生物并贴附于其上。（所结附的生物是1/1。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'这是第一次有人想要向黯沼野的女巫收税；也是最后一次。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1212e65e-8cff-4d8e-863f-ef9e91c07e6c\', \'multiverseId\': 631337}, \'multiverseid\': 631337}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vergnügte Barden\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Vergnügten Barden ins Spiel kommen, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Wenn du dies tust, erzeuge einen Junger-Held-Rolle-Spielstein, angelegt an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. (Falls du bereits eine andere daran angelegte Rolle kontrollierst, lege die alte Rolle auf den Friedhof. Die verzauberte Kreatur hat „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift und falls ihre Widerstandskraft 3 oder weniger ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Barde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fba0690-9c71-4d23-a361-d93cd3b9ea03\', \'multiverseId\': 629902}, \'multiverseid\': 629902}, {\'name\': \'Bardos alegres\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Bardos alegres entren al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {1}. Cuando lo hagas, crea una ficha de Papel de Héroe joven anexada a la criatura objetivo que controlas. (Si controlas otro Papel sobre ella, pon ese en el cementerio. La criatura encantada tiene "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, si su resistencia es de 3 o menos, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bardo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248ac68b-6b9c-4638-89ca-b3c7c4cd57ac\', \'multiverseId\': 630163}, \'multiverseid\': 630163}, {\'name\': \'Joyeux bardes\', \'text\': \'Quand les Joyeux bardes arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {1}. Quand vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de rôle Jeune héros attaché à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. (Si vous contrôlez un autre rôle sur elle, mettez-le au cimetière. La créature enchantée a « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, si son endurance est inférieure ou égale à 3, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle ».)\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et barde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630424&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1e72122-488d-49f9-98ba-7c2491136dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 630424}, \'multiverseid\': 630424}, {\'name\': \'Bardi Gioiosi\', \'text\': \'Quando i Bardi Gioiosi entrano nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {1}. Quando lo fai, crea una pedina Ruolo Giovane Eroe assegnata a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. (Se controlli un altro Ruolo assegnato a quella creatura, metti quel Ruolo nel cimitero. La creatura incantata ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, se la sua costituzione è pari o inferiore a 3, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bardo Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df03f7aa-4272-4d21-9cac-794391facf0b\', \'multiverseId\': 630685}, \'multiverseid\': 630685}, {\'name\': \'愉快な吟遊詩人\', \'text\': \'愉快な吟遊詩人が戦場に出たとき、{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。若き英雄・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。（あなたがコントロールしている役割がすでにそれについていたなら、その役割を墓地に置く。エンチャントしているクリーチャーは、「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、これのタフネスが３以下である場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。」を持つ。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・バード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ad8b28-9c4a-46ed-a470-9054974b470b\', \'multiverseId\': 630946}, \'multiverseid\': 630946}, {\'name\': \'Bardos Alegres\', \'text\': \'Quando Bardos Alegres entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar {1}. Quando fizer isso, crie uma ficha de Papel de Herói Jovem anexada à criatura alvo que você controla. (Se você controlar outro Papel nela, coloque aquele no cemitério. A criatura encantada tem "Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, se sua resistência for igual ou inferior a 3, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Bardo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'710af811-27bb-4c33-a56d-5c78d8f08a87\', \'multiverseId\': 631207}, \'multiverseid\': 631207}, {\'name\': \'快乐吟游诗人\', \'text\': \'当快乐吟游诗人进战场时，你可以支付{1}。当你如此作时，派出一个青年英雄角色衍生物，并贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。（如果其上已有另一个你操控的角色，则将已有之角色置入坟墓场。所结附的生物具有「每当此生物攻击时，若它的防御力等于或小于3，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。」）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／诗人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc2e43aa-6b55-44d3-a8a0-e8179f471c63\', \'multiverseId\': 631468}, \'multiverseid\': 631468}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verknotete Kolonie\', \'text\': \'Die Verknotete Kolonie kann nicht blocken.\\nWenn die Verknotete Kolonie stirbt, erzeuge X 1/1 schwarze Ratte-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken", wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Schadenspunkten ist, die ihr in diesem Zug zugefügt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte\', \'flavor\': \'Nach Speiseresten geifernd und vom Hunger in den Wahnsinn getrieben, verschmolzen die einzelnen Ratten zu einer einzigen, sich windenden Masse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629875&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab8f4b24-8c4f-41ea-88d3-f69bd22b5822\', \'multiverseId\': 629875}, \'multiverseid\': 629875}, {\'name\': \'Colonia enmarañada\', \'text\': \'La Colonia enmarañada no puede bloquear.\\nCuando la Colonia enmarañada muera, crea X fichas de criatura Rata negras 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear", donde X es la cantidad de daño que recibió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rata\', \'flavor\': \'Tras escarbar en busca de restos y enloquecidas por el hambre, las ratas se convirtieron en una masa retorcida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'465e0c41-5245-4588-9974-e2a3ab718c0d\', \'multiverseId\': 630136}, \'multiverseid\': 630136}, {\'name\': \'Colonie emmêlée\', \'text\': "La Colonie emmêlée ne peut pas bloquer.\\nQuand la Colonie emmêlée meurt, créez X jetons de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer », X étant la quantité de blessures qu\'elle a subies ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature — rat\', \'flavor\': "À force de se battre pour des miettes et rendus fous par la faim, les rats n\'étaient plus qu\'une masse grouillante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630397&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'779e8bee-1307-478f-a16f-f8e8b277db1d\', \'multiverseId\': 630397}, \'multiverseid\': 630397}, {\'name\': \'Colonia Aggrovigliata\', \'text\': \'La Colonia Aggrovigliata non può bloccare.\\nQuando la Colonia Aggrovigliata muore, crea X pedine creatura Ratto 1/1 nere con "Questa creatura non può bloccare", dove X è pari ai danni che le sono stati inflitti in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ratto\', \'flavor\': \'Lottando per gli scarti di cibo e resi pazzi dalla fame, i singoli ratti divennero una massa contorta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dd12160-1821-4b1e-8bc2-3b5183730237\', \'multiverseId\': 630658}, \'multiverseid\': 630658}, {\'name\': \'もつれる群体\', \'text\': \'もつれる群体ではブロックできない。\\nもつれる群体が死亡したとき、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはこのターンにこれが受けたダメージの合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ\', \'flavor\': \'食べかすを漁りながら、飢えによって発狂したネズミの個体は、次第にのたうつ集合体になった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6217d36-5ebb-47f4-a5fc-6f7de31d2f67\', \'multiverseId\': 630919}, \'multiverseid\': 630919}, {\'name\': \'Colônia Emaranhada\', \'text\': \'Colônia Emaranhada não pode bloquear.\\nQuando Colônia Emaranhada morrer, crie X fichas de criatura Rato preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear", sendo X a quantidade de dano causada a ela neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rato\', \'flavor\': \'Desesperados por restos e enlouquecidos de fome, os ratos se tornaram uma única massa pulsante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc46ab06-5e1f-4df1-b912-4463103ec49e\', \'multiverseId\': 631180}, \'multiverseid\': 631180}, {\'name\': \'纠结鼠群\', \'text\': \'纠结鼠群不能进行阻挡。\\n当纠结鼠群死去时，派出X个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡」，X为它本回合中受过的伤害数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 老鼠\', \'flavor\': \'因饥饿难耐而日趋疯狂的一只只老鼠，为争夺食物残渣而纠拧成群、集体出击。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bc82eed-1815-4395-8617-488cdba42ef4\', \'multiverseId\': 631441}, \'multiverseid\': 631441}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verknotete Kolonie\', \'text\': \'Die Verknotete Kolonie kann nicht blocken.\\nWenn die Verknotete Kolonie stirbt, erzeuge X 1/1 schwarze Ratte-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken", wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Schadenspunkten ist, die ihr in diesem Zug zugefügt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ced0d922-5300-475b-a05c-f83e79bd7ce2\', \'multiverseId\': 631877}, \'multiverseid\': 631877}, {\'name\': \'Colonie emmêlée\', \'text\': "La Colonie emmêlée ne peut pas bloquer.\\nQuand la Colonie emmêlée meurt, créez X jetons de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer », X étant la quantité de blessures qu\'elle a subies ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature — rat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631924&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32bf5649-4ee8-44dc-b160-21c515cabb41\', \'multiverseId\': 631924}, \'multiverseid\': 631924}, {\'name\': \'もつれる群体\', \'text\': \'もつれる群体ではブロックできない。\\nもつれる群体が死亡したとき、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはこのターンにこれが受けたダメージの合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eccf0282-820a-46c5-b7e2-086091601743\', \'multiverseId\': 631971}, \'multiverseid\': 631971}, {\'name\': \'纠结鼠群\', \'text\': \'纠结鼠群不能进行阻挡。\\n当纠结鼠群死去时，派出X个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡」，X为它本回合中受过的伤害数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 老鼠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc801552-15ee-4095-9c95-7db89f2c3517\', \'multiverseId\': 632018}, \'multiverseid\': 632018}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verkommene Kanalhexe\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Verkommene Kanalhexe ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken." Erzeuge dann für jede Ratte, die du kontrollierst, einen an sie angelegten Böse-Rolle-Spielstein. (Falls du bereits eine andere daran angelegte Rolle kontrollierst, lege die alte Rolle auf den Friedhof. Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1. Wenn diese Aura auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629876&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d4b6a6-9333-4e14-bcdf-4d8fdcd4dd38\', \'multiverseId\': 629876}, \'multiverseid\': 629876}, {\'name\': \'Bruja de las cloacas retorcida\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Bruja de las cloacas retorcida entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear". Luego, por cada Rata que controlas, crea una ficha de Papel de Malvado anexada a esa Rata. (Si controlas otro Papel sobre ella, pon ese en el cementerio. La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1. Cuando esta Aura vaya a un cementerio, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0be1c3f5-a9eb-43eb-bc5d-7023fc741de8\', \'multiverseId\': 630137}, \'multiverseid\': 630137}, {\'name\': \'Envoûteuse des égouts corrompue\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Envoûteuse des égouts corrompue arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. » Puis, pour chaque rat que vous contrôlez, créez un jeton de rôle Maléfique attaché à ce rat. (Si vous contrôlez un autre rôle sur lui, mettez-le au cimetière. La créature enchantée gagne +1/+1. Quand cette aura est mise dans un cimetière, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.)", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630398&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e65d323-f7cb-4a7d-81b0-d5aa1dc68814\', \'multiverseId\': 630398}, \'multiverseid\': 630398}, {\'name\': \'Strega delle Fogne Distorta\', \'text\': \'Quando la Strega delle Fogne Distorta entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera con "Questa creatura non può bloccare". Poi, per ogni Ratto che controlli, crea una pedina Ruolo Perfido assegnata a quel Ratto. (Se controlli un altro Ruolo assegnato a quella creatura, metti quel Ruolo nel cimitero. La creatura incantata prende +1/+1. Quando quest\\\'Aura viene messa in un cimitero, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d1c223-d25c-4bd3-af47-bd50db3aeac1\', \'multiverseId\': 630659}, \'multiverseid\': 630659}, {\'name\': \'ねじれた下水魔女\', \'text\': \'ねじれた下水魔女が戦場に出たとき、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。その後、あなたがコントロールしている各ネズミにつきそれぞれ、ひねくれ者・役割・トークン１つをそのネズミについた状態で生成する。（あなたがコントロールしている役割がすでにそれについていたなら、その役割を墓地に置く。エンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。このオーラが墓地に置かれたとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5df3331-95c4-4250-9eb4-7679203d8d38\', \'multiverseId\': 630920}, \'multiverseid\': 630920}, {\'name\': \'Bruxa do Esgoto Perversa\', \'text\': \'Quando Bruxa do Esgoto Perversa entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Rato preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear". Depois, para cada Rato que você controla, crie uma ficha de Papel de Malvado anexada àquele Rato. (Se você controlar outro Papel nela, coloque aquele no cemitério. A criatura encantada recebe +1/+1. Quando esta Aura é colocada em um cemitério, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e75e4b-812b-4274-9b71-a8095333ba2e\', \'multiverseId\': 631181}, \'multiverseid\': 631181}, {\'name\': \'扭曲水渠巫婆\', \'text\': \'当扭曲水渠巫婆进战场时，派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」然后为每个由你操控的老鼠各派出一个恶人角色衍生物并贴附在该老鼠上。（如果其上已有另一个你操控的角色，则将已有之角色置入坟墓场。所结附的生物得+1/+1。当此灵气进入坟墓场时，每位对手各失去1点生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bbb15f2-9e13-4833-bc02-40f422b5055a\', \'multiverseId\': 631442}, \'multiverseid\': 631442}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verratten\', \'text\': \'Bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du erzeugst einen 1/1 schwarze Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Halt das kurz für mich."\\n—Totentanz der Rattenfänger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629865&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4496472f-af59-4606-9b2a-302d5b0c17ef\', \'multiverseId\': 629865}, \'multiverseid\': 629865}, {\'name\': \'Echar al ratero\', \'text\': \'Hasta una criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno. Creas una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear".\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Guárdame esta".\\n—Totentanz, flautista del enjambre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60757165-6e10-4b10-916b-238513b942b9\', \'multiverseId\': 630126}, \'multiverseid\': 630126}, {\'name\': \'Lancer de rat\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à une créature ciblée gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. »", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Attrape ça ! »\\n—Totentanz, joueur de flûte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630387&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7614836-bf68-41dc-a189-d5482b556942\', \'multiverseId\': 630387}, \'multiverseid\': 630387}, {\'name\': \'Fare la Spia\', \'text\': \'Fino a una creatura bersaglio prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno. Crei una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera con "Questa creatura non può bloccare".\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Me lo tieni un attimo?"\\n—Totentanz, pifferaio della colonia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e08dc052-31d2-4fa7-ba8e-621be1ff1624\', \'multiverseId\': 630648}, \'multiverseid\': 630648}, {\'name\': \'密告\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ちょっとこれを持っててくれ。」\\n――大群の笛吹き、トーテンタンズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b6eb31-136d-4f8d-b67b-d224615d243f\', \'multiverseId\': 630909}, \'multiverseid\': 630909}, {\'name\': \'Ratar\', \'text\': \'Até uma criatura alvo recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno. Você cria uma ficha de criatura Rato preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear".\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Segura esse aqui pra mim."\\n— Totentanz, Flautista da Horda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76f851e9-fc36-494c-a3f1-98de752b56c2\', \'multiverseId\': 631170}, \'multiverseid\': 631170}, {\'name\': \'跳鼠突袭\', \'text\': \'至多一个目标生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。你派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「帮我拿一下这个。」\\n～鼠群笛手托腾坦\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50f1aed0-2a20-4c59-9b93-b4c0da3a0360\', \'multiverseId\': 631431}, \'multiverseid\': 631431}]', "[{'name': 'Vertreibung der Eindringlinge', 'text': 'Bestimme eine Zahl von 0 bis 10. Zerstöre jede Kreatur, deren Stärke größer oder gleich der bestimmten Zahl ist.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Ein Überfall der Blutkappen auf den Großen Ball der Auenschürfer zwang Goddric dazu, seine wahre Natur zu offenbaren und die Eindringlinge in Drachenfeuer zu baden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629775&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1afded3-f6eb-4008-8262-d9ce04b1b22f', 'multiverseId': 629775}, 'multiverseid': 629775}, {'name': 'Echar a los intrusos', 'text': 'Elige un número entre el 0 y el 10. Destruye todas las criaturas con una fuerza mayor o igual que el número elegido.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Cuando una incursión de gorros rojos amenazó el Gran Baile de Tierraprofunda, Goddric no tuvo más remedio que revelar su auténtica identidad y bañar a los invasores en fuegodragón.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630036&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c4c07b7-d48c-47d2-b55d-256591687dd6', 'multiverseId': 630036}, 'multiverseid': 630036}, {'name': 'Expulsez les intrus !', 'text': 'Choisissez un nombre entre 0 et 10. Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure ou égale au nombre choisi.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Lorsque les bonnets-rouges envahirent le Grand bal de Fouissehoc, Goddric dut révéler sa véritable identité et arroser les envahisseurs du feu des dragons.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630297&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e150d76a-0939-4874-99a9-7e859c927622', 'multiverseId': 630297}, 'multiverseid': 630297}, {'name': 'Espellere gli Intrusi', 'text': 'Scegli un numero compreso tra 0 e 10. Distruggi tutte le creature con forza pari o superiore al numero scelto.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Quando i berretti rossi assaltarono il Gran Ballo di Scavapiane, Goddric non ebbe altra scelta che rivelare la propria identità e avvolgere gli invasori nel fuoco draconico.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630558&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '732470eb-5f7a-44bc-9904-d38deb78d4ff', 'multiverseId': 630558}, 'multiverseid': 630558}, {'name': '侵入者の放逐', 'text': '０から10までの数１つを選ぶ。パワーがその選ばれた数以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'レッドキャップの強襲によってデルヴァーホウの大餐会が危機にさらされたとき、ゴドリックは不本意ながらその正体を明かして侵入者をドラゴンの火で焼くしかなかったのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630819&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ea46f89-0508-4942-abe0-c5edd8ce26a1', 'multiverseId': 630819}, 'multiverseid': 630819}, {'name': 'Expulsar os Intrusos', 'text': 'Escolha um número entre 0 e 10. Destrua todas as criaturas com poder igual ou superior ao número escolhido.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Quando uma incursão de barretes vermelhos ameaçou o Grande Baile em Terrafunda, Goddric não teve escolha, a não ser revelar sua verdadeira identidade e banhar os invasores com fogo dracônico.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631080&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c6d373d-0f51-493c-a45b-afd297336142', 'multiverseId': 631080}, 'multiverseid': 631080}, {'name': '驱逐来者', 'text': '选择一个0到10之间的数字。消灭所有力量等于或大于该数字的生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '就在深掘台外红帽客压境、堂皇舞宴行将夭折之际，戈垂克被迫亮明身份，喷出龙火将闯入者全数烧尽。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631341&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe64eb28-6eeb-4f10-a733-64726b9a15f2', 'multiverseId': 631341}, 'multiverseid': 631341}]", "[{'name': 'Vertreibung der Eindringlinge', 'text': 'Bestimme eine Zahl von 0 bis 10. Zerstöre jede Kreatur, deren Stärke größer oder gleich der bestimmten Zahl ist.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631802&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3737cfdc-202b-4695-83d4-21265e1fce07', 'multiverseId': 631802}, 'multiverseid': 631802}, {'name': 'Echar a los intrusos', 'text': 'Elige un número entre el 0 y el 10. Destruye todas las criaturas con una fuerza mayor o igual que el número elegido.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631803&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1c0c681-5bbc-40ff-a2ae-82f326b50143', 'multiverseId': 631803}, 'multiverseid': 631803}, {'name': 'Expulsez les intrus !', 'text': 'Choisissez un nombre entre 0 et 10. Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure ou égale au nombre choisi.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631804&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a568b996-c090-484e-83db-701392c6be5c', 'multiverseId': 631804}, 'multiverseid': 631804}, {'name': 'Espellere gli Intrusi', 'text': 'Scegli un numero compreso tra 0 e 10. Distruggi tutte le creature con forza pari o superiore al numero scelto.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631805&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95464842-0f2a-4ad8-9330-e2a666a5c592', 'multiverseId': 631805}, 'multiverseid': 631805}, {'name': '侵入者の放逐', 'text': '０から10までの数１つを選ぶ。パワーがその選ばれた数以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631806&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81c21069-1a74-4fce-b493-11a7a657f8f5', 'multiverseId': 631806}, 'multiverseid': 631806}, {'name': 'Expulsar os Intrusos', 'text': 'Escolha um número entre 0 e 10. Destrua todas as criaturas com poder igual ou superior ao número escolhido.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631807&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c672ecc-22ce-4590-a7af-362dd863743d', 'multiverseId': 631807}, 'multiverseid': 631807}, {'name': '驱逐来者', 'text': '选择一个0到10之间的数字。消灭所有力量等于或大于该数字的生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631808&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd29bc953-4034-4b41-a8bc-097f581d2602', 'multiverseId': 631808}, 'multiverseid': 631808}]", "[{'name': 'Vertreibung der Eindringlinge', 'text': 'Bestimme eine Zahl von 0 bis 10. Zerstöre jede Kreatur, deren Stärke größer oder gleich der bestimmten Zahl ist.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631857&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a089a440-d800-4e6e-8ab8-1e5ca77ed80d', 'multiverseId': 631857}, 'multiverseid': 631857}, {'name': 'Expulsez les intrus !', 'text': 'Choisissez un nombre entre 0 et 10. Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure ou égale au nombre choisi.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631904&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cfb611ad-fec9-41ce-8ec1-b8d5ea7322ee', 'multiverseId': 631904}, 'multiverseid': 631904}, {'name': '侵入者の放逐', 'text': '０から10までの数１つを選ぶ。パワーがその選ばれた数以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631951&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '752881c0-525b-4072-914c-879a2e602f4f', 'multiverseId': 631951}, 'multiverseid': 631951}, {'name': '驱逐来者', 'text': '选择一个0到10之间的数字。消灭所有力量等于或大于该数字的生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631998&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6e62a85-0d75-4b1a-b6a5-d78bb4fae682', 'multiverseId': 631998}, 'multiverseid': 631998}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verächtlicher Hieb\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 4 oder mehr.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Rückblickend war es vielleicht nicht die klügste Strategie, Sturmmagie gegen einen Sturmriesen einzusetzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629809&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbc28cc8-55b2-46e8-86bc-0897afb7cc64\', \'multiverseId\': 629809}, \'multiverseid\': 629809}, {\'name\': \'Golpe altanero\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo con valor de maná de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En retrospectiva, usar magia de tormenta contra un gigante de las tormentas no fue la estrategia más inteligente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1cc26c7-c509-434a-841d-18d6e11aa9bb\', \'multiverseId\': 630070}, \'multiverseid\': 630070}, {\'name\': \'Botte dédaigneuse\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 4 ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "En y repensant, utiliser la magie de l\'orage contre un géant des tempêtes n\'était pas la meilleure stratégie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630331&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'057df916-e351-47f6-b5a6-072edfd27d80\', \'multiverseId\': 630331}, \'multiverseid\': 630331}, {\'name\': \'Fendente Sdegnoso\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio con valore di mana pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Col senno di poi, usare fulmini magici contro un gigante delle tempeste non è stata la strategia migliore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fc60eb4-3069-45c5-9c6b-a84bdd8847b4\', \'multiverseId\': 630592}, \'multiverseid\': 630592}, {\'name\': \'軽蔑的な一撃\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が４以上である呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'後から思えば、ストーム・ジャイアントに対して嵐の魔法を使うのは得策ではなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc776473-8e79-46eb-a962-0e9eac6982a8\', \'multiverseId\': 630853}, \'multiverseid\': 630853}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Desdenhoso\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo com valor de mana igual ou superior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Pensando bem, usar magia da tempestade contra um gigante da tempestade não foi a mais sábia das estratégias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2f6865a-11b2-4507-8b0c-c9f69e3134d7\', \'multiverseId\': 631114}, \'multiverseid\': 631114}, {\'name\': \'倨傲击\', \'text\': \'反击目标法术力值等于或大于4的咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'回头来看，利用风暴魔法来对付风暴巨人并非最佳之选。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16445a03-b464-4022-8580-08a3e7fc75f6\', \'multiverseId\': 631375}, \'multiverseid\': 631375}]', '[{\'name\': \'Virtue of Courage // Funkenhort-Lodern\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Gegner Nicht-Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du entsprechend viele Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil schicken. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Courage\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629919&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d3f4ff-8511-43ee-bf73-e2b072e50bba\', \'multiverseId\': 629919}, \'multiverseid\': 629919}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Courage // Llamarada de Monteascua\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una fuente que controlas haga daño que no sea de combate a un oponente, puedes exiliar esa misma cantidad de cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esas cartas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Courage\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9c7fbc2-6612-4039-b137-61f6685b0c80\', \'multiverseId\': 630180}, \'multiverseid\': 630180}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Courage // Brasier de Braisereth\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une source que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures non-combat à un adversaire, vous pouvez exiler autant de cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer ces cartes ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Courage\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa66ec7e-1f97-41fe-b004-b4029825a026\', \'multiverseId\': 630441}, \'multiverseid\': 630441}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Courage // Fiammata di Bracerocca\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una fonte che controlli infligge danno non da combattimento a un avversario, puoi esiliare altrettante carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quelle carte in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Courage\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee95f6f1-6c61-4d6e-908a-7a4a242f1499\', \'multiverseId\': 630702}, \'multiverseid\': 630702}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Courage // エンバレスの猛（もう）火（か）\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている発生源１つが対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージでないダメージを与えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるその点数に等しい枚数のカードを追放してもよい。このターン、それらのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Courage\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab27b74e-edab-4495-bf1f-cc75df44aa1a\', \'multiverseId\': 630963}, \'multiverseid\': 630963}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Courage // Labareda de Brasoreth\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma fonte que você controla causa dano não de combate a um oponente, você pode exilar aquela quantidade de cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aqueles cards neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Courage\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea14fb1-bbab-4931-9be5-ae65e688b4a3\', \'multiverseId\': 631224}, \'multiverseid\': 631224}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Courage // 鞍博雷烈焰\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的来源向任一对手造成非战斗伤害时，你可以从你牌库顶放逐等量的牌。本回合中，你可以使用这些牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Courage\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e35dee7e-46fb-4b3e-bfd4-9eb7e1ee7f56\', \'multiverseId\': 631485}, \'multiverseid\': 631485}]', '[{\'name\': \'Virtue of Knowledge // Vantress-Visionen\', \'text\': \'Falls eine bleibende Karte ins Spiel kommt und dadurch bei einer bleibenden Karte, die du kontrollierst, eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit auslöst, wird die Fähigkeit ein weiteres Mal ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Knowledge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629838&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e8b483-7bb1-465b-8def-4e1d367bba6a\', \'multiverseId\': 629838}, \'multiverseid\': 629838}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Knowledge // Visiones de Vendaleza\', \'text\': \'Si un permanente que entra al campo de batalla hace que se dispare una habilidad disparada de un permanente que controlas, esa habilidad se dispara una vez más.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Knowledge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6769146-9a9d-4e0b-998d-f11856dddf62\', \'multiverseId\': 630099}, \'multiverseid\': 630099}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Knowledge // Visions de Vantress\', \'text\': "Si l\'arrivée sur le champ de bataille d\'un permanent provoque le déclenchement d\'une capacité déclenchée d\'un permanent que vous contrôlez, cette capacité se déclenche une fois de plus.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Knowledge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630360&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf99216-18ba-4a15-8fac-8e897d47c804\', \'multiverseId\': 630360}, \'multiverseid\': 630360}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Knowledge // Visioni di Vantressa\', \'text\': "Se un permanente che entra nel campo di battaglia fa innescare un\'abilità innescata di un permanente che controlli, quell\'abilità si innesca una volta in più.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Knowledge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ac56253-92bb-4f95-91c2-3cd1b5f47f6f\', \'multiverseId\': 630621}, \'multiverseid\': 630621}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Knowledge // ヴァントレスの幻（げん）視（し）\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つが戦場に出たことによりあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの誘発型能力１つが誘発するなら、その能力は追加でもう１回誘発する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Knowledge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b77bbe8-6f2d-4682-bdc1-264beed2481e\', \'multiverseId\': 630882}, \'multiverseid\': 630882}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Knowledge // Visões de Vantreza\', \'text\': \'Se a entrada de uma permanente no campo de batalha desencadear uma habilidade desencadeada de uma permanente que você controla, aquela habilidade será desencadeada uma vez adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Knowledge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'523d0006-5af5-40af-86c5-86d27b4bd168\', \'multiverseId\': 631143}, \'multiverseid\': 631143}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Knowledge // 凡翠丝视像\', \'text\': \'如果由你操控之永久物具有的触发式异能因永久物进战场而触发，则该异能额外触发一次。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Knowledge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3b0d381-248c-4b94-825a-3be3420a6a61\', \'multiverseId\': 631404}, \'multiverseid\': 631404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Virtue of Loyalty // Ardenthal-Treueschwur\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments legst du auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke. Enttappe jene Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Loyalty\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629800&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa10ef05-11f0-4e57-8f9f-a302808192e9\', \'multiverseId\': 629800}, \'multiverseid\': 629800}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Loyalty // Lealtad al Valle de Arden\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas. Endereza esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Loyalty\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d4b04d-4662-44d9-8593-f6b87d57cdf3\', \'multiverseId\': 630061}, \'multiverseid\': 630061}, {\'name\': "Virtue of Loyalty // Allégeance d\'Ardenval", \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez. Dégagez ces créatures.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Loyalty\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630322&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2c9eb5f-960b-48e7-8152-4c69680a0a44\', \'multiverseId\': 630322}, \'multiverseid\': 630322}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Loyalty // Fedeltà di Ardenvalle\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli. STAPpa quelle creature.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Loyalty\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdefc779-fd54-4c11-839e-27b1229422ac\', \'multiverseId\': 630583}, \'multiverseid\': 630583}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Loyalty // アーデンベイルの忠（ちゅう）義（ぎ）\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。それらのクリーチャーをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Loyalty\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df8ebd8-e8b3-461f-ac39-c061bbca359c\', \'multiverseId\': 630844}, \'multiverseid\': 630844}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Loyalty // Fidelidade do Vale Arden\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla. Desvire aquelas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Loyalty\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad48117e-ca74-426b-a942-748ac30bf32a\', \'multiverseId\': 631105}, \'multiverseid\': 631105}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Loyalty // 雅登瓦忠贞\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。重置这些生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Loyalty\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f267325d-aa5a-497b-8c1b-b9daa08f7274\', \'multiverseId\': 631366}, \'multiverseid\': 631366}]', '[{\'name\': \'Virtue of Persistence // Locthwain-Groll\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments bringst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Persistence\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc2ef338-cf00-432d-8cf0-5d002297de92\', \'multiverseId\': 629877}, \'multiverseid\': 629877}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Persistence // Desprecio de Nimboscuro\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Persistence\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'019568a0-04ad-4aee-87ea-63ed219dd870\', \'multiverseId\': 630138}, \'multiverseid\': 630138}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Persistence // Mépris selon Locthwain\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Persistence\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630399&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e29332a-1676-4470-a5e3-98641522d387\', \'multiverseId\': 630399}, \'multiverseid\': 630399}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Persistence // Sdegno di Loctevenna\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Persistence\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cad8c566-01b9-445b-b749-35005c004d91\', \'multiverseId\': 630660}, \'multiverseid\': 630660}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Persistence // ロークスワインの嘲（ちょう）笑（しょう）\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Persistence\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1053475-5baf-440b-bcfc-6050314e1359\', \'multiverseId\': 630921}, \'multiverseid\': 630921}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Persistence // Escárnio de Locthwain\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, coloque o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Persistence\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'522f15a3-77c2-422a-adae-82639b7e486d\', \'multiverseId\': 631182}, \'multiverseid\': 631182}, {\'name\': \'Virtue of Persistence // 洛司温蔑视\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Virtue of Persistence\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16043553-8fba-4b7d-9d2c-25a08d9325e3\', \'multiverseId\': 631443}, \'multiverseid\': 631443}]', "[{'name': 'Virtue of Strength // Garenbruck-Wachstum', 'text': 'Falls du ein Standardland für Mana tappst, erzeugt es stattdessen das Dreifache dieses Manas.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Virtue of Strength', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629959&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12a02fad-efe3-4cd3-b2c4-9b268c178c3e', 'multiverseId': 629959}, 'multiverseid': 629959}, {'name': 'Virtue of Strength // Crecimiento del Coto de Garen', 'text': 'Si giras una tierra básica para obtener maná, en vez de eso, produce el triple de ese maná.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Virtue of Strength', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630220&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '80e6d984-c186-4ddc-8b80-f08a71b33ae5', 'multiverseId': 630220}, 'multiverseid': 630220}, {'name': 'Virtue of Strength // Croissance de Garenbrig', 'text': 'Si vous engagez un terrain de base pour du mana, il produit trois fois autant de ce mana à la place.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Virtue of Strength', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630481&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42c12269-48fb-4d74-9689-9eb5e48d6b28', 'multiverseId': 630481}, 'multiverseid': 630481}, {'name': 'Virtue of Strength // Crescita di Garenponte', 'text': 'Se TAPpi una terra base per attingere mana, produce invece il triplo di quel mana.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Virtue of Strength', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630742&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1491c556-ef6f-453c-b1fb-c011b2ec5700', 'multiverseId': 630742}, 'multiverseid': 630742}, {'name': 'Virtue of Strength // ギャレンブリグの成（せい）長（ちょう）', 'text': 'あなたがマナを引き出す目的で基本土地をタップするなら、それは代わりにその３倍の点数のマナを生み出す。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Virtue of Strength', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631003&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca4bd0e3-20ef-469f-9223-616584fcf676', 'multiverseId': 631003}, 'multiverseid': 631003}, {'name': 'Virtue of Strength // Crescimento de Pontegaren', 'text': 'Se você vira um terreno básico para gerar mana, em vez disso, ele gera três vezes aquela quantidade de mana.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Virtue of Strength', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631264&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8df87a18-4ddc-4110-a3b8-ed8d365e67dd', 'multiverseId': 631264}, 'multiverseid': 631264}, {'name': 'Virtue of Strength // 盖伦碧新生', 'text': '如果你横置某基本地以产生法术力，则改为它产生三倍的该类法术力。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Virtue of Strength', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631525&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13a18af4-b335-419e-9911-bb70c6852508', 'multiverseId': 631525}, 'multiverseid': 631525}]", '[{\'name\': \'Vogelscheuchen-Wegefinder\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\n{1}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogelscheuche\', \'flavor\': \'„Du machst deine Sache wirklich hervorragend, mein edler, zusammengeflickter Freund. Kein einziger Vogel hat uns bisher angegriffen!"\\n—Troyan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a33c458-147f-4b8b-8c82-89579af73cdb\', \'multiverseId\': 630012}, \'multiverseid\': 630012}, {\'name\': \'Guía espantapájaros\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\n{1}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Activa esto solo una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Espantapájaros\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo estás haciendo fenomenal, mi noble amigo remendado. ¡No nos atacó ni un pájaro!".\\n—Troyan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68669adc-0c69-417f-b451-b8e5fdc2d4f1\', \'multiverseId\': 630273}, \'multiverseid\': 630273}, {\'name\': \'Guide épouvantail\', \'text\': "Portée\\n{1} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — épouvantail\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu fais un travail splendide, mon noble ami cousu. Aucun oiseau ne nous a attaqués ! »\\n—Troyan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630534&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9da675ca-c555-41f4-b65e-083642d79efe\', \'multiverseId\': 630534}, \'multiverseid\': 630534}, {\'name\': \'Spaventapasseri Guida\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\n{1}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Attiva solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Spaventapasseri\', \'flavor\': \'"Stai facendo un ottimo lavoro, mio nobile amico ricucito. Neanche un uccello ha osato attaccarci!"\\n—Troyan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'648e069d-9b66-4784-b8ec-bb162283bf86\', \'multiverseId\': 630795}, \'multiverseid\': 630795}, {\'name\': \'案山子の導き手\', \'text\': \'到達\\n{1}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。毎ターン１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — カカシ\', \'flavor\': \'「我が高貴なる継ぎ接ぎの友よ、本当によくやった。鳥が一匹たりとも襲って来なかった！」\\n――トロヤン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'485e0bdb-bdaa-41c2-873c-769cd45114bf\', \'multiverseId\': 631056}, \'multiverseid\': 631056}, {\'name\': \'Guia Espantalho\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\n{1}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor. Ative apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Espantalho\', \'flavor\': \'"Você está fazendo um trabalho esplêndido, meu nobre amigo costurado. Nem um pássaro sequer nos atacou!"\\n— Troyan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d0a6727-6940-454b-9b57-27d5c89606ed\', \'multiverseId\': 631317}, \'multiverseid\': 631317}, {\'name\': \'指路稻草人\', \'text\': \'延势\\n{1}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。每回合只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 — 稻草人\', \'flavor\': \'「好样的，我的缝组好友。到现在还没有鸟来咬过我们！」\\n～特洛扬\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52aaf0c2-e51e-40f4-8066-4c1ea5ed3704\', \'multiverseId\': 631578}, \'multiverseid\': 631578}]', '[{\'name\': \'Von Albträumen entführt\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Falls du eine Verzauberung kontrollierst, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Im Schlaf zu sterben, ist alles andere als friedlich, wenn Ashiok beteiligt ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629874&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ca1b1c-2320-4aa8-9368-011f31f05bec\', \'multiverseId\': 629874}, \'multiverseid\': 629874}, {\'name\': \'Secuestro de pesadilla\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Si controlas un encantamiento, adivina 2.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Morir mientras duermes dista mucho de una muerte tranquila si Ashiok tiene algo que ver.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4beaf5ea-195e-4215-9112-27b1827da7d8\', \'multiverseId\': 630135}, \'multiverseid\': 630135}, {\'name\': \'Pris par les cauchemars\', \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée. Si vous contrôlez un enchantement, regard 2.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Mourir dans son sommeil n\'est jamais paisible quand Ashiok est dans les parages.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630396&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2336ca62-2485-4c24-8b26-19338d53e45c\', \'multiverseId\': 630396}, \'multiverseid\': 630396}, {\'name\': \'Presa dagli Incubi\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Se controlli un incantesimo, profetizza 2.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Morire nel sonno non è mai pacifico se è coinvolto Ashiok.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55ab46f7-5fd9-404a-8fbc-23c7fa0074cd\', \'multiverseId\': 630657}, \'multiverseid\': 630657}, {\'name\': \'悪夢の支配\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。あなたがエンチャントをコントロールしているなら、占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'アショクが関わると、眠っている間の死は安らかなものではなくなるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc750678-7430-4b15-90f3-d1e089baafc6\', \'multiverseId\': 630918}, \'multiverseid\': 630918}, {\'name\': \'Tomada por Pesadelos\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. Se você controlar um encantamento, use vidência 2.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Morrer dormindo jamais é pacífico quando Ashiok está no meio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0f4e4e2-b1c7-4b8f-87ec-7a2143425f27\', \'multiverseId\': 631179}, \'multiverseid\': 631179}, {\'name\': \'梦魇掳掠\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物。如果你操控结界，则占卜2。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'只要安梭苛插手，就绝不可能在睡梦中安详逝去。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ba3caf7-d5ce-4b79-85a0-a02a5ae39f19\', \'multiverseId\': 631440}, \'multiverseid\': 631440}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wache der verlorenen Weisheit\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Wache der verlorenen Weisheit ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines oder mehrere —\\n• Bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl mit Abenteuer, die du besitzt und die sich im Exil befindet, auf deine Hand zurück.\\n• Lege eine Karte deiner Wahl mit Abenteuer, die du nicht besitzt und die sich im Exil befindet, unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\\n• Schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8aa9fae-4dd9-4d42-87f5-0f45e2196e8d\', \'multiverseId\': 629946}, \'multiverseid\': 629946}, {\'name\': \'Centinela del saber perdido\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Centinela del saber perdido entre al campo de batalla, elige uno o más:\\n• Regresa a tu mano la carta objetivo en el exilio de la cual eres propietario y que tiene una Aventura.\\n• Pon en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario la carta objetivo en el exilio de la cual no eres propietario y que tiene una Aventura.\\n• Exilia el cementerio del jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acfc1bd6-7c35-45ea-86be-0a04aedd92c3\', \'multiverseId\': 630207}, \'multiverseid\': 630207}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelle de la sapience perdue\', \'text\': "Quand la Sentinelle de la sapience perdue arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un ou plus —\\n• Renvoyez dans votre main une carte ciblée que vous possédez en exil qui a une aventure.\\n• Mettez une carte ciblée que vous ne possédez pas en exil qui a une aventure au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.\\n• Exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b8a900-17b2-430e-8cc9-da707384092f\', \'multiverseId\': 630468}, \'multiverseid\': 630468}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella della Tradizione Perduta\', \'text\': "Quando la Sentinella della Tradizione Perduta entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno o più —\\n• Riprendi in mano una carta bersaglio che possiedi in esilio che ha un\'Avventura.\\n• Metti una carta bersaglio che non possiedi in esilio che ha un\'Avventura in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\\n• Esilia il cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfc6c661-868f-49ca-8783-99d1aa9a186a\', \'multiverseId\': 630729}, \'multiverseid\': 630729}, {\'name\': \'失われし伝承の歩哨\', \'text\': \'失われし伝承の歩哨が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つ以上を選ぶ。\\n・追放領域にあり出来事を持ちあなたがオーナーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n・追放領域にあり出来事を持ちあなたがオーナーでないカード１枚を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\\n・プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e08bf42c-613f-4647-b699-840ed553d6d1\', \'multiverseId\': 630990}, \'multiverseid\': 630990}, {\'name\': \'Sentinela do Saber Perdido\', \'text\': \'Quando Sentinela do Saber Perdido entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um ou mais —\\n• Devolva para sua mão o card alvo com uma Aventura que você possui no exílio.\\n• Coloque no fundo do grimório de seu dono o card alvo com uma Aventura que você não possui no exílio.\\n• Exile o cemitério do jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efe100cf-4bff-4f50-a676-8d61414dc300\', \'multiverseId\': 631251}, \'multiverseid\': 631251}, {\'name\': \'佚闻哨卫\', \'text\': \'当佚闻哨卫进战场时，选择一项或多项～\\n•将目标在放逐区中由你拥有且具历险的牌移回你手上。\\n•将目标在放逐区中不由你拥有且具历险的牌置于其拥有者的牌库底。\\n•放逐目标牌手的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 妖精／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'311124ab-80ad-4ec4-998d-b96801a9e2ad\', \'multiverseId\': 631512}, \'multiverseid\': 631512}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wache der verlorenen Weisheit\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Wache der verlorenen Weisheit ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines oder mehrere —\\n• Bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl mit Abenteuer, die du besitzt und die sich im Exil befindet, auf deine Hand zurück.\\n• Lege eine Karte deiner Wahl mit Abenteuer, die du nicht besitzt und die sich im Exil befindet, unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\\n• Schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631891&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b27a6d50-d602-4eb5-830c-c87d69c82da5\', \'multiverseId\': 631891}, \'multiverseid\': 631891}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelle de la sapience perdue\', \'text\': "Quand la Sentinelle de la sapience perdue arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un ou plus —\\n• Renvoyez dans votre main une carte ciblée que vous possédez en exil qui a une aventure.\\n• Mettez une carte ciblée que vous ne possédez pas en exil qui a une aventure au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.\\n• Exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631938&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb073fd7-074a-46d2-afc2-4933211b8754\', \'multiverseId\': 631938}, \'multiverseid\': 631938}, {\'name\': \'失われし伝承の歩哨\', \'text\': \'失われし伝承の歩哨が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つ以上を選ぶ。\\n・追放領域にあり出来事を持ちあなたがオーナーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n・追放領域にあり出来事を持ちあなたがオーナーでないカード１枚を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\\n・プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66ab53a5-c546-4e0f-abbd-a6827dc34780\', \'multiverseId\': 631985}, \'multiverseid\': 631985}, {\'name\': \'佚闻哨卫\', \'text\': \'当佚闻哨卫进战场时，选择一项或多项～\\n•将目标在放逐区中由你拥有且具历险的牌移回你手上。\\n•将目标在放逐区中不由你拥有且具历险的牌置于其拥有者的牌库底。\\n•放逐目标牌手的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 妖精／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeb0eb21-b0b2-45f0-be59-b9759e8d1085\', \'multiverseId\': 632032}, \'multiverseid\': 632032}]', "[{'name': 'Wald', 'type': 'Standardland — Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631599&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47a83de3-823b-45d1-a9e4-1823e3516187', 'multiverseId': 631599}, 'multiverseid': 631599}, {'name': 'Bosque', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631604&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fd31425-1da2-488e-946b-0aefb7be9bf9', 'multiverseId': 631604}, 'multiverseid': 631604}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base — forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631609&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd15e78ec-fa14-44f0-9de3-260dd56eaec7', 'multiverseId': 631609}, 'multiverseid': 631609}, {'name': 'Foresta', 'type': 'Terra Base — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631614&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5932bb91-2e8d-4880-9a15-bef7bb219d67', 'multiverseId': 631614}, 'multiverseid': 631614}, {'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631619&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a654aac0-ea73-43b5-948a-51309d04a055', 'multiverseId': 631619}, 'multiverseid': 631619}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631624&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7bfa94ec-4dfb-48e8-86e6-1611b78f4317', 'multiverseId': 631624}, 'multiverseid': 631624}, {'name': '树林', 'type': '基本地 — 树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631629&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7a7a1cb-70d6-440f-80a8-eab0648db516', 'multiverseId': 631629}, 'multiverseid': 631629}]", "[{'name': 'Wald', 'type': 'Standardland — Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631648&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4caf823-5335-4443-98f7-57afff96b92b', 'multiverseId': 631648}, 'multiverseid': 631648}, {'name': 'Bosque', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631658&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '386fb949-0656-4c00-95d7-7b76963a6d06', 'multiverseId': 631658}, 'multiverseid': 631658}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base — forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631668&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd40c1194-b01a-4c3f-ab96-7356b3fa8cb4', 'multiverseId': 631668}, 'multiverseid': 631668}, {'name': 'Foresta', 'type': 'Terra Base — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631678&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e892a190-9357-4502-963d-13e8b7b78af4', 'multiverseId': 631678}, 'multiverseid': 631678}, {'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631688&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfeb0ab5-d74b-413f-8798-ed1d9ff635c6', 'multiverseId': 631688}, 'multiverseid': 631688}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631698&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c75c2d3-833a-474e-8b9b-613a1f5b1d59', 'multiverseId': 631698}, 'multiverseid': 631698}, {'name': '树林', 'type': '基本地 — 树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631708&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2292b4ed-9a6f-462d-b4ec-7c2cf9ec0d61', 'multiverseId': 631708}, 'multiverseid': 631708}]", "[{'name': 'Wald', 'type': 'Standardland — Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631649&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b4ba2b9-c579-4bf2-acf7-954d6afe795e', 'multiverseId': 631649}, 'multiverseid': 631649}, {'name': 'Bosque', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631659&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d9ce633-6585-4d1e-88c2-4f3d42744d99', 'multiverseId': 631659}, 'multiverseid': 631659}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base — forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631669&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '213acb8d-0eef-4c93-986a-87d9d0bca07a', 'multiverseId': 631669}, 'multiverseid': 631669}, {'name': 'Foresta', 'type': 'Terra Base — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631679&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64b902dc-8db4-4112-8a0a-19a4b3976257', 'multiverseId': 631679}, 'multiverseid': 631679}, {'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631689&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7010d2c1-d20c-46b7-9f5d-bf2981d8cf66', 'multiverseId': 631689}, 'multiverseid': 631689}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631699&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95a90bf0-175d-46da-b69d-c4b77c36cd16', 'multiverseId': 631699}, 'multiverseid': 631699}, {'name': '树林', 'type': '基本地 — 树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631709&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8aef1cf5-506a-499f-89b9-e988a7cd8d5f', 'multiverseId': 631709}, 'multiverseid': 631709}]", '[{\'name\': \'Waldläufer der Grenzlande\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Waldläufer\', \'flavor\': \'„Man weiß erst, wer hier wen jagt, wenn einer von uns tot ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629885&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81ed5e47-ecba-4f28-a35c-d4f841c888dd\', \'multiverseId\': 629885}, \'multiverseid\': 629885}, {\'name\': \'Arquero de las Tierras Fronterizas\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guardabosque humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo descubres quién cazaba a quién cuando uno de los dos acaba muerto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b7a7a57-c545-46f3-89cd-41a5432d4c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 630146}, \'multiverseid\': 630146}, {\'name\': \'Ranger des terres frontalières\', \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et ranger\', \'flavor\': "« Vous ne saurez qui chasse qui que lorsque l\'un d\'entre vous sera mort. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630407&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4381ee65-9f9f-4d1a-8b0b-78b230156638\', \'multiverseId\': 630407}, \'multiverseid\': 630407}, {\'name\': \'Ranger delle Lande Estreme\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ranger Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si scopre chi è la preda e chi il predatore solo quando uno dei due muore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aee771e1-8b95-41b9-b025-61e4ba3dc232\', \'multiverseId\': 630668}, \'multiverseid\': 630668}, {\'name\': \'境界地のレインジャー\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、カード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・レインジャー\', \'flavor\': \'「狩る側と狩られる側は片方が死ぬまで分からないものだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c5217db-ec44-4db5-a902-fce527acfe77\', \'multiverseId\': 630929}, \'multiverseid\': 630929}, {\'name\': \'Guardião das Terras Fronteiriças\', \'text\': \'No início do combate no seu turno, se você controla uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 4, você pode descartar um card. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guardião\', \'flavor\': \'"Você só descobre quem estava caçando quem quando um de vocês morre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd499ecf-3691-445b-b1a0-11f6687ccad0\', \'multiverseId\': 631190}, \'multiverseid\': 631190}, {\'name\': \'边境地巡林客\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／游侠\', \'flavor\': \'「只有其中一方倒下后，你才会知道谁是猎人，谁是猎物。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b71259e-43cf-4a0c-9cd1-279e813842a0\', \'multiverseId\': 631451}, \'multiverseid\': 631451}]', '[{\'name\': \'Warenlager-Tigerkatze\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Verzauberung, die du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\\n{1}{B}: Die Warenlager-Tigerkatze erhält Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'Für jede Ratte, die sie erlegt, tauchen zehn neue auf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629879&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'828adfc8-7bfa-4d5d-a4d6-06d4322e48cd\', \'multiverseId\': 629879}, \'multiverseid\': 629879}, {\'name\': \'Gata atigrada del almacén\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un encantamiento que controlas vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear".\\n{1}{B}: La Gata atigrada del almacén gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Por cada rata que mata, diez más ocupan su lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d140d8be-8c74-45f0-a0a4-dd971d5c5522\', \'multiverseId\': 630140}, \'multiverseid\': 630140}, {\'name\': "Chat de gouttière d\'entrepôt", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. »\\n{1}{B} : Le Chat de gouttière d\'entrepôt acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — chat\', \'flavor\': "Pour chaque rat qu\'il tue, il en surgit dix autres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630401&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1865f3b1-c890-4025-9cdb-64abd7172183\', \'multiverseId\': 630401}, \'multiverseid\': 630401}, {\'name\': \'Soriana del Deposito\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo che controlli viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera con "Questa creatura non può bloccare".\\n{1}{B}: La Soriana del Deposito ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Per ogni ratto che uccide, altri dieci ne prendono il posto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2311125a-ff1f-4f5c-ad7f-0a3405cf44fa\', \'multiverseId\': 630662}, \'multiverseid\': 630662}, {\'name\': \'倉庫の虎猫\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているエンチャント１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{1}{B}：ターン終了時まで、倉庫の虎猫は接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'彼女がネズミを一匹殺すたびに、ネズミが十匹増えるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3e797c3-9feb-45a6-84f8-308a8cd1c75f\', \'multiverseId\': 630923}, \'multiverseid\': 630923}, {\'name\': \'Gata Tigrada do Armazém\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um encantamento que você controla for colocado em um cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Rato preta 1/1 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear".\\n{1}{B}: Gata Tigrada do Armazém ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Para cada rato que ela mata, aparecem mais dez.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88236949-1c59-4759-8328-3758ebf583a7\', \'multiverseId\': 631184}, \'multiverseid\': 631184}, {\'name\': \'仓库斑猫\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的结界从战场进入坟墓场时，派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\\n{1}{B}：仓库斑猫获得死触异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'她每捕杀一只老鼠，就有十只冒出来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'968341c0-98c2-4837-a3cb-019ac971be89\', \'multiverseId\': 631445}, \'multiverseid\': 631445}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weiler-Gierschlund\', \'text\': \'Feilschen (Du kannst ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder einen Spielstein opfern, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nDieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger, falls um ihn gefeilscht wurde.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Weiler-Gierschlund ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629935&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce613b60-52b8-4d74-8675-6aece3dc3046\', \'multiverseId\': 629935}, \'multiverseid\': 629935}, {\'name\': \'Glotón del pueblo\', \'text\': \'Negociar. (Puedes sacrificar un artefacto, encantamiento o ficha al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nTe cuesta {2} menos lanzar este hechizo si es negociado.\\nArrolla.\\nCuando el Glotón del pueblo entre al campo de batalla, ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae72a60c-8882-4da4-bda1-cbf7a0937628\', \'multiverseId\': 630196}, \'multiverseid\': 630196}, {\'name\': \'Glouton de hameau\', \'text\': "Négociation (Vous pouvez sacrifier un artefact, un enchantement ou un jeton au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nCe sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer s\'il est négocié.\\nPiétinement\\nQuand le Glouton de hameau arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — géant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630457&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53918f3d-b191-4191-a443-f0fe45346cb9\', \'multiverseId\': 630457}, \'multiverseid\': 630457}, {\'name\': \'Ingordo del Borgo\', \'text\': "Negoziare (Puoi sacrificare un artefatto, un incantesimo o una pedina mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nQuesta magia costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata se è stata negoziata.\\nTravolgere\\nQuando l\'Ingordo del Borgo entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'399f7dbd-317d-4694-a138-2320fb3b374d\', \'multiverseId\': 630718}, \'multiverseid\': 630718}, {\'name\': \'小村の大食い\', \'text\': \'協約（この呪文を唱えるに際し、アーティファクトやエンチャントやトークンのうち１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。）\\nこれが協約されていたなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\nトランプル\\n小村の大食いが戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afc493e4-f2d0-475d-ad79-dc6126a4d8f0\', \'multiverseId\': 630979}, \'multiverseid\': 630979}, {\'name\': \'Glutão do Vilarejo\', \'text\': \'Negociar (Você pode sacrificar um artefato, um encantamento ou uma ficha conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nEsta mágica custa {2} a menos para conjurar se tiver sido negociada.\\nAtropelar\\nQuando Glutão do Vilarejo entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'479c5224-50de-4d4d-9d23-0d7e53633276\', \'multiverseId\': 631240}, \'multiverseid\': 631240}, {\'name\': \'噬屋饕客\', \'text\': \'加码（你施放此咒语时可以牺牲一个神器，结界或衍生物。）\\n如果此咒语已加码，则它减少{2}来施放。\\n践踏\\n当噬屋饕客进战场时，你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccdf5900-018e-43bd-8d61-07dbd65dd4b1\', \'multiverseId\': 631501}, \'multiverseid\': 631501}]', '[{\'name\': \'Werfuchs-Leibwächterin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Werfuchs-Leibwächterin ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu eine andere Nicht-Fuchs-Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil, bis die Werfuchs-Leibwächterin das Spiel verlässt.\\n{1}{W}, opfere die Werfuchs-Leibwächterin: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Fuchs, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629801&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fed05ea-bfdc-47c4-94b4-bf6ff342860b\', \'multiverseId\': 629801}, \'multiverseid\': 629801}, {\'name\': \'Protectora vulpina\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Protectora vulpina entre al campo de batalla, exilia hasta una otra criatura objetivo que no sea Zorro hasta que la Protectora vulpina deje el campo de batalla.\\n{1}{W}, sacrificar la Protectora vulpina: Ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero zorro elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6028337-4cda-4e3a-bcef-2c8d08c3923e\', \'multiverseId\': 630062}, \'multiverseid\': 630062}, {\'name\': \'Garde du corps renard-garou\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand le Garde du corps renard-garou arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à une autre créature non-Renard ciblée jusqu\'à ce que le Garde du corps renard-garou quitte le champ de bataille.\\n{1}{W}, sacrifiez le Garde du corps renard-garou : Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et renard et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630323&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46227fd4-f08b-4734-90fc-62d6c5f30354\', \'multiverseId\': 630323}, \'multiverseid\': 630323}, {\'name\': \'Volpe Mannara Guardia del Corpo\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuando la Volpe Mannara Guardia del Corpo entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia fino a un\'altra creatura non Volpe bersaglio finché la Volpe Mannara Guardia del Corpo non lascia il campo di battaglia.\\n{1}{W}, Sacrifica la Volpe Mannara Guardia del Corpo: Guadagni 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Volpe Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f456e86-d352-40f2-a685-7581a4270611\', \'multiverseId\': 630584}, \'multiverseid\': 630584}, {\'name\': \'人狐のボディガード\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n人狐のボディガードが戦場に出たとき、狐でもこれでもないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。人狐のボディガードが戦場を離れるまで、それを追放する。\\n{1}{W}, 人狐のボディガードを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・狐・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac5548b9-3efd-42a6-8aae-8f3c9e2df84e\', \'multiverseId\': 630845}, \'multiverseid\': 630845}, {\'name\': \'Guarda-costas Mulher-raposa\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Guarda-costas Mulher-raposa entrar no campo de batalha, exile até uma outra criatura alvo não Raposa até que Guarda-costas Mulher-raposa deixe o campo de batalha.\\n{1}{W}, sacrifique Guarda-costas Mulher-raposa: Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Raposa Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35f454c7-e513-41b0-9eac-c7bfb322f74b\', \'multiverseId\': 631106}, \'multiverseid\': 631106}, {\'name\': \'半狐保镖\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当半狐保镖进战场时，放逐至多另一个目标非狐生物，直到半狐保镖离开战场为止。\\n{1}{W}，牺牲半狐保镖：你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 妖精／狐／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c99c6414-a201-40ce-b333-42b8d3a23ea0\', \'multiverseId\': 631367}, \'multiverseid\': 631367}]', '[{\'name\': \'Werfuchs-Leibwächterin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Werfuchs-Leibwächterin ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu eine andere Nicht-Fuchs-Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil, bis die Werfuchs-Leibwächterin das Spiel verlässt.\\n{1}{W}, opfere die Werfuchs-Leibwächterin: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Fuchs, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631862&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2225b7ec-556b-43ed-b0dc-efd810824139\', \'multiverseId\': 631862}, \'multiverseid\': 631862}, {\'name\': \'Garde du corps renard-garou\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand le Garde du corps renard-garou arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à une autre créature non-Renard ciblée jusqu\'à ce que le Garde du corps renard-garou quitte le champ de bataille.\\n{1}{W}, sacrifiez le Garde du corps renard-garou : Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et renard et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b35e2f2-a5e5-4549-ad44-bed52611a27b\', \'multiverseId\': 631909}, \'multiverseid\': 631909}, {\'name\': \'人狐のボディガード\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n人狐のボディガードが戦場に出たとき、狐でもこれでもないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。人狐のボディガードが戦場を離れるまで、それを追放する。\\n{1}{W}, 人狐のボディガードを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・狐・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67dda83c-cd56-4130-ba61-8cd6347046b9\', \'multiverseId\': 631956}, \'multiverseid\': 631956}, {\'name\': \'半狐保镖\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当半狐保镖进战场时，放逐至多另一个目标非狐生物，直到半狐保镖离开战场为止。\\n{1}{W}，牺牲半狐保镖：你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 妖精／狐／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d2bcd4b-fd3f-4f4d-be04-8c31a94a4104\', \'multiverseId\': 632003}, \'multiverseid\': 632003}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wildholz-Mentor\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spielstein unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Wildholz-Mentor.\\nImmer wenn der Wildholz-Mentor angreift, erhält eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Stärke des Wildholz-Mentors ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': \'„Nicht übel. Nur Zweige bräuchtest du noch."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de8bf2e3-c04a-4270-86f0-ae40e3cc150b\', \'multiverseId\': 632098}, \'multiverseid\': 632098}, {\'name\': \'Mentor del bosque salvaje\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Mentor del bosque salvaje.\\nSiempre que el Mentor del bosque salvaje ataque, otra criatura atacante objetivo obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la fuerza del Mentor del bosque salvaje.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': \'"No está mal. Qué lástima que no tengas ramas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b419fabb-f4d2-4b89-8c17-978824abbbc3\', \'multiverseId\': 632113}, \'multiverseid\': 632113}, {\'name\': \'Mentor de bois sauvage\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Mentor de bois sauvage.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Mentor de bois sauvage attaque, une autre créature attaquante ciblée gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la force du Mentor de bois sauvage.", \'type\': \'Créature — sylvin\', \'flavor\': \'« Pas mal. Ah, si seulement tu avais des branches. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632128&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0acf43eb-d4c9-4864-9780-6ed5e51eb481\', \'multiverseId\': 632128}, \'multiverseid\': 632128}, {\'name\': \'Mentore di Bosco Selvaggio\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Mentore di Bosco Selvaggio.\\nOgniqualvolta il Mentore di Bosco Selvaggio attacca, un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è la forza del Mentore di Bosco Selvaggio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non male. Se solo avessi i rami."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38b71ab2-2fa8-4242-98c1-6443bbceccdd\', \'multiverseId\': 632143}, \'multiverseid\': 632143}, {\'name\': \'僻森の師\', \'text\': \'トークン１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、僻森の師の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n僻森の師が攻撃するたび、これでない攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘは僻森の師のパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': \'「なかなか悪くない。おぬしに枝が生えてればよかったのだが。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc078072-2a4d-44f8-bb11-e24e0ad89a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 632158}, \'multiverseid\': 632158}, {\'name\': \'Mentor da Mata Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma ficha entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Mentor da Mata Selvagem.\\nToda vez que Mentor da Mata Selvagem ataca, outra criatura atacante alvo recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X o poder de Mentor da Mata Selvagem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ent\', \'flavor\': \'"Nada mau. Imagina se você tivesse galhos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'078d27b9-8105-415a-b753-853e554dc4ff\', \'multiverseId\': 632173}, \'multiverseid\': 632173}, {\'name\': \'野林导师\', \'text\': \'每当一个衍生物在你的操控下进战场时，在野林导师上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当野林导师攻击时，另一个目标进行攻击的生物得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为野林导师的力量。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 树妖\', \'flavor\': \'「不错。你要能长出枝桠来就更好了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd237e7e-f264-4a0a-9919-ca4936393264\', \'multiverseId\': 632188}, \'multiverseid\': 632188}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wildholz-Mentor\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spielstein unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Wildholz-Mentor.\\nImmer wenn der Wildholz-Mentor angreift, erhält eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Stärke des Wildholz-Mentors ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632053&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a546e3d-f430-4b62-a8ee-f2371f0b203a\', \'multiverseId\': 632053}, \'multiverseid\': 632053}, {\'name\': \'Mentor de bois sauvage\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Mentor de bois sauvage.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Mentor de bois sauvage attaque, une autre créature attaquante ciblée gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la force du Mentor de bois sauvage.", \'type\': \'Créature — sylvin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632058&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64b47bdf-ff18-4ad3-a2be-38614aac8ca8\', \'multiverseId\': 632058}, \'multiverseid\': 632058}, {\'name\': \'僻森の師\', \'text\': \'トークン１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、僻森の師の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n僻森の師が攻撃するたび、これでない攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘは僻森の師のパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e35d33c7-fed5-46a8-bcea-b328097e47d6\', \'multiverseId\': 632063}, \'multiverseid\': 632063}, {\'name\': \'野林导师\', \'text\': \'每当一个衍生物在你的操控下进战场时，在野林导师上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当野林导师攻击时，另一个目标进行攻击的生物得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为野林导师的力量。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 树妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a222e774-4ad8-4285-afff-1e270b25c66f\', \'multiverseId\': 632068}, \'multiverseid\': 632068}]', '[{\'name\': \'Will, Kind des Friedens\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{T}: Zaubersprüche, die du in diesem Zug wirkst und die weiß und/oder blau sind, kosten beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist so einfach ‚Für den Ruhm!\\\' zu brüllen und sich auf jeden zu stürzen, der anderer Meinung ist. Aber es erfordert Fingerspitzengefühl, um Feinde zu Verbündeten und nicht zu Leichen zu machen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62d1c37a-e670-4ee5-97db-47756d459eab\', \'multiverseId\': 629980}, \'multiverseid\': 629980}, {\'name\': \'Will, hijo de la paz\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\n{T}: Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar hechizos que sean blancos y/o azules este turno, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Gritar \\\'¡Por la gloria!\\\' y cargar contra los que disienten es muy fácil, pero para convertir a los enemigos en aliados en vez de en cadáveres hace falta destreza".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d019fc16-eb55-47ca-bd4c-705d1b9814cc\', \'multiverseId\': 630241}, \'multiverseid\': 630241}, {\'name\': \'Will, scion de la paix\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\n{T} : Les sorts que vous lancez ce tour-ci qui sont blancs et/ou bleus coûtent {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés ce tour-ci. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Il est facile de crier \'Pour la gloire !\' et de charger ceux qui ne partagent pas votre avis. Mais il faut de la finesse pour faire de ses ennemis des alliés plutôt que des cadavres. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630502&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a00f50c1-dd59-4d43-85c8-7b0e2280c070\', \'multiverseId\': 630502}, \'multiverseid\': 630502}, {\'name\': \'Will, Erede della Pace\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\n{T}: Le magie che lanci in questo turno e che sono bianche e/o blu costano {X} in meno per essere lanciate, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"È facile urlare \\\'Per la gloria!\\\' e attaccare chi ha un\\\'opinione diversa dalla tua. Ma ci vuole sagacia per trasformare i nemici in alleati invece che in cadaveri."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d33286-dfeb-443b-a9dc-93b1d4ac459a\', \'multiverseId\': 630763}, \'multiverseid\': 630763}, {\'name\': \'平和の世継ぎ、ウィル\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{T}：このターン、あなたが白や青である呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘは、このターンにあなたが得たライフの合計に等しい。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「『栄光のために！』と高らかに謳い、敵対するものを襲撃するのは簡単だけど、敵を死体でなく味方に変えるためには技量が必要なんだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1515dd22-2a1f-4a28-b75b-635ac46ea802\', \'multiverseId\': 631024}, \'multiverseid\': 631024}, {\'name\': \'Will, Herdeiro da Paz\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\n{T}: As mágicas que você conjura neste turno brancas e/ou azuis custam {X} a menos para conjurar, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"É fácil bradar \\\'Pela glória!\\\' e avançar contra quem discorda de você. Mas é preciso sofisticação para transformar inimigos em aliados, em vez de cadáveres."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'971d88ef-4713-491f-8461-4898719fcde1\', \'multiverseId\': 631285}, \'multiverseid\': 631285}, {\'name\': \'崇文后裔威尔\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{T}：你本回合中施放的白色和／或蓝色咒语减少{X}来施放，X为你本回合中获得过的生命数量。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「高喊『荣耀万岁！』向异己兵戎相向并不困难。难的是用谋略巧思来化敌为友，而非赶尽杀绝。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09693e1-28c6-431c-9efb-13e0a4a01772\', \'multiverseId\': 631546}, \'multiverseid\': 631546}]', '[{\'name\': \'Will, Kind des Friedens\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{T}: Zaubersprüche, die du in diesem Zug wirkst und die weiß und/oder blau sind, kosten beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631730&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ac85e73-69bc-4bfb-8c94-2371cf724685\', \'multiverseId\': 631730}, \'multiverseid\': 631730}, {\'name\': \'Will, hijo de la paz\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\n{T}: Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar hechizos que sean blancos y/o azules este turno, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b358d3cd-6b49-49c3-a17a-f7fda406c4d0\', \'multiverseId\': 631739}, \'multiverseid\': 631739}, {\'name\': \'Will, scion de la paix\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\n{T} : Les sorts que vous lancez ce tour-ci qui sont blancs et/ou bleus coûtent {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés ce tour-ci. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4cad228-2784-4e84-a642-aa11b3d23ff5\', \'multiverseId\': 631748}, \'multiverseid\': 631748}, {\'name\': \'Will, Erede della Pace\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\n{T}: Le magie che lanci in questo turno e che sono bianche e/o blu costano {X} in meno per essere lanciate, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3231a380-87d7-46e9-981f-a568392206e1\', \'multiverseId\': 631757}, \'multiverseid\': 631757}, {\'name\': \'平和の世継ぎ、ウィル\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{T}：このターン、あなたが白や青である呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘは、このターンにあなたが得たライフの合計に等しい。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8752b33-aa71-417a-8de8-68c085b850fc\', \'multiverseId\': 631766}, \'multiverseid\': 631766}, {\'name\': \'Will, Herdeiro da Paz\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\n{T}: As mágicas que você conjura neste turno brancas e/ou azuis custam {X} a menos para conjurar, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e2fae5-9c6b-4172-aa5d-01141c7361f2\', \'multiverseId\': 631775}, \'multiverseid\': 631775}, {\'name\': \'崇文后裔威尔\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{T}：你本回合中施放的白色和／或蓝色咒语减少{X}来施放，X为你本回合中获得过的生命数量。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ea8dc3-3350-4964-8fdc-28acbd48f39d\', \'multiverseId\': 631784}, \'multiverseid\': 631784}]', "[{'name': 'Willkommen in Süßholzen', 'text': '(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nII — Erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein.\\nIII — Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, wobei X gleich eins plus der Anzahl an Speisen ist, die du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629960&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7850c193-46ea-49d3-b023-d478886a9423', 'multiverseId': 629960}, 'multiverseid': 629960}, {'name': 'Bienvenidos a Villadulces', 'text': '(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Crea una ficha de criatura Humano blanca 1/1.\\nII — Crea una ficha de Comida.\\nIII — Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas, donde X es uno más la cantidad de Comidas que controlas.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630221&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '922e0900-a56b-4e11-8356-06a7aef820b5', 'multiverseId': 630221}, 'multiverseid': 630221}, {'name': 'Bienvenue à Dentcariée', 'text': '(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\\nII — Créez un jeton Nourriture.\\nIII — Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, X étant un plus le nombre de nourritures que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Enchantement — saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630482&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc308a06-3429-4381-a397-1bdcc0e6253f', 'multiverseId': 630482}, 'multiverseid': 630482}, {'name': 'Benvenuti a Saccarosia', 'text': '(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Crea una pedina creatura Umano 1/1 bianca.\\nII — Crea una pedina Cibo.\\nIII — Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli, dove X è uno più il numero di Cibi che controlli.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630743&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3381064d-9cba-4993-bb3b-d3ac9d77f9db', 'multiverseId': 630743}, 'multiverseid': 630743}, {'name': '甘歯村へようこそ', 'text': '（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — 白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nII — 食物・トークン１つを生成する。\\nIII — あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘは、あなたがコントロールしている食物の数に１を足した値に等しい。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631004&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40b1f9e6-f969-49f5-afbd-cde6635c5c2e', 'multiverseId': 631004}, 'multiverseid': 631004}, {'name': 'Boas-vindas a Docelândia', 'text': '(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Crie uma ficha de criatura Humano branca 1/1.\\nII — Crie uma ficha de Comida.\\nIII — Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla, sendo X um mais o número de Comidas que você controla.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631265&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe46ca83-f716-444c-afec-55081ea3741a', 'multiverseId': 631265}, 'multiverseid': 631265}, {'name': '甘饴村迎客', 'text': '（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 派出一个1/1白色人类衍生生物。\\nII — 派出一个食品衍生物。\\nIII — 在目标由你操控的生物上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为由你操控的食品数量加一。', 'type': '结界 — 传纪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631526&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8943e896-c722-4686-81aa-2046c85a0923', 'multiverseId': 631526}, 'multiverseid': 631526}]", '[{\'name\': \'Woodland Acolyte // Heilung der Wildnis\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Waldland-Tempeldiener ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Er kehrte dem Ritterstand den Rücken, um die Narben der Invasion zu heilen.\', \'faceName\': \'Woodland Acolyte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630003&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea569155-4cdf-4875-91c1-5574a6b9a77b\', \'multiverseId\': 630003}, \'multiverseid\': 630003}, {\'name\': \'Woodland Acolyte // Sanar las tierras\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Acólito forestal entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Abandonó la orden de caballería para sanar las cicatrices de la invasión.\', \'faceName\': \'Woodland Acolyte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e42378-1937-4c19-91c9-036b105214d5\', \'multiverseId\': 630264}, \'multiverseid\': 630264}, {\'name\': \'Woodland Acolyte // Restaurer les friches\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Acolyte des sylves arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Il abandonna la chevalerie pour guérir les cicatrices de l\'invasion.", \'faceName\': \'Woodland Acolyte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630525&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4716a8cb-4973-4ec0-8625-1190c81aa040\', \'multiverseId\': 630525}, \'multiverseid\': 630525}, {\'name\': \'Woodland Acolyte // Curare le Terre Selvagge\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Accolito delle Selve entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': "Ha abbandonato la vita da cavaliere per curare le ferite dell\'invasione.", \'faceName\': \'Woodland Acolyte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'275ecd5b-4dad-4c31-acc5-85ed48f62833\', \'multiverseId\': 630786}, \'multiverseid\': 630786}, {\'name\': \'Woodland Acolyte // 僻（へき）境（きょう）の修（しゅう）繕（ぜん）\', \'text\': \'森林地の侍祭が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'彼は侵攻の傷を癒すために、騎士道精神を棄てた。\', \'faceName\': \'Woodland Acolyte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74f2474e-86e0-4587-9085-8fb14a9ab382\', \'multiverseId\': 631047}, \'multiverseid\': 631047}, {\'name\': \'Woodland Acolyte // Curar as Terras Selvagens\', \'text\': \'Quando Acólito das Matas entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Ele abandonou a cavalaria para curar as cicatrizes da invasão.\', \'faceName\': \'Woodland Acolyte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fb3f1cd-458a-477e-acbe-cc5740344cf0\', \'multiverseId\': 631308}, \'multiverseid\': 631308}, {\'name\': \'Woodland Acolyte // 修补幻野\', \'text\': \'当林地侍僧进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'他毅然抛弃骑士身份，全心疗愈大侵攻的创痕。\', \'faceName\': \'Woodland Acolyte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c174d577-7172-47c4-a038-7407ae92bfda\', \'multiverseId\': 631569}, \'multiverseid\': 631569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wurzelreiter-Faun\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Füße der Menschen eignen sich zum Klettern gar nicht schlechter als Hufe. Es ist ihre zögerliche, misstrauische Persönlichkeit, die ihnen im Weg steht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629944&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fe22670-79a8-4e7a-846b-0d94a7e93214\', \'multiverseId\': 629944}, \'multiverseid\': 629944}, {\'name\': \'Fauna trotarraíces\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los pies humanos no son peores que las pezuñas para escalar. El problema es que los humanos tienen personalidades mediocres y desconfiadas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a74f29c-8167-438e-a5df-718bff8eda56\', \'multiverseId\': 630205}, \'multiverseid\': 630205}, {\'name\': \'Faune coureracine\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Créature — satyre et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "« Les pieds humains ne sont pas inférieurs aux sabots pour escalader. C\'est leur personnalité lourde et suspicieuse qui les retient. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d0aa9f4-723f-4dd6-ad65-542383639e3a\', \'multiverseId\': 630466}, \'multiverseid\': 630466}, {\'name\': \'Fauna Solcaradici\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'"I piedi umani non sono inferiori agli zoccoli per arrampicarsi. Sono le loro personalità arrancanti e diffidenti a fernarli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef06ede3-9d24-4778-abfd-e5a672ae6118\', \'multiverseId\': 630727}, \'multiverseid\': 630727}, {\'name\': \'根乗りのフォーン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「木登りにおいて人間の足は蹄に劣っているわけじゃない。彼らが劣っているのは鈍臭くて疑り深いことさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75590ffb-6447-4297-8fbb-06bda113e63d\', \'multiverseId\': 630988}, \'multiverseid\': 630988}, {\'name\': \'Fauna Galga-raiz\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {G}.\\n{1}, {T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"Os pés humanos não são piores que os cascos para escalar. São suas personalidades pesadas e desconfiadas que os limitam."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef9e4dae-2e0b-40d8-980f-e605eb241a93\', \'multiverseId\': 631249}, \'multiverseid\': 631249}, {\'name\': \'根行羊怪\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 羊蹄人／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「人类的双脚在攀爬时并不比蹄子来得差。他们是因背负重压、生性多疑而畏缩不前。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9026a290-a2ad-4de8-bacc-99b0e63a8490\', \'multiverseId\': 631510}, \'multiverseid\': 631510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yenna, Rotzahn-Regentin\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Bestimme eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst und die nicht denselben Namen hat wie eine andere bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst. Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er nicht legendär ist. Falls der Spielstein eine Aura ist, enttappe Yenna, Rotzahn-Regentin, und wende dann Hellsicht 2 an. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Mein Volk ist gleichzeitig Blüte und Dorn."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629981&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55d795cb-b3a7-4052-84ac-a37c0390e0d1\', \'multiverseId\': 629981}, \'multiverseid\': 629981}, {\'name\': \'Yenna, regente de Dienterrojo\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Elige el encantamiento objetivo que controlas y que no tiene el mismo nombre que otro permanente que controlas. Crea una ficha que es una copia de ese encantamiento, excepto que no es legendaria. Si la ficha es un Aura, endereza a Yenna, regente de Dienterrojo y luego adivina 2. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi gente es flor y espina a la vez".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0056eea0-b6bf-48ee-9387-91b69afc7769\', \'multiverseId\': 630242}, \'multiverseid\': 630242}, {\'name\': \'Yenna, régente de Croc-rouge\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Choisissez un enchantement ciblé que vous contrôlez qui n\'a pas le même nom qu\'un autre permanent que vous contrôlez. Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté qu\'il n\'est pas légendaire. Si le jeton est une aura, dégagez Yenna, régente de Croc-rouge, puis regard 2. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': "« Mon peuple est à la fois la fleur et l\'épine. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630503&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cef41c5-50b6-4f1b-9598-97ad7d22c28d\', \'multiverseId\': 630503}, \'multiverseid\': 630503}, {\'name\': \'Yenna, Reggente di Zannarossa\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}: Scegli un incantesimo bersaglio che controlli e che non ha lo stesso nome di un altro permanente che controlli. Crea una pedina che è una sua copia, tranne che non è leggendario. Se la pedina è un\'Aura, STAPpa Yenna, Reggente di Zannarossa, poi profetizza 2. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La mia gente è fatta allo stesso modo dei germogli e delle spine."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d51ba0d9-392a-4eaa-b34c-6aa7ead280f1\', \'multiverseId\': 630764}, \'multiverseid\': 630764}, {\'name\': \'赤歯の執政、イェナ\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていて、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないパーマネントと同じ名前を持たないエンチャント１つを対象とする。伝説でないことを除き、それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。そのトークンがオーラであるなら、赤歯の執政、イェナをアンタップし、その後、占術２を行う。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「私の民は、花でも茨でもあります。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f151f25-d646-43ec-be0e-86ce758ddff6\', \'multiverseId\': 631025}, \'multiverseid\': 631025}, {\'name\': \'Yenna, Regente de Rubrodente\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Escolha o encantamento alvo que você controla que não tenha o mesmo nome que outra permanente que você controla. Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, exceto por não ser lendária. Se a ficha for uma Aura, desvire Yenna, Regente de Rubrodente, e depois use vidência 2. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'"Meu povo é tanto flor quanto espinho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84867f62-c1e2-4811-92a6-69c548e7432e\', \'multiverseId\': 631286}, \'multiverseid\': 631286}, {\'name\': \'赤牙砦摄政叶娜\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：选择目标由你操控的结界，且其不能与由你操控的其他永久物同名。派出一个为其复制品的衍生物，但它不是传奇。如果该衍生物是灵气，则重置赤牙砦摄政叶娜，然后占卜2。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「我的子民花中带刺。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd60843e-a8ed-434e-96a0-36051accb6ed\', \'multiverseId\': 631547}, \'multiverseid\': 631547}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yenna, Rotzahn-Regentin\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Bestimme eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst und die nicht denselben Namen hat wie eine andere bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst. Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er nicht legendär ist. Falls der Spielstein eine Aura ist, enttappe Yenna, Rotzahn-Regentin, und wende dann Hellsicht 2 an. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631898&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4c1c8a3-4eef-4e73-85cb-87b931fc2eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 631898}, \'multiverseid\': 631898}, {\'name\': \'Yenna, régente de Croc-rouge\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Choisissez un enchantement ciblé que vous contrôlez qui n\'a pas le même nom qu\'un autre permanent que vous contrôlez. Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté qu\'il n\'est pas légendaire. Si le jeton est une aura, dégagez Yenna, régente de Croc-rouge, puis regard 2. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631945&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaf3c33a-4b3e-45e4-8523-95db33d83bb8\', \'multiverseId\': 631945}, \'multiverseid\': 631945}, {\'name\': \'赤歯の執政、イェナ\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていて、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないパーマネントと同じ名前を持たないエンチャント１つを対象とする。伝説でないことを除き、それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。そのトークンがオーラであるなら、赤歯の執政、イェナをアンタップし、その後、占術２を行う。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6814fe8-9b38-45b4-b609-517976d4a61c\', \'multiverseId\': 631992}, \'multiverseid\': 631992}, {\'name\': \'赤牙砦摄政叶娜\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：选择目标由你操控的结界，且其不能与由你操控的其他永久物同名。派出一个为其复制品的衍生物，但它不是传奇。如果该衍生物是灵气，则重置赤牙砦摄政叶娜，然后占卜2。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e35dfe3-a9f8-4e9a-85c0-b4733eab68bb\', \'multiverseId\': 632039}, \'multiverseid\': 632039}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zauberbuchhändlerin\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug kannst du {1} bezahlen. Wenn du dies tust, erzeuge einen Magier-Rolle-Spielstein, angelegt an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. (Falls du bereits eine andere daran angelegte Rolle kontrollierst, lege die alte Rolle auf den Friedhof. Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, wende Hellsicht 1 an.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629793&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e534e650-271c-40bf-b269-e139e349e98a\', \'multiverseId\': 629793}, \'multiverseid\': 629793}, {\'name\': \'Vendedora de libros de hechizos\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, puedes pagar {1}. Cuando lo hagas, crea una ficha de Papel de Mago anexada a la criatura objetivo que controlas. (Si controlas otro Papel sobre ella, pon ese en el cementerio. La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, adivina 1".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Plebeyo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d59ac352-16f1-40d7-84d8-3e76314c76e3\', \'multiverseId\': 630054}, \'multiverseid\': 630054}, {\'name\': \'Vendeuse de grimoires\', \'text\': \'Vigilance\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, vous pouvez payer {1}. Quand vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de rôle Ensorceleur attaché à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. (Si vous contrôlez un autre rôle sur elle, mettez-le au cimetière. La créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, regard 1. »)\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et paysan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630315&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94705884-e482-40ea-a2b5-c5be4914a7aa\', \'multiverseId\': 630315}, \'multiverseid\': 630315}, {\'name\': \'Venditrice di Libri degli Incantesimi\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nAll\\\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, puoi pagare {1}. Quando lo fai, crea una pedina Ruolo Stregone assegnata a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. (Se controlli un altro Ruolo assegnato a quella creatura, metti quel Ruolo nel cimitero. La creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, profetizza 1".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Popolano Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eabc52b1-608e-44dc-ad4c-6d3374a827e1\', \'multiverseId\': 630576}, \'multiverseid\': 630576}, {\'name\': \'呪文書売り\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。魔術師・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。（あなたがコントロールしている役割がすでにそれについていたなら、その役割を墓地に置く。エンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、占術１を行う。」を持つ。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・農民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3411bd9c-2866-496b-9369-3205397a3c13\', \'multiverseId\': 630837}, \'multiverseid\': 630837}, {\'name\': \'Vendedora de Grimórios\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, você pode pagar {1}. Quando fizer isso, crie uma ficha de Papel de Feiticeiro anexada à criatura alvo que você controla. (Se você controlar outro Papel nela, coloque aquele no cemitério. A criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem "Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, use vidência 1".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Plebeu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc48ee29-e0b5-4902-a7b6-f54974dcea4c\', \'multiverseId\': 631098}, \'multiverseid\': 631098}, {\'name\': \'咒语书贩商\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，你可以支付{1}。当你如此作时，派出一个术士角色衍生物，并贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。（如果其上已有另一个你操控的角色，则将已有之角色置入坟墓场。所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有「每当此生物攻击时，占卜1。」）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／平民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6288e49a-4591-434d-a403-cb0bb9aaab93\', \'multiverseId\': 631359}, \'multiverseid\': 631359}]', "[{'name': 'Zauberbuchhändlerin', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug kannst du {1} bezahlen. Wenn du dies tust, erzeuge einen Magier-Rolle-Spielstein, angelegt an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Gesinde', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631860&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f4e5f22-c35c-48ed-86a3-ed65dea07be4', 'multiverseId': 631860}, 'multiverseid': 631860}, {'name': 'Vendeuse de grimoires', 'text': 'Vigilance\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, vous pouvez payer {1}. Quand vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de rôle Ensorceleur attaché à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Créature — humain et paysan', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631907&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f9edc05-f22e-478d-9e74-8131c112dc52', 'multiverseId': 631907}, 'multiverseid': 631907}, {'name': '呪文書売り', 'text': '警戒\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。魔術師・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・農民', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631954&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dcb4b306-ad34-4b7f-90cc-0917d381d8c0', 'multiverseId': 631954}, 'multiverseid': 631954}, {'name': '咒语书贩商', 'text': '警戒\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，你可以支付{1}。当你如此作时，派出一个术士角色衍生物，并贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。', 'type': '生物 — 人类／平民', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632001&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c10b70c9-df63-4989-9fde-4946d1a62d1f', 'multiverseId': 632001}, 'multiverseid': 632001}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zauberhafte Ausstatterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Zauberhafte Ausstatterin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Königlich-Rolle-Spielstein, angelegt an eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. (Falls du bereits eine andere daran angelegte Rolle kontrollierst, lege die alte Rolle auf den Friedhof. Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat Abwehr {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629768&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'876adf8b-288f-472b-8558-c66664aa1c63\', \'multiverseId\': 629768}, \'multiverseid\': 629768}, {\'name\': \'Sastre encantada\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Sastre encantada entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Papel de Majestad anexada a otra criatura objetivo que controlas. (Si controlas otro Papel sobre ella, pon ese en el cementerio. La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de rebatir {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7244dee1-c859-49cc-943a-7045412d8bac\', \'multiverseId\': 630029}, \'multiverseid\': 630029}, {\'name\': \'Drapière enchantée\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand la Drapière enchantée arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de rôle Royal attaché à une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. (Si vous contrôlez un autre rôle sur elle, mettez-le au cimetière. La créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a parade {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Créature — peuple fée et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630290&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744e1fed-67d9-456a-8be7-edda6d04d1ab\', \'multiverseId\': 630290}, \'multiverseid\': 630290}, {\'name\': \'Sarta Incantata\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando la Sarta Incantata entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Ruolo Regale assegnata a un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli. (Se controlli un altro Ruolo assegnato a quella creatura, metti quel Ruolo nel cimitero. La creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha egida {1}.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Spiritello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b78ea288-0251-48d6-a39e-dec8c7578ebe\', \'multiverseId\': 630551}, \'multiverseid\': 630551}, {\'name\': \'魅せられた衣服商\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n魅せられた衣服商が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。王族・役割・トークン１つをそれについた状態で生成する。（あなたがコントロールしている役割がすでにそれについていたなら、その役割を墓地に置く。エンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け護法{1}を持つ。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc1e8e8-f4ee-4582-958d-2bfc0962f7fe\', \'multiverseId\': 630812}, \'multiverseid\': 630812}, {\'name\': \'Costureira Encantada\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Costureira Encantada entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Papel de Real anexada a outra criatura alvo que você controla. (Se você controlar outro Papel nela, coloque aquele no cemitério. A criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem salvaguarda {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4e2e45d-1b0b-4c44-8f47-4be957d9efc3\', \'multiverseId\': 631073}, \'multiverseid\': 631073}, {\'name\': \'施魅织服灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当施魅织服灵进战场时，派出一个皇族角色衍生物，并贴附在另一个目标由你操控的生物上。（如果其上已有另一个你操控的角色，则将已有之角色置入坟墓场。所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有守护{1}。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 仙灵／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0523b352-9ec6-4fa1-9566-9fab96467178\', \'multiverseId\': 631334}, \'multiverseid\': 631334}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zuckerrausch\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich rieche Zuckerguss. Zieht eure Waffen!"\\n—Greta, Geißel von Süßholzen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629872&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b577412-7007-4133-b648-8df88931cbd7\', \'multiverseId\': 629872}, \'multiverseid\': 629872}, {\'name\': \'Subida de azúcar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Huelo a glaseado. ¡Preparen las armas!".\\n—Greta, el Terror de Villadulces\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1116b79-8914-4604-b933-faef94e3309e\', \'multiverseId\': 630133}, \'multiverseid\': 630133}, {\'name\': \'Rage de sucre\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +3/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Ça sent le glaçage. Sortez vos armes ! »\\n—Greta, plaie de Dentcariée\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630394&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1aebaa0-96e0-43b5-b0be-936431e454c6\', \'multiverseId\': 630394}, \'multiverseid\': 630394}, {\'name\': \'Picco di Zuccheri\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sento profumo di glassa. Impugnate le armi!"\\n—Greta, Flagello di Saccarosia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d5ee5c0-57fd-436c-860c-841dedc8dba1\', \'multiverseId\': 630655}, \'multiverseid\': 630655}, {\'name\': \'シュガーラッシュ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「砂糖衣の匂いがする。みんな、武器を構えて！」\\n――甘歯村の断罪人、グレタ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'104ef34d-e372-42d3-9ece-c5c8d477aaa1\', \'multiverseId\': 630916}, \'multiverseid\': 630916}, {\'name\': \'Frenesi do Açúcar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+0 até o final do turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Sinto cheiro de cobertura. Preparem as armas!"\\n— Greta, Flagelo de Docelândia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12f2855a-bc2d-47a5-b475-dc25bbf27454\', \'multiverseId\': 631177}, \'multiverseid\': 631177}, {\'name\': \'食糖冲劲\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+3/+0直到回合结束。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我闻到了霜雾中的甜味。备战！」\\n～甘饴村之灾格蕾特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b78d340-6b91-4128-ab7b-8aa4ba9ba541\', \'multiverseId\': 631438}, \'multiverseid\': 631438}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zurück für Nachschlag\', \'text\': \'Feilschen (Du kannst ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder einen Spielstein opfern, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nBringe bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Falls um diesen Zauberspruch gefeilscht wurde, kannst du davon eine Karte mit Manabetrag 4 oder weniger ins Spiel bringen, anstatt sie auf deine Hand zu nehmen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629842&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3e2f1a2-d7dc-4976-b352-1eb9551ac6bf\', \'multiverseId\': 629842}, \'multiverseid\': 629842}, {\'name\': \'Regresar a por más\', \'text\': \'Negociar. (Puedes sacrificar un artefacto, encantamiento o ficha al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nRegresa hasta dos cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano. Si este hechizo fue negociado, puedes poner una de esas cartas con valor de maná de 4 o menos en el campo de batalla en vez de ponerla en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f6bb648-c1b2-4581-9aed-b0e4ff5420e8\', \'multiverseId\': 630103}, \'multiverseid\': 630103}, {\'name\': \'On se ressert\', \'text\': "Négociation (Vous pouvez sacrifier un artefact, un enchantement ou un jeton au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nRenvoyez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Si ce sort a été négocié, vous pouvez mettre l\'une de ces cartes avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 4 sur le champ de bataille à la place de la mettre dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630364&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4add492f-3d20-4da5-8691-f57938c4a6ce\', \'multiverseId\': 630364}, \'multiverseid\': 630364}, {\'name\': \'Tornare per il Bis\', \'text\': \'Negoziare (Puoi sacrificare un artefatto, un incantesimo o una pedina mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nRiprendi in mano fino a due carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Se questa magia è stata negoziata, puoi mettere una di quelle carte con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 4 sul campo di battaglia invece di aggiungerla alla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5799663-00bc-432e-af54-1f44dbc39fdf\', \'multiverseId\': 630625}, \'multiverseid\': 630625}, {\'name\': \'おかわり\', \'text\': \'協約（この呪文を唱えるに際し、アーティファクトやエンチャントやトークンのうち１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。）\\nあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を対象とする。それらをあなたの手札に戻す。この呪文が協約されていたなら、その中からマナ総量が４以下であるカード１枚をあなたの手札に加える代わりに戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfdca9b2-632f-4a1f-98f7-fe10a38ec4c9\', \'multiverseId\': 630886}, \'multiverseid\': 630886}, {\'name\': \'Voltar para Repetir\', \'text\': \'Negociar (Você pode sacrificar um artefato, um encantamento ou uma ficha conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nDevolva até dois cards de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão. Se esta mágica foi negociada, você pode colocar um daqueles cards com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 4 no campo de batalha, em vez de colocá-lo em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b27317b-a075-4229-aa4c-749e3c3155b0\', \'multiverseId\': 631147}, \'multiverseid\': 631147}, {\'name\': \'返身助力\', \'text\': \'加码（你施放此咒语时可以牺牲一个神器，结界或衍生物。）\\n将至多两张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。如果此咒语已加码，则你可以改为将其中一张法术力值等于或小于4的牌放进战场，而非置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81856fd0-03f8-4683-b389-f61b7692f343\', \'multiverseId\': 631408}, \'multiverseid\': 631408}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zäher Brocken\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Zähe Brocken ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\\n{2}{G}: Ein Nichtkreatur-Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 4/4 Artefaktkreatur.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere den Zähen Brocken: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Speise, Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629955&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c98d857-2903-402e-b037-e1dfdd270c0b\', \'multiverseId\': 629955}, \'multiverseid\': 629955}, {\'name\': \'Repartetortas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Repartetortas entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Comida. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\\n{2}{G}: El artefacto objetivo que no sea criatura que controlas se convierte en una criatura artefacto 4/4 hasta el final del turno.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Repartetortas: Ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem comida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'628bff3e-0537-4c55-87b1-352d7f81ab17\', \'multiverseId\': 630216}, \'multiverseid\': 630216}, {\'name\': \'Biscuit dur à cuire\', \'text\': "Quand le Biscuit dur à cuire arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Nourriture. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)\\n{2}{G} : Un artefact non-créature ciblé que vous contrôlez devient une créature-artefact 4/4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Biscuit dur à cuire : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — nourriture et golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b96fb523-4044-4757-a0bb-42ce1cd8a47c\', \'multiverseId\': 630477}, \'multiverseid\': 630477}, {\'name\': \'Tipo Tostato\', \'text\': \'Quando il Tipo Tostato entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Cibo. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\\n{2}{G}: Un artefatto non creatura bersaglio che controlli diventa una creatura artefatto 4/4 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Tipo Tostato: Guadagni 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem Cibo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'107aa51f-7126-4bbc-83cc-9a3ae7907ec8\', \'multiverseId\': 630738}, \'multiverseid\': 630738}, {\'name\': \'堅いクッキー\', \'text\': \'堅いクッキーが戦場に出たとき、食物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n{2}{G}：あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでないアーティファクト１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは４/４のアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\\n{2}, {T}, 堅いクッキーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 食物・ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=630999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ba01e2-e901-4e53-885a-159791035b1a\', \'multiverseId\': 630999}, \'multiverseid\': 630999}, {\'name\': \'Biscoito Durão\', \'text\': \'Quando Biscoito Durão entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Comida. (Ela é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida".)\\n{2}{G}: O artefato não criatura alvo que você controla se torna uma criatura artefato 4/4 até o final do turno.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Biscoito Durão: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Comida Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43120613-b6d2-459a-b439-a51fcf072387\', \'multiverseId\': 631260}, \'multiverseid\': 631260}, {\'name\': \'勇敢饼人\', \'text\': \'当勇敢饼人进战场时，派出一个食品衍生物。（它是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\\n{2}{G}：目标由你操控的非生物神器成为4/4神器生物直到回合结束。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲勇敢饼人：你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 — 食品／魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=631521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e09ee7f9-b1d2-4280-9df9-903cb3b4e0f4\', \'multiverseId\': 631521}, \'multiverseid\': 631521}]']
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AFR', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ALA', 'ANA', 'ANB', 'ARC', 'ARN', 'ATH', 'AVR', 'BBD', 'BFZ', 'BLB', 'BRB', 'BRC', 'BRO', 'BRR', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CST', 'DBL', 'DD1', 'DD2', 'DDC', 'DDD', 'DDE', 'DDF', 'DDG', 'DDH', 'DDI', 'DDJ', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDR', 'DDS', 'DDT', 'DDU', 'DKA', 'DKM', 'DMC', 'DMR', 'DMU', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DTK', 'DVD', 'E01', 'ELD', 'EVG', 'F12', 'F15', 'FBB', 'FRF', 'G17', 'GK1', 'GK2', 'GN2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GRN', 'GS1', 'GTC', 'GVL', 'H09', 'HBG', 'HOP', 'HOU', 'ICE', 'IKO', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ISD', 'ITP', 'J14', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JVC', 'KHM', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCC', 'LCI', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'LTR', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'MD1', 'ME1', 'ME3', 'ME4', 'MH2', 'MH3', 'MID', 'MIR', 'MKM', 'MM2', 'MMQ', 'MOC', 'MOM', 'MRD', 'NEO', 'NPH', 'ODY', 'OLEP', 'ONC', 'ONE', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'OTC', 'OTJ', 'P02', 'P23', 'PAL00', 'PAL01', 'PAL02', 'PAL03', 'PAL04', 'PAL05', 'PAL06', 'PAL99', 'PALP', 'PANA', 'PARL', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PCBB', 'PD2', 'PD3', 'PDGM', 'PELP', 'PF19', 'PF20', 'PGPX', 'PGRU', 'PHUK', 'PIP', 'PL24', 'PLST', 'PMEI', 'PMPS', 'PMPS06', 'PMPS07', 'PMPS08', 'PMPS09', 'PMPS10', 'PMPS11', 'POR', 'PPP1', 'PRIX', 'PRM', 'PRW2', 'PRWK', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PSS2', 'PSS3', 'PSS4', 'PTC', 'PTK', 'PTKDF', 'PW23', 'PWCS', 'PWOE', 'PZ2', 'RAV', 'REX', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RQS', 'RTR', 'S99', 'SCD', 'SCH', 'SHM', 'SIR', 'SIS', 'SLD', 'SNC', 'SOI', 'SOM', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TPR', 'TSP', 'TSR', 'UGL', 'UMA', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'VOW', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)\\nI — Create a 1/1 white Human creature token.\\nII — Create a Food token.\\nIII — Put X +1/+1 counters on target creature you control, where X is one plus the number of Foods you control.', '(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)\\nI — Create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.\\nII — You may sacrifice a creature. If you do, search your library for a creature or basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\nIII — Up to two target creatures each get +2/+2 and gain trample until end of turn.', '(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)\\nI — Create a Cursed Role token attached to up to one target creature. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature is 1/1.)\\nII — Scry 2.\\nIII — When you cast your next instant or sorcery spell with mana value 3 or less this turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', '(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)\\nI — Destroy target creature an opponent controls with mana value 2 or less.\\nII — Create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")\\nIII — Create a Wicked Role token attached to target creature you control.', "(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)\\nI — Exile up to one target creature.\\nII — Target creature you control gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.\\nIII — Return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", "(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)\\nI, II — Choose target nontoken creature you control that doesn't have the same name as a token you control. Create a token that's a copy of it, except it isn't legendary, is a Reflection in addition to its other types, and has haste.\\nIII — Sacrifice all Reflections you control.", '(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)\\nI, II — Create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")\\nIII — Exile the top three cards of target opponent\'s library. You may play those cards this turn.', "(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after IV.)\\nI — Create a 1/1 white Mouse creature token.\\nII, III — Create a token that's a copy of target token you control.\\nIV — Creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain vigilance until end of turn.", "Activated abilities of creatures you control cost {X} less to activate, where X is Agatha of the Vile Cauldron's power. This effect can't reduce the mana in that cost to less than one mana.\\n{4}{R}{G}: Other creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain trample and haste until end of turn.", "Any number of target enchanted creatures you control and up to one other target creature you control each deal damage equal to their power to target creature you don't control.", 'Artifacts you control have "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: It deals damage to any target equal to 1 plus the number of permanents named Food Fight you control."', "As long as it's your turn, Ratcatcher Trainee has first strike.", 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control a creature with power 4 or greater, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.', 'At the beginning of your end step, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control. Untap those creatures.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if an opponent controls more lands than you, create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")\\n{2}{W}: Choose another player. That player gains control of target Treasure you control. You draw a card.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.', 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying, haste\\nWhen Realm-Scorcher Hellkite enters the battlefield, if it was bargained, add four mana in any combination of colors.\\n{1}{R}: Realm-Scorcher Hellkite deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying\\nWhen High Fae Negotiator enters the battlefield, if it was bargained, each opponent loses 3 life and you gain 3 life.', 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nIf this spell was bargained, look at the top four cards of your library, then put up to two of them back on top of your library in any order and the rest into your graveyard.\\nYou draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', "Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nIf this spell was bargained, target land you control becomes a 3/3 Elemental creature with haste that's still a land.\\nSearch your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", "Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nKellan's Lightblades deals 3 damage to target attacking or blocking creature. If this spell was bargained, destroy that creature instead.", 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nLook at the top four cards of your library. If this spell was bargained, look at the top eight cards of your library instead. Put two of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nLook at the top twenty cards of your library. You may reveal up to two creature cards from among them. If this spell was bargained, put the revealed cards onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put the revealed cards into your hand. Then shuffle.', 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nReturn up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand. If this spell was bargained, you may put one of those cards with mana value 4 or less onto the battlefield instead of putting it into your hand.', "Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nSearch your library for a card, exile it face down, then shuffle. If this spell was bargained, you may cast the exiled card without paying its mana cost if that spell's mana value is 4 or less. Put the exiled card into your hand if it wasn't cast this way.", 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nStonesplitter Bolt deals X damage to target creature or planeswalker. If this spell was bargained, it deals twice X damage to that permanent instead.', 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nTarget creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. If this spell was bargained, that creature also gains flying and lifelink until end of turn.', 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nTarget creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn. If this spell was bargained, that creature gets -5/-5 until end of turn instead.', "Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nThis spell costs {1} less to cast if it's bargained.\\nCounter target spell.", "Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nThis spell costs {2} less to cast if it's bargained.\\nReturn target nonland permanent to its owner's hand. Draw a card.", "Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nThis spell costs {2} less to cast if it's bargained.\\nTrample\\nWhen Hamlet Glutton enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.", 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nTorch the Tower deals 2 damage to target creature or planeswalker. If this spell was bargained, instead it deals 3 damage to that permanent and you scry 1.\\nIf a permanent dealt damage by Torch the Tower would die this turn, exile it instead.', "Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nTrample\\nWhen Agatha's Champion enters the battlefield, if it was bargained, it fights up to one target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Diminisher Witch enters the battlefield, if it was bargained, create a Cursed Role token attached to target creature an opponent controls. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature is 1/1.)', 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Tenacious Tomeseeker enters the battlefield, if it was bargained, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Bargain (You may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Troublemaker Ouphe enters the battlefield, if it was bargained, exile target artifact or enchantment an opponent controls.', 'Bargain\\nFlying, haste\\nWhen Realm-Scorcher Hellkite enters the battlefield, if it was bargained, add four mana in any combination of colors.\\n{1}{R}: Realm-Scorcher Hellkite deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Bargain\\nLook at the top four cards of your library. If this spell was bargained, look at the top eight cards of your library instead. Put two of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Bargain\\nLook at the top twenty cards of your library. You may reveal up to two creature cards from among them. If this spell was bargained, put the revealed cards onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put the revealed cards into your hand. Then shuffle.', "Bargain\\nSearch your library for a card, exile it face down, then shuffle. If this spell was bargained, you may cast the exiled card without paying its mana cost if that spell's mana value is 4 or less. Put the exiled card into your hand if it wasn't cast this way.", 'Bargain\\nTorch the Tower deals 2 damage to target creature or planeswalker. If this spell was bargained, instead it deals 3 damage to that permanent and you scry 1.\\nIf a permanent dealt damage by Torch the Tower would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'Callous Sell-Sword enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each creature that died under your control this turn.', 'Celebration — Armory Mice gets +0/+2 as long as two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control this turn.', 'Celebration — At the beginning of combat on your turn, if two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Pests of Honor.', "Celebration — At the beginning of combat on your turn, if two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control this turn, target creature you control gets +1/+0 and gains menace until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Celebration — Grand Ball Guest gets +1/+1 and has trample as long as two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control this turn.', 'Choose a number between 0 and 10. Destroy all creatures with power greater than or equal to the chosen number.', 'Choose one or more —\\n• Each player discards two cards.\\n• Each player loses 4 life.\\n• Each player sacrifices two creatures.', 'Choose one —\\n• Untap target creature. It gets +1/+0 and gains indestructible until end of turn.\\n• Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.', 'Choose two —\\n• Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\n• Create a 1/1 white Human creature token.\\n• Create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2} plus an additional {1} for each Faerie you control.', 'Counter target spell with mana value 4 or greater.', 'Create X 1/1 black Rat creature tokens with "This creature can\'t block." Creatures you control gain haste until end of turn.', "Create a Monster Role token attached to target creature you control. When you do, that creature fights up to one target creature you don't control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has trample. Creatures that fight each deal damage equal to their power to the other.)", 'Creature tokens you control get +1/+1.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn. Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies this turn, create a 1/1 black Rat creature token with "This creature can\'t block."', "Cruel Somnophage's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in all graveyards.", 'Cut In deals 4 damage to target creature.\\nCreate a Young Hero Role token attached to up to one target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature has "Whenever this creature attacks, if its toughness is 3 or less, put a +1/+1 counter on it.")', 'Deathtouch\\nWhenever Scream Puff deals combat damage to a player, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")', "Defender\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control a creature with power 4 or greater, Territorial Witchstalker gets +1/+0 until end of turn and can attack this turn as though it didn't have defender.", 'Defender\\n{T}: Unruly Catapult deals 1 damage to each opponent.\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, untap Unruly Catapult.', 'Destroy target creature or enchantment. Create a Wicked Role token attached to up to one target creature you control. (If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard. Enchanted creature gets +1/+1. When this Aura is put into a graveyard, each opponent loses 1 life.)', 'Destroy target creature with mana value 3 or less. If it\'s your turn, create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")', 'Destroy target enchantment. If a permanent you controlled or a token was destroyed this way, draw a card.', 'Destroy target nonland permanent. Its controller creates a 1/1 white Human creature token.', 'Destroy up to one target artifact, enchantment, or creature with flying. Create a Food token. (It\'s an artifact with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")', 'Double strike\\nOther creatures you control get +1/+0 for each Aura and Equipment attached to Kellan, the Fae-Blooded.', 'Draw three cards. Create a 1/1 blue Faerie creature token with flying and "This creature can block only creatures with flying."', 'Draw two cards.', "Each creature that's enchanted by an Aura you control can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, each opponent loses X life and you gain X life, where X is the number of Auras you control.", 'Edgewall Inn enters the battlefield tapped.\\nAs Edgewall Inn enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\n{T}: Add one mana of the chosen color.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Edgewall Inn: Return target card that has an Adventure from your graveyard to your hand.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.\\n{2}{W}: Exile enchanted creature.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2.\\n{4}{G}: Return Bestial Bloodline from your graveyard to your hand.', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Bitter Chill enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.\\n